text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "Activated abilities of artifacts your opponents control can't be activated.\\n[+1]: Until your next turn, up to one target noncreature artifact becomes an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its mana value.\\n[−2]: You may reveal an artifact card you own from outside the game or choose a face-up artifact card you own in exile. Put that card into your hand.", "Amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nYou and permanents you control gain hexproof until end of turn. (You and they can't be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "Amass Zombies 2, then the Army you amassed deals damage equal to its power to each non-Army creature. (To amass Zombies 2, put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", "Amass Zombies 3. (Put three +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", "Amass Zombies X, where X is the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard. (Put X +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", "Arlinn's Wolf can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.", 'Artifact, instant, and sorcery spells your opponents cast cost {1} more to cast.\\n[−1]: Until your next turn, prevent all damage that would be dealt to and dealt by target permanent an opponent controls.', 'As Devouring Hellion enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures and/or planeswalkers. If you do, it enters with twice that many +1/+1 counters on it.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards. Amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature or pay {3}{B}.\\nDestroy target creature or planeswalker.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature or planeswalker.\\nHeartfire deals 4 damage to any target.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nSearch your library for a creature card with mana value equal to 1 plus the sacrificed creature's mana value, put that card onto the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it, then shuffle.", "As long as it's your turn, Ahn-Crop Invader has first strike.\\n{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Ahn-Crop Invader gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", "As long as it's your turn, Gideon Blackblade is a 4/4 Human Soldier creature with indestructible that's still a planeswalker.\\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to Gideon Blackblade during your turn.\\n[+1]: Up to one other target creature you control gains your choice of vigilance, lifelink, or indestructible until end of turn.\\n[−6]: Exile target nonland permanent.", "As long as it's your turn, Pouncing Lynx has first strike.", "As long as it's your turn, creatures and planeswalkers you control have lifelink.\\n[+2]: Sorin, Vengeful Bloodlord deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n[−X]: Return target creature card with mana value X from your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature is a Vampire in addition to its other types.", "As long as it's your turn, creatures you control have first strike and equip abilities you activate cost {1} less to activate.\\n[−X]: Nahiri, Storm of Stone deals X damage to target tapped creature.", "At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if that player has one or fewer cards in hand, Davriel, Rogue Shadowmage deals 2 damage to them.\\n[−1]: Target player discards a card.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life and amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nWhenever a Zombie token you control with power 6 or greater attacks, it gains lifelink until end of turn.", 'Battalion — Whenever Makeshift Battalion and at least two other creatures attack, put a +1/+1 counter on Makeshift Battalion.', 'Blast Zone enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{X}{X}, {T}: Put X charge counters on Blast Zone.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Blast Zone: Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value equal to the number of charge counters on Blast Zone.', "Blindblast deals 1 damage to target creature. That creature can't block this turn.\\nDraw a card.", "Chandra's Pyrohelix deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.", "Chandra's Triumph deals 3 damage to target creature or planeswalker an opponent controls. Chandra's Triumph deals 5 damage instead if you control a Chandra planeswalker.", "Choose a creature or planeswalker you control. All damage that would be dealt this turn to you and permanents you control is dealt to the chosen permanent instead (if it's still on the battlefield).", 'Choose any number of target creature and/or planeswalker cards in graveyards. Command the Dreadhorde deals damage to you equal to the total mana value of those cards. Put them onto the battlefield under your control.', "Choose four. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Create a 2/2 Citizen creature token that's all colors.\\n• Return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n• Proliferate.\\n• You gain 4 life.", 'Choose one or both —\\n• Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n• Return target planeswalker card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Choose one or more —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Destroy target creature.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Destroy target land.\\n• Destroy target planeswalker.', 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.\\n• Exile target card from a graveyard.', "Choose one —\\n• Destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less.\\n• Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Choose one —\\n• Target player sacrifices an artifact.\\n• Target player sacrifices a creature.\\n• Target player sacrifices a planeswalker.', 'Choose up to four target cards in your graveyard. If you control a Bolas planeswalker, return those cards to your hand. Otherwise, an opponent chooses two of them. Leave the chosen cards in your graveyard and put the rest into your hand.\\nExile Deliver Unto Evil.', "Colorless spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.\\n[+1]: Exile the top card of your library face down and look at it. Create a 2/2 colorless Spirit creature token. When that token leaves the battlefield, put the exiled card into your hand.\\n[−3]: Destroy target permanent that's one or more colors.", "Copy target instant or sorcery spell, then return it to its owner's hand. You may choose new targets for the copy.", "Counter target creature or planeswalker spell. If that spell is countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard.\\nScry 1.", "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.\\nAmass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'Create X 2/2 white Soldier creature tokens with vigilance. If X is 10 or more, also create X 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying and vigilance.', 'Creature and planeswalker spells you cast have affinity for artifacts. (They cost {1} less to cast for each artifact you control.)\\n[+2]: Tezzeret, Master of the Bridge deals X damage to each opponent, where X is the number of artifacts you control. You gain X life.\\n[−3]: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n[−8]: Exile the top ten cards of your library. Put all artifact cards from among them onto the battlefield.', "Creatures you control get +1/+0.\\n[+1]: Add {R} or {G}. Creature spells you cast this turn can't be countered.\\n[−2]: Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control.", 'Creatures you control have haste.\\n[−1]: Target creature gets +2/+1 and gains haste until end of turn. Scry 1.', "Creatures you control have menace.\\n[−2]: Amass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'Creatures you control have vigilance.\\n[+1]: You gain 3 life.\\n[−2]: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control and a loyalty counter on each other planeswalker you control.', 'Deathtouch', 'Deathtouch, lifelink\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', "Deathtouch\\nWhen God-Eternal Rhonas enters the battlefield, double the power of each other creature you control until end of turn. Those creatures gain vigilance until end of turn.\\nWhen God-Eternal Rhonas dies or is put into exile from the battlefield, you may put it into its owner's library third from the top.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nWhen Wall of Runes enters the battlefield, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)", 'Destroy any number of target planeswalkers. Choose a planeswalker you control. Put two loyalty counters on it for each planeswalker destroyed this way.', 'Destroy target artifact or land.', 'Destroy target creature. Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Destroy up to three target creatures with toughness X or less. If X is 10 or more, return all creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Discard all the cards in your hand, then draw that many cards plus one. You gain life equal to the number of cards in your hand.', 'Divine Arrow deals 4 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', "Double strike\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, create a 4/4 black Zombie Warrior creature token with vigilance.\\nWhen God-Eternal Oketra dies or is put into exile from the battlefield, you may put it into its owner's library third from the top.", 'Draw X cards. If X is 10 or more, instead shuffle your graveyard into your library, draw X cards, untap up to five lands, and you have no maximum hand size for the rest of the game.\\nExile Finale of Revelation.', 'Draw two cards. If you control a Jace planeswalker, draw three cards instead.', "Duskmantle Operative can't be blocked by creatures with power 4 or greater.", 'Each creature deals damage to itself equal to its power.', 'Each creature you control assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power.\\n[−3]: You gain life equal to the greatest toughness among creatures you control.', "Each creature you control that's a Wolf or a Werewolf enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.\\n[−2]: Create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token.", 'Each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has "{T}: Add one mana of any color."\\n[−1]: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Each creature you control with power 4 or greater can't be blocked by more than one creature.", "Each opponent can cast spells only any time they could cast a sorcery.\\n[+1]: Until your next turn, you may cast sorcery spells as though they had flash.\\n[−3]: Return up to one target artifact, creature, or enchantment to its owner's hand. Draw a card.", "Each opponent can't draw more than one card each turn.\\n[−2]: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a noncreature, nonland card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", 'Each opponent sacrifices a creature. If you control a Liliana planeswalker, each opponent also discards a card.', "Each player chooses a creature or planeswalker they control, then sacrifices the rest. Players can't cast creature or planeswalker spells until the end of your next turn.", 'Each player mills four cards. Return up to two instant and/or sorcery cards from your graveyard to your hand. Exile Bond of Insight.', 'Enchant creature or planeswalker you control\\nWhen enchanted permanent dies or is put into exile, return that card to the battlefield under your control.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature loses all abilities and has base power and toughness 1/1.', 'Enchant land\\nWhen New Horizons enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.\\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Add two mana of any one color."', "Enter the God-Eternals deals 4 damage to target creature and you gain life equal to the damage dealt this way. Target player mills four cards. Amass Zombies 4. (Put four +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'Eternal Taskmaster enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhenever Eternal Taskmaster attacks, you may pay {2}{B}. If you do, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Exchange control of two target permanents that share a permanent type.', 'Exile all multicolored permanents.', 'Exile target creature, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Exile target permanent with mana value 4 or greater.', "Exile target permanent you control. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step. If it enters the battlefield as a creature, it enters with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.", 'Firemind Vessel enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add two mana of different colors.', "First strike\\nWhen Grim Initiate dies, amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'Flying', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhenever Trusted Pegasus attacks, target attacking creature without flying gains flying until end of turn.", 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, lifelink', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance\\nWhenever Parhelion II attacks, create two 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying and vigilance that are attacking.\\nCrew 4 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 4 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', 'Flying, trample\\nWhen Roalesk, Apex Hybrid enters the battlefield, put two +1/+1 counters on another target creature you control.\\nWhen Roalesk dies, proliferate, then proliferate again. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there. Then do it again.)', "Flying\\nAs Rescuer Sphinx enters the battlefield, you may return a nonland permanent you control to its owner's hand. If you do, Rescuer Sphinx enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.", "Flying\\nLands on the battlefield and land cards in graveyards can't be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control.\\nYour opponents can't play land cards from graveyards.", "Flying\\nWhen Aven Eternal enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'Flying\\nWhen Elite Guardmage enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life and draw a card.', 'Flying\\nWhen Merfolk Skydiver enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.\\n{3}{G}{U}: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', "Flying\\nWhen Niv-Mizzet Reborn enters the battlefield, reveal the top ten cards of your library. For each color pair, choose a card that's exactly those colors from among them. Put the chosen cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", "Flying\\nWhen Saheeli's Silverwing enters the battlefield, look at the top card of target opponent's library.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Grateful Apparition deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever Guildpact Informant deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, Sky Theater Strix gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets a creature you control, exile that card instead of putting it into your graveyard as it resolves. If you do, return it to your hand at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast your second spell each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Thunder Drake.', "Flying\\nYou may reveal the first card you draw each turn as you draw it. Whenever you reveal an instant or sorcery card this way, copy that card and you may cast the copy. That copy costs {2} less to cast.\\nWhen God-Eternal Kefnet dies or is put into exile from the battlefield, you may put it into its owner's library third from the top.", 'Flying\\n{1}: Shriekdiver gains haste until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{5}{W}, {T}: Other creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. Bond of Passion deals 2 damage to any other target.', 'Gateway Plaza enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Gateway Plaza enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Haste\\nWhen Goblin Assault Team dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', 'Haste\\nWhenever Dreadhorde Butcher deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, put a +1/+1 counter on Dreadhorde Butcher.\\nWhen Dreadhorde Butcher dies, it deals damage equal to its power to any target.', 'Haste\\nWhenever Rubblebelt Rioters attacks, it gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the greatest power among creatures you control.', 'Haste\\nWhenever you cast a spell that targets Tenth District Legionnaire, put a +1/+1 counter on Tenth District Legionnaire, then scry 1.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'If another red source you control would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals that much damage plus 1 to that permanent or player instead.\\n[−2]: Jaya, Venerated Firemage deals 2 damage to any target.', 'If you would draw a card while your library has no cards in it, you win the game instead.\\n[+1]: Target player mills two cards. Draw a card.\\n[−8]: Draw seven cards. Then if your library has no cards in it, you win the game.', "Jaya's Greeting deals 3 damage to target creature. Scry 1.", 'Landfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Lifelink', 'Lifelink, haste', 'Lifelink\\nWhen Charmed Stray enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control named Charmed Stray.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal a permanent card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order. You gain 3 life.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\nWhen Iron Bully enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.", "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\n{2}{B}, Sacrifice another creature or planeswalker: Put two +1/+1 counters on Dreadmalkin.", "Menace\\nWhen God-Eternal Bontu enters the battlefield, sacrifice any number of other permanents, then draw that many cards.\\nWhen God-Eternal Bontu dies or is put into exile from the battlefield, you may put it into its owner's library third from the top.", 'Menace\\nWhen Massacre Girl enters the battlefield, each other creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn. Whenever a creature dies this turn, each creature other than Massacre Girl gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God has all loyalty abilities of all other planeswalkers on the battlefield.\\n[+1]: You draw a card. Each opponent exiles a card from their hand or a permanent they control.\\n[−3]: Destroy target creature or planeswalker.\\n[−8]: Each opponent who doesn't control a legendary creature or planeswalker loses the game.", 'Orzhov Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', "Paradise Druid has hexproof as long as it's untapped. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.", 'Prevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to you and other permanents you control.\\n[−2]: Exile target creature with power 4 or greater.', 'Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control. You gain 1 life for each creature you control.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control. You may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Gideon, the Oathsworn, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.', "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. Then that creature deals damage equal to its power to target creature or planeswalker you don't control.", 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature, then proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. That creature gains first strike until end of turn. You gain 2 life.', "Put nine +1/+1 counters on target land you control. It becomes a legendary 0/0 Elemental creature with haste named Vitu-Ghazi. It's still a land.", "Put target creature with flying on the bottom of its owner's library.", "Put target nonland permanent on top of its owner's library.", "Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature you control. That creature can't be blocked this turn.", "Raging Kronch can't attack alone.", "Ral's Outburst deals 3 damage to any target. Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other into your graveyard.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Turret Ogre enters the battlefield, if you control another creature with power 4 or greater, Turret Ogre deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'Reach\\nWhen Arboreal Grazer enters the battlefield, you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped.', 'Reach\\nWhenever Snarespinner blocks a creature with flying, Snarespinner gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Remove up to five counters from target artifact, creature, planeswalker, or opponent.', "Return a creature you control to its owner's hand, then destroy all creatures.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste until your next turn.', "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.\\nAmass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", "Return up to two target creatures to their owner's hand. You may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Jace, Arcane Strategist, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.", "Sarkhan's Catharsis deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.", 'Scry 4, then draw two cards.', 'Search your library and/or graveyard for a creature card with mana value X or less and put it onto the battlefield. If you search your library this way, shuffle. If X is 10 or more, creatures you control get +X/+X and gain haste until end of turn.', 'Search your library for up to two basic Forest cards. If you control a Nissa planeswalker, instead search your library for up to three land cards. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two planeswalker cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Simic Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', "Sorin's Thirst deals 2 damage to target creature and you gain 2 life.", "Spells and abilities your opponents control can't cause their controller to search their library.\\n[−1]: Target player mills four cards. Then exile each opponent's graveyard.", "Spells and abilities your opponents control can't cause you to discard cards or sacrifice permanents.\\n[+1]: Choose a nonland card name, then reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all cards with the chosen name from among them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\\n[−3]: Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Spells your opponents cast cost {2} more to cast.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Spells your opponents cast that target a creature or planeswalker you control cost {2} more to cast.\\n[−2]: Create a 2/2 blue Wizard creature token. Draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Tap all creatures your opponents control. Creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.', "Tap target permanent. If it's an artifact, destroy it.\\nDraw a card.", 'Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+1 and gains haste until end of turn. Scry 1.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn. You gain 2 life.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -5/-5 until end of turn. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. That player discards that card.\\nAmass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature that attacked or blocked this turn. If you control a Gideon planeswalker, that player sacrifices two of those creatures instead.', 'Target player discards two cards and loses 2 life.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nCounter target noncreature spell.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nDraw two cards, then amass Zombies X, where X is the number of cards in your hand. (Put X +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'This spell costs {3} less to cast if you control a creature with power 4 or greater.\\nChange the target of target spell or ability with a single target.', 'Trample\\nBioessence Hydra enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each loyalty counter on planeswalkers you control.\\nWhenever one or more loyalty counters are put on planeswalkers you control, put that many +1/+1 counters on Bioessence Hydra.', 'Trample\\nWhen Thundering Ceratok enters the battlefield, other creatures you control gain trample until end of turn.', "Trample\\nWhenever Dreadhorde Arcanist attacks, you may cast target instant or sorcery card with mana value less than or equal to Dreadhorde Arcanist's power from your graveyard without paying its mana cost. If that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead.", "Trample\\nWhenever Ilharg, the Raze-Boar attacks, you may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped and attacking. Return that creature to your hand at the beginning of the next end step.\\nWhen Ilharg, the Raze-Boar dies or is put into exile from the battlefield, you may put it into its owner's library third from the top.", "Trample\\nWhenever Neheb, Dreadhorde Champion deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, you may discard any number of cards. If you do, draw that many cards and add that much {R}. Until end of turn, you don't lose this mana as steps and phases end.", "Trample\\nWhenever Storrev, Devkarin Lich deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, return to your hand target creature or planeswalker card in your graveyard that wasn't put there this combat.", 'Trample\\nWhenever a creature with power 4 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Kronch Wrangler.', 'Trample\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, Mizzium Tank becomes an artifact creature and gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\nCrew 1 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 1 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', "Ugin's Conjurant enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nIf damage would be dealt to Ugin's Conjurant while it has a +1/+1 counter on it, prevent that damage and remove that many +1/+1 counters from Ugin's Conjurant.", 'Untap all creatures you control. Creatures you control with flying get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Untap target creature. It gets +1/+4 and gains reach until end of turn.', 'Until end of turn, creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, destroy target artifact or enchantment defending player controls."', "Up to one target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn. Amass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'Up to two target creatures each get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Up to two target creatures you control each deal damage equal to their power to another target creature.', 'Vigilance, trample\\nIf one or more +1/+1 counters would be put on Mowu, Loyal Companion, that many plus one +1/+1 counters are put on it instead.', "Vigilance\\nWhen Huatli's Raptor enters the battlefield, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)", 'Vigilance\\nWhen Loxodon Sergeant enters the battlefield, other creatures you control gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'When Augur of Bolas enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an instant or sorcery card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'When Bloom Hulk enters the battlefield, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'When Bulwark Giant enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.', 'When Centaur Nurturer enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Cyclops Electromancer enters the battlefield, it deals X damage to target creature an opponent controls, where X is the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.', "When Dreadhorde Twins enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nZombie tokens you control have trample.", "When Eternal Skylord enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nZombie tokens you control have flying.", "When Fblthp, the Lost enters the battlefield, draw a card. If it entered from your library or was cast from your library, draw two cards instead.\\nWhen Fblthp becomes the target of a spell, shuffle Fblthp into its owner's library.", "When Gleaming Overseer enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nZombie tokens you control have hexproof and menace.", 'When Guild Globe enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Guild Globe: Add two mana of different colors.', "When Herald of the Dreadhorde dies, amass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", "When Invading Manticore enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", "When Kiora's Dambreaker enters the battlefield, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)", "When Lazotep Reaver enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)", 'When Mana Geode enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Martyr for the Cause dies, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'When Oath of Kaya enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.\\nWhenever an opponent attacks a planeswalker you control with one or more creatures, Oath of Kaya deals 2 damage to that player and you gain 2 life.', 'When Pollenbright Druid enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n• Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'When Prison Realm enters the battlefield, exile target creature or planeswalker an opponent controls until Prison Realm leaves the battlefield.\\nWhen Prison Realm enters the battlefield, scry 1.', "When Teyo's Lightshield enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.", "When Tibalt's Rager dies, it deals 1 damage to any target.\\n{1}{R}: Tibalt's Rager gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", 'When Tithebearer Giant enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "When Tolsimir, Friend to Wolves enters the battlefield, create Voja, Friend to Elves, a legendary 3/3 green and white Wolf creature token.\\nWhenever a Wolf enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 3 life and that creature fights up to one target creature you don't control.", "When Vizier of the Scorpion enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nZombie tokens you control have deathtouch.", "When Vraska's Finisher enters the battlefield, destroy target creature or planeswalker an opponent controls that was dealt damage this turn.", 'Whenever Cruel Celebrant or another creature or planeswalker you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "Whenever Krenko, Tin Street Kingpin attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it, then create a number of 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens equal to Krenko's power.", 'Whenever Silent Submersible deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, draw a card.\\nCrew 2 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 2 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', 'Whenever a creature attacks you or a planeswalker you control, each Dragon you control deals 1 damage to that creature.\\n[+1]: Until end of turn, each planeswalker you control becomes a 4/4 red Dragon creature and gains flying.\\n[−3]: Create a 4/4 red Dragon creature token with flying.', 'Whenever a creature with power 4 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.\\n[−1]: Untap target permanent.', 'Whenever a creature you control dies, draw a card.\\n[+1]: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\\n[−4]: Each player sacrifices two creatures.\\n[−9]: Each opponent chooses a permanent they control of each permanent type and sacrifices the rest.', 'Whenever a creature you control with deathtouch deals damage to a player or planeswalker, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.\\n[−2]: Create a 1/1 black Assassin creature token with deathtouch and "Whenever this creature deals damage to a planeswalker, destroy that planeswalker."', 'Whenever a player sacrifices a permanent, Mayhem Devil deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, Ob Nixilis, the Hate-Twisted deals 1 damage to that player.\\n[−2]: Destroy target creature. Its controller draws two cards.', 'Whenever another creature or planeswalker you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Rising Populace.', 'Whenever one or more loyalty counters are removed from Chandra, Fire Artisan, she deals that much damage to target opponent or planeswalker.\\n[+1]: Exile the top card of your library. You may play it this turn.\\n[−7]: Exile the top seven cards of your library. You may play them this turn.', "Whenever you attack with two or more non-Gideon creatures, put a +1/+1 counter on each of those creatures.\\n[+2]: Until end of turn, Gideon, the Oathsworn becomes a 5/5 white Soldier creature that's still a planeswalker. Prevent all damage that would be dealt to him this turn. (He can't attack if he was cast this turn.)\\n[−9]: Exile Gideon, the Oathsworn and each creature your opponents control.", 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Burning Prophet gets +1/+0 until end of turn, then scry 1.', "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, create a 1/1 colorless Servo artifact creature token.\\n[−2]: Target artifact you control becomes a copy of another target artifact or creature you control until end of turn, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types.", 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Spellgorger Weird.', 'Whenever you cast a planeswalker spell, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add two mana of different colors. Spend this mana only to cast planeswalker spells.', 'Whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell, Ral, Storm Conduit deals 1 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.\\n[+2]: Scry 1.\\n[−2]: When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "Whenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Jace's Projection.\\n{3}{U}: Put a loyalty counter on target Jace planeswalker.", "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.\\n[+1]: Draw a card.\\n[−7]: Creatures you control can't be blocked this turn.", "Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Ajani's Pridemate.", "Whenever you gain life, put two +1/+1 counters on Gideon's Company.\\n{3}{W}: Put a loyalty counter on target Gideon planeswalker.", 'Whenever you tap a Forest for mana, add an additional {G}.\\n[+1]: Put three +1/+1 counters on up to one target noncreature land you control. Untap it. It becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with vigilance and haste that\'s still a land.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Lands you control have indestructible." Search your library for any number of Forest cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "You have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\n[−2]: Create a 0/3 white Wall creature token with defender.", "You may cast creature spells as though they had flash.\\n[+1]: Until your next turn, up to one target creature gains vigilance and reach.\\n[−2]: Look at the top three cards of your library. Exile one face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order. For as long as it remains exiled, you may look at that card and you may cast it if it's a creature spell.", 'You may cast up to one target instant card and/or up to one target sorcery card from your graveyard each with mana value X or less without paying their mana costs. If a spell cast this way would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead. If X is 10 or more, copy each of those spells twice. You may choose new targets for the copies.', "You may have Spark Double enter the battlefield as a copy of a creature or planeswalker you control, except it enters with an additional +1/+1 counter on it if it's a creature, it enters with an additional loyalty counter on it if it's a planeswalker, and it isn't legendary.", 'You may look at the top card of your library any time.\\nYou may play lands and cast spells from the top of your library. If you cast a spell this way, pay life equal to its mana value rather than pay its mana cost.\\n{T}, Sacrifice ten nonland permanents: Each opponent loses 10 life.', "Your opponents and permanents your opponents control with hexproof can be the targets of spells and abilities you control as though they didn't have hexproof.\\n[−3]: Exile target creature.", 'Your opponents can\'t gain life.\\n[−2]: Create a 1/1 red Devil creature token with "When this creature dies, it deals 1 damage to any target."', '{1}, {T}: Tap target creature with mana value 2 or greater.', "{1}{R}, Discard a land card: Living Twister deals 2 damage to any target.\\n{G}: Return a tapped land you control to its owner's hand.", '{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Spellkeeper Weird: Return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}: Add one mana of any color.', '{3}, Sacrifice a creature or planeswalker: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', "{3}{G}: Look at the top card of your library. If it's a creature or planeswalker card, you may reveal it and put it into your hand. If you don't put the card into your hand, put it on the bottom of your library.", "{3}{R}: Target creature can't block this turn.", "{3}{U}: Ashiok's Skulker can't be blocked this turn.", '{6}{B}: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', '{T}, Remove a counter from an artifact, creature, land, or planeswalker you control: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Emergence Zone: You may cast spells this turn as though they had flash.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}: Mobilized District becomes a 3/3 Citizen creature with vigilance until end of turn. It's still a land. This ability costs {1} less to activate for each legendary creature and planeswalker you control.", '{X}, {T}, Discard a card: Look at the top X cards of your library. You may put a creature card with mana value X or less from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.']
flavor: ['"A company of infantry is trapped behind the lines. We need to strike hard and fast to free them, or the casualties will be horrific. Send the griffins."\\n—Tajic', '"After the people flee, but before the enemy arrives—that\'s grabbin\' time."', '"All I ask is complete obedience."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Be careful. You\'ll have more than Dovin to contend with if you hope to breach New Prahv."\\n—Lavinia, to Chandra Nalaar', '"Break their formation! Thin their ranks! I\'m right behind you!"', '"Even gods shall kneel."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"Fall back! You are no match for this."\\n—Samut', '"Fear writhes and whispers in the shadows of your mind. It is the enemy you always knew would come."\\n—Ashiok', '"Find out whose that is. I like its energy."\\n—Judith', '"For every inch of land they take from us, we take it back or we burn it. Give them nothing."\\n—Aurelia', '"For the Legion! For Ravnica!"', '"Give me a crew like this one and I\'d rule any sea I sailed."\\n—Angrath', '"Give them everything you\'ve got . . . and some things you don\'t."\\n—Ral Zarek', '"Grand city? No. This is nothing but another squalid cage."', '"Hop away now, little Eternal. Go eat some flies."\\n—Kasmina', '"Hopefully Ravnica will prove harder to break."\\n—Karn', '"I call upon the vigor of the grasses, the hopes of the flowers, and the dreams of the trees."', '"I can\'t protect everyone here. But those I can, I will."\\n—Karn', '"I don\'t care if it\'s an all-powerful relic or a street vendor\'s lucky charm. If it brings you courage, wear it."\\n—Saheeli Rai', '"I don\'t understand. He\'s normally so well behaved!"', '"I know I should be more concerned. But a big, blue zombie-potamus from beyond the stars? This is what they\'re invading us with?"\\n—Mileva, Boros legionnaire', '"I know they\'re unstoppable fighters created to harvest souls—it\'s just they\'re so rude about it."\\n—Kaya', '"I never liked you. Now get up—we have a fight to finish."', '"I recognize that headdress. This one was feared even by her fellow initiates."\\n—Samut', '"I see you\'re out of the wall."\\n—Nahiri', '"I see you\'ve learned nothing, Chandra. You\'d still put a match to something rather than understand it."', '"I think I cracked a fang."', '"I thought this was a civilized plane. How are there so many feral beasts?"\\n—Dovin Baan', '"I wish I could train a pack of them for hunting in the undercity. But I\'d never dare turn my back, and I hate to think what I\'d have to feed them."\\n—Zhosmir, urban huntmaster', '"I\'ve always said full war chests win wars, but I didn\'t mean by bashing enemy skulls with them."\\n—Teysa', '"I\'ve never seen the firemane angels so anxious."\\n—Tajic', '"If I am to die in service, there is no more worthy fight than this."', '"If the system is broken, break the system."\\n—Domri Rade', '"If we die, we die. But we cannot let him win."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"If you can\'t save yourself, you fight to give someone else a chance."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"If you don\'t speak wolf, allow me to translate: \'One step closer and I\'ll rip out your throat.\'"\\n—Arlinn Kord', '"In the disarray of battle, an enemy\'s attack may be your most convenient weapon."\\n—Narset', '"Inform our allies in the Tenth and throw the circuit. It\'s about to get weird."', '"It\'s faster than we are. Draw its attention while the Ledev take aim!"\\n—Shauntal, Boros legionnaire', '"It\'s strangely satisfying seeing an undead killing machine from another world standing befuddled in front of a wall of text."\\n—Lavinia', '"Let\'s lure the drakes to the webs over the Samok Stand. Keep the spiders content."\\n—Aurelia', '"My family was saved thanks to a single Boros soldier. It\'s why I joined the Legion. I will be the protector now."', '"Mystery is beauty. Within the unknown we plumb revelation."\\n—Vannifar', '"No one hero will save this day. Today we must all be heroes."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"No one will ever ride me again, Gideon. Expect no further favors."\\n—Rakdos', '"Now that I\'ve dealt with your little toys, I can focus on the real problem: you."\\n—Chandra Nalaar, to Dovin Baan', '"Now, little fighter, show me you deserved this second chance."', '"Of course you\'re being followed!"', '"Pardon me if I seem distracted. Part of me is reconnoitering the Tenth District."', '"Peril is in the eye of the beholder. At least, if your aim is good."\\n—Jaya Ballard', '"Precise, clean cuts. No one saw anything. Again. Tag the report with my code and file it."\\n—Lavinia', '"See that no one enters or leaves New Prahv today. And notify me at once of any Planeswalker activity."\\n—Dovin Baan', '"Seeing so much easy prey makes her crazy. See how she snorts and drools?"\\n—Dhuuz, kronch wrangler', '"So everyone gets what they truly deserve, I will keep watch."', '"So much wealth. So much splendor. So much temptation to believe the gilded lie."\\n—Kaya', '"Some bend the law. I tie it into knots."', '"Sometimes Mowu is content to gnaw on a bone. Sometimes he wants the whole skeleton."\\n—Jiang Yanggu', '"Thanks to my father, I know how to fight. He also showed me why I must."', '"The Eternals can recognize faces. They just think I look like a blue minotaur."', '"The Eternals had to endure Amonkhet\'s five trials. Let\'s see if they can pass the Trial of Ravnica."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"The Tenth is under heavy attack, but it\'s being handled. I sent Mileva."\\n—Tajic', '"The ancient places of Ravnica awaken, stirred by the hoofbeats of Ilharg!"\\n—Nikya of the Old Ways', '"The hero with the magic sword slays the dragon? Not this time."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"The primary weapon is nothing more than light. It shows them what they are, and they burn of their own accord."\\n—Aurelia', '"The safest place for you is not now."', '"There are many kinds of duty, and mine is to see our world grow and endure."', '"There is no future save the one my master wills."', '"There\'s something peculiar about the cats today."\\n—Janoc, Tin Street tinker', '"They are called Eternals. They will never stop."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"They make it clear we are nothing to them."\\n—Lavinia', '"They say nothing lasts forever. I say everything lasts forever, just not in the form you may be accustomed to."\\n—Vraska', '"This day will end in death, but not the one you hoped for. This day will end in victory, but not the one you expected."', '"Time to find the melting point of lazotep."\\n—Ral Zarek', '"To care for yourself, cultivate the world. To care for the world, cultivate yourself."', '"To comprehend the full answer requires years of temporal study. In short, they were now never born in the first place."\\n—Teferi', '"Today we throw off the yoke of death. Either this is an affirmation of the eternal cyclical nature of life, or it\'s just hilarious—depends on which of us you ask."', '"Together we can unlock secrets no one has even dreamed of. I might even let you remember some of them."', '"Track the source of those thopters," Saheeli told her creation. "And feel free to snack on as many as you want."', '"Tread upon these flower beds at your own peril."\\n—Emmara', '"War or no war, your donations are due, as always."', '"We agree that life should flourish. We disagree on the optimal number of limbs."', '"We agree that order benefits everyone, but not until you enforce it."', '"We fight to stop a tyrant, but we also fight for the gentle creatures who have no concept of what befalls their world."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"We have visitors? Well, it\'d be rude not to give them a traditional Keral Keep welcome."', '"We need to block the exits from the plaza! What\'s big, heavy, and available?"\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Welcome to the Legion. You saved a district—now let\'s go save the world."', '"What they don\'t know will definitely hurt them."\\n—Lazav', '"When civilization teeters on the brink, I\'ll be there to kick it the rest of the way."', '"When your enemy flees, send the sea to pursue them."\\n—Kiora', '"Where did she come from? More importantly, are there more like her?"\\n—Gideon Jura', '"Whichever side wins, I\'m sure the banquet will be superb."', '"Why don\'t we fight for what\'s right and let bureaucrats argue over details?"', '"Why would someone have built ... wait, never mind. Send it to the front lines!"\\n—Commander Grozdan', '"Would you give your life to save this world?" Gideon murmured. The pegasus snorted and spread wide its mighty wings.', '"Yes, nature is stronger. You don\'t see little buildings sprouting on trees."\\n—Emmara', '"You might have pleaded your case with my queen earlier. Now I am here, and it is far too late."', '"You once brought havoc to my home and ruined my mind. I\'m here to return the favor, Bolas."', '"You say this Tenth District, not Rubblebelt. But where smash happen, that Rubblebelt. Rubblebelt state of mind."\\n—Urgdar, cyclops philosopher', "A dictator's infuriating smirk, an affront to everything Ravnica stood for.", 'After millennia to craft victory, Bolas had eternity to contemplate defeat.', "Amonkhet's dead flowed into a new world in service to their God-Pharaoh.", 'An Izzet experiment begins with a "what if," gets approved with a "why not," and concludes with a "eureka!"', "As the Eternal's cold fingers tightened around his throat, Domri realized what kind of master he had rushed to serve.", "At Feather's command, squadrons of battle angels swarmed out of the *Parhelion II*, unsheathing blades made of molten dawn.", 'At least this was better than that week at the Juri Revue.', 'Beneath each gleaming mineral shell rots a once-proud warrior of Amonkhet.', 'Bolas cared little when his statue fell, thinking it a useful distraction, underestimating the surge of resolve it gave his opponents.', 'Common Gruul career aspirations: berserker, shaman, catapult.', 'Courier owls joined the fray, attacking the Dreadhorde with a viciousness usually reserved for mail thieves.', 'Death greeted the world with a roar of desert air.', 'Despite their many forms, the Eternals worked in chilling harmony, unburdened by instinct or emotion.', "Despite their stake in the city's survival, Rakdos cultists are loath to pass up any opportunity to sow chaos.", 'Elite training, single-minded devotion, and lazotep coating help only so much for invaders who are fundamentally bite-sized.', 'Even the clouds became a field of battle. Known as the Sky Theater, it saw the Eternals clash with squadrons of angels.', 'Every storm has an eye.', 'For most, war is a calamity. For some, an opportunity. And for the very few, a pleasure.', 'Freed from their respective labs, the two weirds formed a partnership, feeding on the arcane energies of war.', 'Gideon eyed the Dimir emissary warily. "Could your agents slip inside Bolas\'s citadel?" The figure met his gaze with icy resolve. "We already have."', 'Grief is a crucible where resolve is tempered.', 'Guild leaders focused their magic on the portal scar. Where the Chamber perished, a parun could be reborn.', 'He listens to the sounds of battle filtering down from above, waiting for silence, waiting for his time to claim the streets.', 'Her triumph came not from achieving her ideal self, but from rejecting the idea of perfection.', 'Her triumph came not from destroying the unnatural, but from fostering life.', 'Her triumph came not from escaping her death, but in claiming her independence.', 'His blessing is a curse.', 'His triumph came not from victory over his enemies, but from the salvation of those who survived.', "His triumph was not in outsmarting Bolas's plan, but in understanding why ultimate power is self-defeating.", 'His voice is both war horn and rallying cry, a trumpeting call that stirs even the faintest heart.', 'In life, they revered a diverse pantheon of gods. Now they revere only the God-Pharaoh.', 'In times of peril, the vision the ancient paruns had for their city comes into focus.', 'In times of war, only death flourishes.', "It didn't budge when the portal opened, nor when the ancient gods emerged. It came to life only when all ten guilds came together to face a common threat.", "It feeds on the dark energies that course through the deep world—and on any other creature lured by the leyline's pull.", "Jace surmised that they were walking into Bolas's trap. He felt no joy in being right.", 'Kytheon had known war every day of his life. Now he finally knew peace.', "Liliana seized the reins of Bolas's vast army, gritting her teeth behind the Chain Veil.", 'Liliana whispered to whatever consciousness Oketra and Bontu had left. "You are the gods. He is the usurper. You know what to do."', 'Looking over two city blocks of destruction, he could only cackle with pride.', 'Niv-Mizzet had perfected a plan, but he had no control over the mortal minds who had to agree to implement it.', 'Not even a threat to the entire Multiverse could persuade them to put aside their feud.', 'Planeswalkers conjured replicas of old allies, reminders of the homeworlds that would fall next if Bolas prevailed.', 'Ravnica held its breath as the hero of the resistance—their last hope—flew through the sky, his dark sword ready to strike a god.', "Ravnica's defenders watched in horror as Oketra's shot pierced the body of the pegasus. Gideon tumbled through the air, Blackblade in hand.", "Samut's war was intensely personal. Every hour she faced enemies she once loved as friends and horrors she once revered as gods.", "Shadows coiled around the witness's mind. Then the moment vanished, leaving only the sting of its loss.", "Soaring over Vitu-Ghazi, New Prahv, and Orzhova, the Conclave's trained falcons provided critical intelligence.", 'Some spells sing a quiet tune. Others roar.', 'Sometimes the strongest weapon you can hold in your hand is another hand.', 'Tamiyo wished only to observe the war, but she soon realized neutrality was not an option.', 'Teyo gifted his shields to as many allies as possible, knowing he could not always be there to protect them himself.', "The Eternal armies advanced on Vitu-Ghazi. At Nissa's command, Vitu-Ghazi advanced on them.", 'The Eternals found some sparks to be quite slippery.', "The Planar Bridge opened over the Chamber of the Guildpact, reducing the symbol of Ravnica's endurance to rubble.", 'The ancient Planeswalkers Sorin and Nahiri battled across Ravnica, their blows cutting as deep as their grudge.', "The archer's heart broke seeing her compatriots die far below, but she held position until the enemy was in range.", 'The arrival of the Planar Bridge caused eddies in the aether, creating some entirely new species while transforming others.', "The city mourned Niv-Mizzet's death, but he left behind the components for his rebirth.", 'The druid knew only one spell, a charm to encourage rapid plant growth. When airborne Eternals invaded her arboretum, she had to get creative.', "The essence of Ixalan was never far from Huatli's heart.", "The feline Eternal felt Liliana's command, looked at her disdainfully, flicked its paw, and scampered away across the rooftops.", 'The heart of Ravnica disappeared before anyone could strike a blow in its defense.', 'The mage looked within and realized there was still one piece of fuel to burn.', 'The moment Liliana defied Nicol Bolas, her contract was broken, and her life was forfeit. But she was free to choose her fate, and she decided it was worth the price.', 'The path to power is often paved with atrocities.', 'The sky boiled over the citadel, dire and dark. Then the angels brought the dawn.', "Their ranks are thin, their formation is improvised, their weapons are borrowed, and you'd best get out of their way.", "There's no crisis a hellion can't make worse.", 'They approach in formation, every movement efficient and sure. They halt, listen, and then press on in silent unison.', "They worked well as a team, but they knew it couldn't last forever.", "To Liliana's surprise, the cost of betraying Bolas did not fall on her.", 'Trapped on Ravnica with no affection for either side, Ob Nixilis sought gratification in random acts of torment.', "Ugin saw the gem that connected Bolas to his Meditation Realm as the key to his brother's downfall.", 'Under the veneer of the various guilds, each goblin has the same basic need: to run screaming at the enemy and hit a bunch of stuff.', 'Uthlon the Wise scandalized sphinx society, hooting the answers to riddles as he rampaged through Tin Street. Grangle, on the other hand, sat for hours, deep in thought, largely ignored by fellow goblins.', 'What he lacks in patience, intelligence, empathy, lucidity, hygiene, ability to follow orders, self-regard, and discernible skills, he makes up for in sheer chaotic violence.', "When you rule by fear, your greatest weakness is one who's no longer afraid.", 'Wherever Yanggu goes, Mowu follows—sometimes at his side, sometimes obscuring him from view entirely.', "With the harvest of Domri's spark, the Elderspell began to fuel Bolas's ascension to godhood."]
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Alayna Danner', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Konstad', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Bayard Wu', 'Bram Sels', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Ostrowski', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Chris Seaman', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'David Palumbo', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Even Amundsen', 'Eytan Zana', 'Filip Burburan', 'G-host Lee', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Heonhwa Choe', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jedd Chevrier', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johan Grenier', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Kimonas Theodossiou', 'Kirsten Zirngibl', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Livia Prima', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Behm', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Micah Epstein', 'Mike Bierek', 'Milivoj Ćeran', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'PINDURSKI', 'Piotr Dura', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Rowan', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stanton Feng', 'Steve Prescott', 'Sung Choi', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Titus Lunter', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tommy Arnold', 'Tyler Walpole', 'Uriah Voth', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'Wisnu Tan', 'YW Tang', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros']
