rulings: ["[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'If there are fewer than three cards in your library when Augur of Bolas’s ability resolves, you’ll look at the remaining cards. This won’t cause you to lose the game as you haven’t drawn from an empty library.'}, {'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You don’t reveal the other two cards, nor do you reveal their order on the bottom of the library.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Gate is not a basic land type.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The subtype Gate has no special rules significance, but other spells and abilities may refer to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-04-18', 'text': 'This free card preview was provided to Scryfall by Wizards of the Coast. Thank you!'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "A creature with 0 toughness doesn\'t die immediately. Rather, the creature dies the next time a player would receive priority. This means that any creatures whose toughness becomes 0 as Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield ability resolves will remain on the battlefield until just after the delayed triggered ability has been created."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Creatures that die while Massacre Girl\'s triggered ability is still on the stack won\'t cause its delayed triggered ability to trigger since that delayed triggered ability hasn\'t been created yet."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If more than one creature dies at once, Massacre Girl\'s delayed triggered ability triggers that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield triggered ability and its delayed triggered ability each affect only creatures on the battlefield at the time that those abilities resolve. Creatures that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn won\'t get -1/-1 unless the delayed triggered ability triggers and resolves again later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Once Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter whether Massacre Girl remains on the battlefield. The delayed triggered ability will be created as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. "}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "A split card that\'s an instant and a sorcery card may be the target of Finale of Promise twice. However, once you cast that card once, it can\'t be cast a second time."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'As Finale of Promise resolves, first you cast the target instant card and/or the target sorcery card in either order. Then, if X is 10 or more, you copy each of those twice and put the copies on the stack in any order. The copies will resolve before the original spells.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was cast, the division can\'t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can). The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one—" or the like), the copies will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Spark Harvest, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'The copies that Finale of Promise creates are created on the stack, so they\\\'re not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copies. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of Awakening of Vitu-Ghazi), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Mobilized District has been made a 0/0 creature with nine +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 12/12 Citizen creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If Mobilized District becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or activate its mana ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you control four or more legendary permanents that are creatures and/or planeswalkers, the last ability of Mobilized District costs no mana to activate. A legendary planeswalker that\'s also a creature reduces this cost by only {1}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "An activation cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {6} to activate Blast Zone\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Tokens that aren\'t a copy of something else don\'t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a mana value of 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Army is a new creature type. It\'s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it\'s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the token\'s power changes later in the turn after it has attacked, including while Dreadhorde Invasion\'s second ability is on the stack, it won\'t cause the token to gain or lose lifelink."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Some cards that cause you to amass also provide bonuses to “Zombie tokens.” These affect any token that happens to be a Zombie, not just a Zombie Army you\'ve amassed."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "The power of the Zombie token is checked only immediately after it attacks. Any other abilities that trigger when creatures you control attack won\'t have resolved yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Army is a new creature type. It\'s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it\'s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Some cards that cause you to amass also provide bonuses to “Zombie tokens.” These affect any token that happens to be a Zombie, not just a Zombie Army you\'ve amassed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Each target permanent is destroyed in the order specified. Abilities that trigger when one is destroyed won\'t be put onto the stack until Casualties of War has finished resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You can choose any number of the modes for Casualties of War, but you can\'t choose a mode more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Gideon\'s Sacrifice doesn\'t change the source of the damage or whether the damage is combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Gideon\'s Sacrifice has no effect on damage already dealt earlier in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the chosen creature or planeswalker isn\'t on the battlefield or isn\'t a creature or planeswalker at the time damage would be dealt, the damage won\'t be redirected."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you cast more than one Gideon\'s Sacrifice in one turn, all damage that would be dealt at once to you and/or permanents you control is dealt to one of the chosen permanents of your choice. It\'s not dealt to all of them, and you can\'t split the damage between them. The next time damage would be dealt to you, you may choose a different one of those permanents to be dealt that damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If you control no creatures or planeswalkers as Gideon\'s Sacrifice resolves, nothing happens. The damage redirection effect won\'t be able to be applied to any damage events."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'More damage can be redirected to the chosen creature than it has toughness or to the chosen planeswalker than it has loyalty, as long as that damage is all dealt at once (like combat damage is) or is all dealt while a single spell or ability is resolving.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If Chandra\'s Pyrohelix targets two creatures and one becomes an illegal target, the remaining target is dealt 1 damage, not 2."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as you cast Chandra\'s Pyrohelix, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. In other words, as you cast Chandra\'s Pyrohelix, you choose whether to have it deal 2 damage to a single target, or deal 1 damage to each of two targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If Krenko leaves the battlefield after its ability has triggered but before it resolves, you don\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it, but you do use its power as it last existed before it left the battlefield to determine how many Goblin tokens to create."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "The tokens created by Krenko\'s triggered ability aren\'t attacking. Because all attackers are chosen at once, a token created this way can\'t attack, even if it gains haste."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the land this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time New Horizons resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'You can cast New Horizons even if you control no creatures.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Makeshift Battalion and the other attacking creatures don\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Once Makeshift Battalion\'s ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter how many creatures are still attacking when that ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Once you cast the creature card, it leaves exile. You can\'t cast it again if that card becomes exiled again."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "While resolving Vivien\'s last ability, you must exile one of the three cards, even if none of them are creature cards. You may look at the exiled card at any time, even if it\'s not a creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You must follow any applicable timing permissions and restrictions if you cast the exiled card. This means that if Vivien leaves the battlefield, you can\'t cast the creature spell as though it had flash unless another effect allows you to do so."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You proliferate twice all while Roalesk\'s last ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two proliferations, and no player may choose to take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\'t have to choose any players at all."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A colorless spell whose mana cost is {2} or {1} will cost {0} to cast.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A land normally has no color, even if it can produce one or more colors of mana.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect such as that of Doubling Season causes Ugin to create two Spirit tokens, you still only exile one card from your library. You’ll put that card into your hand the first time that either of the tokens leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the Spirit leaves the battlefield for any reason, you’ll put the exiled card into your hand, even if Ugin left the battlefield before that happened.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you’ve activated Ugin’s ability multiple times, you must keep track of which exiled card belongs to each Spirit token.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once you look at the exiled face-down card once, you may look at it again any time you wish. If another player gains control of the Spirit token, that player can’t look at the exiled card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Ugin). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature gaining flying after it has been blocked by a creature without flying or reach won’t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause the creature it blocked to become unblocked.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Desperate Lunge tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature or planeswalker spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for No Escape. The spell won’t be countered when No Escape resolves, but you’ll still scry 1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature put onto the battlefield this way enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter if it would otherwise enter with no +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature or a creature card in your library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Players can respond to Neoform only after it’s been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to stop you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tokens that aren’t a copy of something else don’t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a converted mana cost of 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can’t cast it without sacrificing one, and you can’t sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature returned to the battlefield this way enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter if it would otherwise enter with no +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. Once the exiled permanent returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The permanent returns untapped unless another effect causes it to enter the battlefield tapped.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To determine whether the entering permanent is entering as a creature, consider any effects that will modify that permanent’s characteristics once it’s on the battlefield, including that permanent’s own abilities that affect only itself and effects from other objects.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature that attacked and was removed from combat (such as by Spires of Orazca) still attacked, so it can be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature that was put onto the battlefield attacking didn’t attack, so it can’t be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Controlling more than one planeswalker of the appropriate type won’t have any more of a benefit than just controlling one.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Gideon’s Triumph can be cast after combat damage has been dealt. In this case, the target player chooses one or two creatures that attacked or blocked this turn and have survived combat damage.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Gideon’s Triumph can be cast before combat damage has been dealt. In this case, it can be cast before or after blockers have been chosen.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Gideon’s Triumph targets the player, not the creature or creatures to be sacrificed. A creature with hexproof may be sacrificed this way.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Whether you control an appropriate planeswalker is checked only as the spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature that’s a Wolf or Werewolf enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter if it would otherwise enter with no +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature that’s both a Wolf and a Werewolf receives only one additional +1/+1 counter from Arlinn’s ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Arlinn leaves the battlefield before her last ability resolves, most likely because she only had 2 loyalty when you activated the ability, the Wolf token won’t enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A land normally has no color, even if it can produce multiple colors of mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A legendary permanent that is put into a graveyard because of the “legend rule” isn’t sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent is sacrificed to pay a cost of a spell or ability, Mayhem Devil’s ability will resolve before that spell or ability. Conversely, if a permanent is sacrificed during the resolution of a spell or ability, that spell or ability will finish resolving before Mayhem Devil’s ability is put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you sacrifice Mayhem Devil, its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Mayhem Devil itself doesn’t allow any player to sacrifice any permanents. Its ability triggers whenever a player sacrifices a permanent because some other spell, ability, or cost instructed the player to do so.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You control Mayhem Devil’s triggered ability and choose the target, no matter who sacrificed the permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A non-Gideon creature is a creature that isn’t also a Gideon planeswalker. For example, Gideon’s Company is a non-Gideon creature.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Any attacking Gideon creatures won’t get a +1/+1 counter, but as long as two or more attacking creatures aren’t Gideons, those attacking creatures each get a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Gideon’s first loyalty ability causes him to become a creature with the creature type Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: planeswalker is only a type (not a creature type), and Soldier is just a creature type (not a planeswalker type).'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Gideon’s first loyalty ability doesn’t count as a creature entering the battlefield. Gideon was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Gideon becomes a creature the same turn he enters the battlefield, you can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any).'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Gideon has 9 loyalty as you activate his last ability, he’ll be put into your graveyard and won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon after his first loyalty ability has resolved, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he’s also a creature, if Gideon has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text, such as equip. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected by Karn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a casual game, a card you choose from outside the game comes from your personal collection. In a tournament event, a card you choose from outside the game must come from your sideboard. You may look at your sideboard at any time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Karn’s first ability affects only artifacts on the battlefield. Activated abilities that work in other zones can still be activated.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Karn’s last ability can’t get a face-down card in exile, even if you know it’s an artifact card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the second mode is chosen at least once, and every target permanent card is an illegal target by the time Planewide Celebration tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. None of the other chosen modes happen. If only some of the targets are illegal targets but at least one is still legal, you still do as much as you can and the illegal targets aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'No matter which combination of modes you choose, you always follow the instructions of Planewide Celebration in the order they are written. If a mode is chosen more than once, you perform that mode’s instruction that many times sequentially.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You gain 3 life even if you don’t reveal a permanent card from among the top three cards of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A planeswalker that becomes a creature due to Sarkhan’s first loyalty ability can’t attack unless you’ve controlled it continuously since your turn began.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once Sarkhan’s first loyalty ability has resolved, each planeswalker you control (including Sarkhan) is no longer a planeswalker for the rest of the turn. They don’t lose any loyalty counters or abilities, and you can still activate their loyalty abilities if you haven’t done so yet this turn. They don’t lose loyalty if they’re dealt damage while they’re not planeswalkers.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Commence the Endgame. When that spell or ability resolves, Commence the Endgame won’t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You draw two cards and amass X all while Commence the Endgame is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target a creature spell you control after Domri’s first loyalty ability has resolved. When that spell or ability resolves, the creature spell won’t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'After Domri’s first loyalty ability has resolved, no creature spells you cast can be countered during that turn, not just the one you spend the mana on.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Because it’s a loyalty ability, Domri’s first loyalty ability isn’t a mana ability. It can be activated only any time you could cast a sorcery. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Domri leaves the battlefield before his last ability resolves, most likely because he only had 2 loyalty when you activated the ability, the creature won’t have +1/+0 from Domri’s static ability while it fights.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Domri’s last ability resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A split card that’s both an instant and a sorcery is counted only once for Cyclops Electromancer’s ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard is counted only as Cyclops Electromancer’s ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A split card that’s both an instant and a sorcery is counted only once for Invade the City.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If there are no instant or sorcery cards in your graveyard, you’ll amass 0. If you don’t control an Army, you’ll create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token that will die after Invade the City has finished resolving.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Invade the City is still on the stack while you count your instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard. It doesn’t count itself.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard is counted only as Invade the City resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'A “color pair” is exactly two colors. There are ten color pairs in Magic: white-blue, white-black, blue-black, blue-red, black-red, black-green, red-green, red-white, green-white, and green-blue.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the top ten cards of your library don\'t contain all ten color pairs, you choose as many cards as you can and put those cards into your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Abilities that trigger when counters are put on a permanent trigger when a permanent enters the battlefield with counters and when a player puts counters on a permanent.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Bioessence Hydra enters the battlefield at the same time as a planeswalker you control, the loyalty counters that planeswalker will receive won’t be counted to determine how many counters Bioessence Hydra enters the battlefield with, but they will cause its last ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Abilities that trigger while Enter the God-Eternals is resolving or that trigger as the target creature dies are all put onto the stack after the spell has finished resolving and the target creature has (if lethally damaged) died.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If both targets are no longer legal targets as the spell tries to resolve, it doesn’t resolve. You don’t amass 4.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature has less than 4 toughness, Enter the God-Eternals still deals 4 damage to it and you’ll gain 4 life.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is dealt lethal damage by Enter the God-Eternals, it’ll still be on the battlefield while you gain life, the target player moves cards, and you amass 4. Any abilities it has may affect these actions and may trigger on them.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is no longer a legal target as the spell resolves but the player is a legal target, no creature is dealt damage and you gain no life, but the target player still moves the top cards of their library and you still amass 4.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target player is no longer a legal target as the spell resolves but the creature is a legal target, the creature is dealt damage, you gain that much life, and you amass 4. No player moves cards from their library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t cast Enter the God-Eternals without targeting a creature and a player.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Activating Chainwhip Cyclops’s ability after a creature has blocked won’t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause the creature it blocked to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Affinity can reduce only generic mana in a spell’s cost. It can’t reduce color requirements.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Affinity doesn’t change the spell’s converted mana cost. It changes only how much mana you pay to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Affinity for artifacts means “This spell costs {1} less for each artifact you control.”'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell has multiple instances of affinity, each applies.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If there are any additional costs or cost increases that would apply to a spell with affinity, apply those before applying any cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Tezzeret’s first loyalty ability causes the opposing team to lose twice X life and you gain X life.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tezzeret himself doesn’t have affinity for artifacts.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The cost reduction is set before you pay any of the spell’s costs. Specifically, you could lock in a discount for an artifact you control and then sacrifice that artifact to activate a mana ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'After you draw a card as Nicol Bolas’s first loyalty ability resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s somehow an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a permanent they control or chooses a card in hand without revealing that card. Then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Finally, all of the chosen cards are exiled simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a loyalty ability of a planeswalker references the card it’s printed on by name, treat Nicol Bolas’s instance of that ability as though it referenced Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God by name instead. For instance, if Nahiri, Storm of Stone is on the battlefield, Nicol Bolas deals the damage if you activate the ability he gained from her.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an ability of a planeswalker exiles cards and another loyalty ability of that planeswalker references the exiled cards, those abilities are linked. If Nicol Bolas gains both abilities, the instances he has are similarly linked. Cards exiled by any other abilities Nicol Bolas has (such as his own first loyalty ability) won’t be seen by those linked abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If any abilities trigger as you draw a card while resolving Nicol Bolas’s first loyalty ability, those abilities don’t resolve until after your opponents have exiled a card or permanent.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, if one player on a team loses the game, the entire team loses the game, even if the other player controls a legendary creature or planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Nicol Bolas doesn’t gain any static or triggered abilities of other planeswalkers or any activated abilities they may have that aren’t loyalty abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Nicol Bolas doesn’t remove loyalty abilities from the other planeswalkers.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'While Nicol Bolas may end up with an astonishing number of loyalty abilities, you can still activate only one loyalty ability of Nicol Bolas, Dragon-God each turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Although Raging Kronch can’t attack alone, other attacking creatures don’t have to attack the same player or planeswalker. For example, Raging Kronch could attack an opponent and another creature could attack a planeswalker that opponent controls.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature that can’t attack alone also must attack if able, its controller must attack with it and another creature if able.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you control more than one creature that can’t attack alone, they can attack together, even if no other creatures attack.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Raging Kronch can attack along with a creature controlled by your teammate, even if no other creatures you control attack.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Raging Kronch can be declared as an attacker only if another creature is declared as an attacker at the same time. Once it’s attacking, removing the other creature won’t cause Raging Kronch to stop attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Although the new creature is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example, such as those of Trusted Pegasus and Makeshift Battalion).'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect exiles the God and immediately returns it to the battlefield, its last ability triggers but will have no effect. However, if an effect exiles it and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, the God’s ability may return that card its owner’s library first. If it does, the effect that exiled it won’t return it later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods leaves the graveyard or exile while its last ability is on the stack, it will remain in its new zone, even if that zone is a graveyard or exile.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods would die and it’s your commander in the Commander variant, you may put it into the command zone instead. If you save your commander this way, it doesn’t die and you won’t put it into your library. The same is true if it would be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the God’s owner has two or fewer cards in their library, the God is put on the bottom of their library as its last ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the new creature has an ability that triggers at the beginning of the end step, that ability will trigger and resolve even if the creature is returned to your hand during the end step before that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the new creature leaves the battlefield before the end step, most likely because it died in combat, that card remains in its current zone. It won’t return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you control another player’s God when it dies, you decide whether to put that card into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you put another player’s God onto the battlefield under your control, it will be exiled as you leave the game. If you were still the controller of that God, you would control its triggered ability but you have left the game; that ability won’t resolve and the card remains in exile. Similarly, if you lose the game at the same time that another player’s God that you put onto the battlefield is destroyed, it remains in its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose which player or planeswalker the new creature is attacking. It doesn’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Ilharg is attacking.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You choose which players or planeswalkers the two tokens are attacking. They don\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Parhelion II is attacking, and they can each be attacking different players and/or planeswalkers."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger on the target creatures dying or on the creatures returning to the battlefield will all be put onto the stack after Finale of Eternity has finished resolving. If it’s your turn, your opponent’s triggers resolve first, even though their creatures died before your creatures entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Finale of Eternity can target up to three creatures that each have toughness X or less. That is, their total toughness doesn’t have to be X or less.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If some but not all of the target creatures you choose are illegal targets as Finale of Eternity resolves, the legal targets are still destroyed and, if X is 10 or more, you still return cards to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If some or all of the targets are legal targets but aren’t destroyed, most likely because they have indestructible, you’ll still return cards to the battlefield if X is 10 or more.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you target a creature you own and X is 10 or more, that card will be among those returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may cast Finale of Eternity without choosing any target creatures. If X is 10 or more, you’ll just return all creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield. However, if you choose any targets and all of those targets become illegal before the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and you won’t put any cards onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Any counters that are put on Gideon remain on him while he’s not a creature, even if they have no effect on a noncreature planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an Equipment becomes attached to Gideon while he’s a creature, it’ll become unattached during the next upkeep that isn’t yours. The same is true of any Auras that become attached to Gideon that can’t enchant a noncreature planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect causes Gideon to lose all abilities during your turn, he’s still a Human Soldier creature and a Gideon planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon during your turn, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he has indestructible, if Gideon has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose which ability the target creature gains as Gideon’s first loyalty ability resolves, not as you activate it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when Spark Double enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen permanent will also work.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Spark Double somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another permanent, it can’t become a copy of that permanent. You may choose only a creature or planeswalker that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If it copies a planeswalker, Spark Double enters with the appropriate number of loyalty counters as printed on the card plus one. If it copies a creature, Spark Double enters with a +1/+1 counter on it, plus any counters that will be put on it from abilities it copied and other abilities of other objects.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is a token, Spark Double copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Spark Double doesn’t become a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the chosen permanent is copying something else (for example, if the chosen permanent is another Spark Double), then Spark Double enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen permanent copied.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is affected by a type-changing effect, Spark Double may enter the battlefield with different permanent types than the copied permanent currently has. Use the characteristics of Spark Double as it enters the battlefield, not of the copied permanent, to determine whether it enters with an additional counter on it. Notably, if Spark Double copies a Gideon planeswalker that’s a creature because its loyalty ability caused it to become a planeswalker creature, Spark Double enters as a noncreature planeswalker and doesn’t get a +1/+1 counter. On the other hand, if Spark Double copies Gideon Blackblade during your turn, Spark Double enters as a planeswalker creature and gets both kinds of counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spark Double copies exactly what was printed on the original permanent (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spark Double isn’t legendary if it copies a legendary permanent, and this exception is copiable. If something else copies Spark Double later, that copy also won’t be legendary. If you control two or more permanents with the same name but only one is legendary, the “legend rule” doesn’t apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Arboreal Grazer’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you’ve already played your land for the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you create a Zombie Army token when Lazotep Plating instructs you to amass 1, that token will gain hexproof until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You amass 1 and grant hexproof all while Lazotep Plating is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Some cards that cause you to amass also provide bonuses to “Zombie tokens.” These affect any token that happens to be a Zombie, not just a Zombie Army you’ve amassed.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Some spells that amass may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell tries to resolve, it doesn’t resolve. You won’t amass.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You amass 2 even if the controller of the spell pays {2}.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Some spells that amass may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell tries to resolve, it doesn’t resolve. You won’t amass.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You still amass 1 even if that player has no nonland cards to discard.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Some spells that amass may require targets. If each target chosen is an illegal target as that spell tries to resolve, it doesn’t resolve. You won’t amass.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may cast Bleeding Edge without choosing a target creature. You’ll just amass 2. However, if you choose a target and that target become illegal before Bleeding Edge resolves, the spell won’t resolve and you won’t amass.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You must discard exactly one card to cast Honor the God-Pharaoh; you can’t cast it without discarding a card, and you can’t discard additional cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Army is a new creature type. It’s possible to control a nontoken Army (perhaps a creature with the changeling ability) and, through combinations of other cards, it’s possible to control multiple Army tokens. When instructed to amass, you may put +1/+1 counters on any of your Army creatures, and you may choose a different one each time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t control an Army, the Zombie Army token that you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'As Bontu’s first triggered ability resolves, you may choose to sacrifice zero other permanents.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a second God-Eternal Bontu enters the battlefield under your control, you’ll put one into your graveyard before you can sacrifice anything to the new Bontu’s triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect exiles the God and immediately returns it to the battlefield, its last ability triggers but will have no effect. However, if an effect exiles it and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, the God’s ability may return that card its owner’s library first. If it does, the effect that exiled it won’t return it later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If any abilities trigger as you sacrifice other permanents, those abilities won’t be put onto the stack until after you’ve drawn cards.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods leaves the graveyard or exile while its last ability is on the stack, it will remain in its new zone, even if that zone is a graveyard or exile.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods would die and it’s your commander in the Commander variant, you may put it into the command zone instead. If you save your commander this way, it doesn’t die and you won’t put it into your library. The same is true if it would be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the God’s owner has two or fewer cards in their library, the God is put on the bottom of their library as its last ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you control another player’s God when it dies, you decide whether to put that card into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you put another player’s God onto the battlefield under your control, it will be exiled as you leave the game. If you were still the controller of that God, you would control its triggered ability but you have left the game; that ability won’t resolve and the card remains in exile. Similarly, if you lose the game at the same time that another player’s God that you put onto the battlefield is destroyed, it remains in its owner’s graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'As Liliana’s last ability resolves, the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s somehow an opponent’s turn, that opponent) makes all of their choices for it, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the unchosen permanents are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'As Liliana’s second loyalty ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses two creatures they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time. If any player can choose only one creature, that player does so.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Liliana dies at the same time as one or more creatures you control, her first ability triggers for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Liliana somehow becomes a creature and dies, her first ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The permanent types are artifact, creature, enchantment, land, and planeswalker. Supertypes, like legendary, aren’t permanent types.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'While making choices for Liliana’s last ability, if a permanent has more than one permanent type, it can count for any of them. For example, you could choose an artifact creature as the artifact you’re sparing, another creature as the creature, and an enchantment creature as the enchantment. Similarly, you could choose an enchantment creature as both the creature and the enchantment that you’re sparing, even if you control another creature and/or another enchantment.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'As Single Combat resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature or planeswalker they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then each unchosen creature and planeswalker is sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you leave the game after Single Combat resolves but before your next turn begins, its effect lasts until your next turn would have begun. It neither expires immediately nor lasts indefinitely.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'As a spell or ability an opponent controls resolves, if it would force you to sacrifice a permanent or discard a card, you just don’t. That part of the effect does nothing. If that spell or ability gives you the option to sacrifice a permanent or to discard a card, you can’t take that option.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Tamiyo has 3 loyalty, you can’t activate her last ability to return her to your hand. She won’t be in your graveyard while you’re choosing targets for the ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls states that something happens unless you sacrifice a permanent (as Mogis, God of Slaughter does) or discard a card (as Painful Quandary does), you can’t choose to sacrifice or discard. On the other hand, if a spell or ability an opponent controls instructs you to sacrifice a permanent unless you perform an action (as Killing Wave does) or discard a card unless you perform an action, you can choose whether or not to perform the action. If you don’t perform the action, nothing happens, since the spell or ability can’t cause you to sacrifice any permanents or discard cards.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability your opponent controls reduces your maximum hand size, Tamiyo’s first ability won’t stop you from discarding cards when the game rules cause you to discard during your cleanup step.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tamiyo’s ability affects sacrifices, but not any other ways permanents can leave the battlefield. It won’t stop a creature from dying due to lethal damage or having 0 toughness, and it won’t stop a permanent from being put into its owner’s graveyard due to the “legend rule.” None of these are sacrifices; they’re the result of game rules.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Prison Realm leaves the battlefield before its first triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You’ll still scry 1 even if Prison Realm’s first ability has no legal target or if that target becomes an illegal target before the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Awakening of Vitu-Ghazi doesn’t untap the land that becomes a creature.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Awakening of Vitu-Ghazi’s effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The target land loses the name it had, and its name is just Vitu-Ghazi. It keeps any types and abilities it had.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Because Mowu’s replacement effect affects only Mowu, it will apply if Mowu somehow enters the battlefield with one or more +1/+1 counters on it and give Mowu an additional +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Bolas’s Citadel lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction—see below), even if you don’t have priority. This action doesn’t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Bolas’s Citadel may be one of the permanents you sacrifice to activate its last ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can’t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can’t look at the next one until you’re done paying for that spell.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you cast a spell for another cost “rather than pay its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Spark Harvest, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the last ability of Bolas’s Citadel causes the opposing team to lose 20 life.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can play a land card from the top of your library only if you have available land plays remaining.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the cards you play from your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Bond of Insight doesn’t target the cards to return to your hand. You choose which cards to return as it resolves. You can choose up to two cards in your graveyard at that time, including ones just put into your graveyard by Bond of Insight.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can return two instant cards, two sorcery cards, one of each, just one instant or sorcery card, or none at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Both mana produced by Interplanar Beacon’s last ability may be spent on the same planeswalker spell, or each may be spent on different planeswalker spells.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Interplanar Beacon’s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Burning Prophet’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Casting Blindblast after a creature has blocked won’t remove the blocking creature from combat unless the damage Blindblast deals causes that creature to die. It won’t cause the creature it blocked to become unblocked even if the blocking creature does die.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Blindblast tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can’t cast it multiple times.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Chandra’s first ability triggers if she loses loyalty from being dealt damage, from her last loyalty ability being activated, or because an effect removes loyalty counters from her. If an effect simply causes Chandra to leave the battlefield, no counters were removed and so her ability doesn’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Chandra’s loyalty abilities don’t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If all of Chandra’s loyalty counters are removed, her first ability has her deal damage even though she’s left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If multiple creatures deal combat damage to Chandra at the same time, those counters are all removed at once, and her first ability triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Challenger Troll’s ability affects itself as long as its power remains 4 or greater.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature you control with power 4 or greater has menace, it can’t be blocked by only one creature and it can’t be blocked by more than one creature, so it simply can’t be blocked.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once a creature you control with power 3 or less has become blocked by two or more creatures, changing its power won’t cause either blocking creature to stop blocking it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Command the Dreadhorde deals damage to you before the creature and planeswalker cards are put onto the battlefield, but if this brings your life total to 0 or less, those creatures and planeswalkers enter the battlefield before you lose the game. Any abilities they have that trigger when they enter the battlefield won’t resolve if you lose the game, but their static abilities (such as that of Platinum Angel) may help you survive with 0 or less life.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the creatures and planeswalkers you control from Command the Dreadhorde’s effect are exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Controlling more than one planeswalker of the appropriate type won’t have any more of a benefit than just controlling one.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Whether you control an appropriate planeswalker is checked only as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'As Liliana’s Triumph resolves, the opponent whose turn it is (or, if it’s your turn, the next opponent in turn order) chooses a creature to sacrifice, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time. Then, if you control a Liliana planeswalker, in the same order, each opponent chooses a card in their hand without revealing it, and those cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast Liliana’s Triumph even if some or all of your opponents will be unable to sacrifice a creature. If you control a Liliana planeswalker, they’ll still discard a card, even if they couldn’t sacrifice a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Controlling more than one planeswalker of the appropriate type won’t have any more of a benefit than just controlling one.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Whether you control an appropriate planeswalker is checked only as the spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Dovin’s loyalty ability can target any permanent an opponent controls, not just one that can deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you leave the game after Dovin’s last ability resolves but before your next turn begins, its effect lasts until your next turn would have begun. It neither expires immediately nor lasts indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once Dovin’s loyalty ability resolves, the damage prevention continues to apply even if Dovin leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Dreadhorde Butcher’s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power as its last ability resolves. If its power was 0 or less, the ability resolves with no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Gideon’s Company’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Gideon’s Company is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive counters from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Gideon’s Company triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Putting a loyalty counter on a Gideon planeswalker doesn’t cause any of its activated abilities to become activated.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The ability of Gideon’s Company triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Ajani’s Welcome or 2 life from Battlefield Promotion.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Effects that instruct your opponents to reveal or look at cards from the top of their libraries will still work. Only effects that use the word “search” are affected.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Ashiok’s last ability targets an opponent, the cards put into their graveyard will be among the cards exiled by the ability. No player may take any actions between the time the cards are put into a graveyard and the time your opponents’ graveyards are all exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect says “Search your library . . . then shuffle your library,” your opponents shuffle their libraries even though they can’t search.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect says “You may search your library . . . If you do, shuffle your library” or “You may search your library . . . then shuffle your library,” your opponents can’t choose to search, so they won’t shuffle.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spells and abilities your opponents control may cause other players to search their libraries, and spells and abilities you control may cause your opponents to search their libraries.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Bleeding Edge, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Kasmina’s Transmutation becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Kasmina’s Transmutation overwrites all previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Kasmina’s Transmutation becomes attached to a creature will overwrite this effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Flux Channeler’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Follow the instructions in the order listed on Jace’s first loyalty ability: if you target yourself, you’ll put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard and then draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If for some reason you can’t win the game (because your opponent controls Platinum Angel, for example), you won’t lose for having tried to draw a card from a library with no cards in it. The draw was still replaced.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target player is an illegal target when Jace’s first loyalty ability tries to resolve, it doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If two or more players control Jace, Wielder of Mysteries and each player is instructed to draw a number of cards, first the player whose turn it is draws that many cards. If this causes that player to win the game instead, the game is immediately over. If the game isn’t over yet, repeat this process for each other player in turn order.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If your library has fewer than seven cards in it while resolving Jace’s last ability, and Jace has already left the battlefield, you’ll draw as many cards as you can and then win the game before state-based actions would cause you to lose the game for trying to draw from an empty library.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Gaining control of a permanent doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of the target permanents is an illegal target when Role Reversal resolves, the exchange won’t happen.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the same player controls both permanents when Role Reversal resolves, nothing happens.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Role Reversal’s effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn’t expire if the permanents stop sharing a permanent type after Role Reversal has resolved.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The permanent types are artifact, creature, enchantment, land, and planeswalker. Supertypes, like legendary, aren’t permanent types. For example, you can’t exchange control of a legendary creature with a legendary planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You don’t have to control either target permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Gaining vigilance any time after the moment you choose to attack with a creature won’t cause it to become untapped.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Loxodon Sergeant’s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t gain vigilance.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Huatli’s first ability doesn’t actually change any creature’s power. It changes only the amount of combat damage it assigns. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the real values. For example, Domri’s Ambush won’t cause a creature to deal damage equal to its toughness.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The greatest toughness among creatures you control is determined only as Huatli’s loyalty ability begins to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Ajani is somehow a creature as his last ability resolves, he’ll get a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a planeswalker you control is also a creature (most likely because it’s Gideon), that planeswalker receives both a +1/+1 counter and a loyalty counter as Ajani’s last ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If Cruel Celebrant dies at the same time as one or more other creatures and/or planeswalkers you control, its ability triggers for each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If a planeswalker that\'s also a creature dies, Cruel Celebrant\'s ability triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Cruel Celebrant\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Devouring Hellion somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature or planeswalker, you can’t sacrifice that creature or planeswalker. You may choose only permanents that are already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If any of the sacrificed permanents have abilities that trigger when Devouring Hellion enters the battlefield (such as that of Kronch Wrangler), those abilities won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose how many and which creatures and planeswalkers to sacrifice for Devouring Hellion’s ability while it’s entering the battlefield. No player may take actions between the time you choose which permanents to sacrifice and the time Devouring Hellion is on the battlefield with those counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Goblin Assault Team and another creature you control die simultaneously (perhaps because they were both dealt lethal damage in combat), the other creature won’t be on the battlefield when you choose a target for Goblin Assault Team’s ability. That creature can’t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that Goblin Assault Team gives.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Kaya’s Ghostform and the enchanted permanent are both put into graveyards and/or exiled at the same time, the enchanted permanent will be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Kaya’s Ghostform enchants a permanent you control but don’t own, that permanent will return to the battlefield under your control when it dies or is exiled. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Kaya’s Ghostform’s effect are exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect exiles the enchanted permanent and immediately returns it to the battlefield, the last ability of Kaya’s Ghostform triggers but will have no effect. If an effect exiles the enchanted permanent and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, Kaya’s Ghostform will return that card to the battlefield and it won’t be returned later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If another player gains control of the enchanted permanent, Kaya’s Ghostform will be put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard or exile but leaves that zone before the last ability of Kaya’s Ghostform resolves, that card stays in its new zone, even if that zone is also a graveyard or exile. You don’t return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Kaya’s Ghostform can enchant a token, but its last ability won’t return the token to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Kaya’s Ghostform is put into your graveyard once the enchanted permanent leaves the battlefield. It doesn’t return to the battlefield with that permanent.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Kronch Wrangler’s power is raised to 4 or greater as it enters the battlefield, it will cause its own ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the entering creature’s power changes to 3 or less after it has entered the battlefield, you’ll still put a +1/+1 counter on Kronch Wrangler.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The entering creature must have power 4 or greater as it enters the battlefield, or Kronch Wrangler’s ability won’t trigger. Static abilities that raise (or lower) a creature’s power are taken into account. However, you can’t have a creature with power 3 or less enter the battlefield, raise its power with a spell, an activated ability, or a triggered ability, and have Kronch Wrangler’s ability trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Ob Nixilis leaves the battlefield before his last ability resolves, most likely because he only had 2 loyalty when you activated the ability, his first ability won’t exist to trigger when the creature’s controller draws two cards.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Ob Nixilis’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. No player draws two cards. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does draw two cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Rescuer Sphinx somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another permanent, you can’t return that permanent. You may choose only permanents that are already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the returned permanent had an ability that would otherwise have triggered when Rescuer Sphinx enters the battlefield (such as that of Kronch Wrangler), that ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose whether to return a nonland permanent and which one to return for Rescuer Sphinx’s ability while it’s entering the battlefield. No player may take actions between the time you choose which permanent to return and the time Rescuer Sphinx is on the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Rising Populace and another creature you control die simultaneously (perhaps because they were both dealt lethal damage in combat), Rising Populace won’t be on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves. It can’t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on it.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a planeswalker that’s also a creature dies, Rising Populace’s ability triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Rubblebelt Rioters is the only creature you control as its triggered ability resolves, X is equal to its own power. Unless another effect or a +1/+1 counter has raised its power above 0, this won’t have any effect.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the triggered ability of Rubblebelt Rioters resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if the greatest power among creatures you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Sorin leaves the battlefield after you’ve activated his first loyalty ability during your turn but before it resolves, you’ll still gain 1 life as that ability deals damage.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature or planeswalker are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Storrev dies due to combat damage dealt at the same time that it deals combat damage to a player or planeswalker, its ability still triggers.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Storrev’s triggered ability can’t target any card that was put into your graveyard during this combat phase. This includes creatures and planeswalkers that died from combat damage, creatures and planeswalkers that died for any other reason, and cards that were put there from any other zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If The Wanderer would be dealt lethal damage at the same time as you and/or other permanents you control would be dealt noncombat damage, the damage that would be dealt to you and your other permanents is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Tolsimir is still on the battlefield when its enters-the-battlefield trigger resolves, its last ability will trigger as Voja is created.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the Wolf that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield as Tolsimir’s last ability resolves, no creature deals or is dealt damage, but you do gain 3 life.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tolsimir, Friend to Wolves has a different name than Tolsimir Wolfblood (from the Ravnica: City of Guilds™ set), and Voja, Friend to Elves has a different name than Voja, the token created by Tolsimir Wolfblood. Since the “legend rule” only cares about exact English names, this means you may control all four of these creatures at the same time.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may put Tolsimir’s last ability onto the stack without choosing any target. You’ll just gain 3 life. However, if you do choose a target and the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Tolsimir’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain 3 life and no creature deals or is dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Ugin’s Conjurant would be dealt more damage than it has counters, you remove all of the +1/+1 counters it has on it and prevent all of that damage. If another effect is raising its toughness, it will survive until the next time it’s dealt lethal damage.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To cast Ugin’s Conjurant, first choose the value for X you’d like, then apply any cost increases, then any cost reductions. The number of counters it enters with may be different than the amount of mana you pay if an effect (such as that of Ugin, the Ineffable) causes that you pay an amount of mana other than {X}.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If X is 10 or more, the creature card you just put onto the battlefield will get +X/+X and haste.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature card in your library or graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you don’t find a creature card with converted mana cost X or less, creatures you control still get +X/+X and gain haste if X is 10 or more.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'No player may take action between the time you reveal which creature card you’ll put onto the battlefield and the time it gets +X/+X and haste if X is 10 or more. Any abilities that trigger as it enters the battlefield will be put onto the stack after your creatures get +X/+X and haste.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a card in your library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a copy of a spell is returned to its owner’s hand, it’s moved there, then it will cease to exist as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell is returned to its owner’s hand, it’s removed from the stack and thus will not resolve. The spell isn’t countered; it just no longer exists. This works against a spell that can’t be countered.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast, the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can). The same is true of spells that distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Finale of Promise does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you copy a spell, you control the copy. Narset’s Reversal and the copy resolve before the original spell would have resolved.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Narset’s Reversal can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, the controller of the planeswalker is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Storm the Citadel affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +2/+2 or gain the triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tokens that aren’t a copy of something else don’t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a converted mana cost of 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, Jace’s first ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn (if any). You choose a target for the ability after you’ve drawn all of the cards.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Jace’s first ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn’t matter whether Jace was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once Jace’s last ability has resolved, its effect applies even if Jace has left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” the triggered ability of Jace’s Projection won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, the triggered ability of Jace’s Projection triggers that many times.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Putting a loyalty counter on a Jace planeswalker doesn’t cause any of its activated abilities to become activated.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability targets multiple things, you can’t target it with Bolt Bend, even if all but one of those targets have become illegal.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability targets the same player or object multiple times, you can’t target it with Bolt Bend.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Bolt Bend, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to change whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once you’ve cast Bolt Bend, losing control of all creatures with power 4 or greater won’t affect the spell or cause you to pay more mana.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The single target that the target spell or ability targets doesn’t have to be a creature you control with power 4 or greater.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You don’t choose the new target for the spell or ability until Bolt Bend resolves. You must change the target if possible. However, you can’t change the target to an illegal target. If there are no legal targets to choose from, the target isn’t changed. It doesn’t matter if the original target has somehow become illegal itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability you control targets an opponent with hexproof or an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, and Kaya leaves the battlefield while that spell or ability is on the stack, that player or permanent becomes an illegal target for that spell or ability. This includes Kaya’s own loyalty ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect allows opponents to cast spells any time they could cast an instant (for example, if your opponent also controls a Teferi, Time Raveler and activates his +1 loyalty ability), the restriction of Teferi’s first ability takes precedence over that permission.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may activate Teferi’s last ability without choosing any target. You’ll just draw a card. However, if you do choose a target and the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Teferi’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If an effect begins to apply to the target artifact before it becomes a copy of another permanent, that effect will continue to apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the target artifact becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities unless it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the target artifact copies a permanent that\'s copying something else, it will become whatever the target is copying."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If the target artifact is an Equipment attached to a creature and it becomes a copy of a non-Equipment permanent, it becomes unattached. If it becomes a copy of an Equipment, it remains attached.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the target artifact isn\'t an Equipment and becomes a copy of an Equipment, it\'ll become unattached when it becomes a non-Equipment artifact again."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Saheeli\'s first ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Saheeli\'s loyalty ability causes the target artifact to copy the printed values of the target permanent, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won\'t copy counters on that permanent or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won\'t copy effects that made the target permanent become a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'The target artifact is an artifact in addition to whatever types the second target has, and this exception is copiable. If something else copies the artifact later in the turn, that copy also will be an artifact.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect copies a spell multiple times, as Finale of Promise may, Ral’s first ability triggers that many times.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has damage divided as it was cast, the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can). The same is true of spells that distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy created by Ral’s last ability will have the same mode or modes. You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Some spells instruct you to “copy target instant or sorcery spell.” Because a spell is never a legal target for itself, you can’t cast such a spell targeting itself to create a loop that causes Ral’s first ability over and over.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The copies that Ral’s last ability creates are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy created by Ral’s last ability. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If an effect copies a card rather than a spell (such as that of God-Eternal Kefnet), this doesn’t cause Ral’s first ability to trigger. That ability will trigger if you cast the copy, however.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect exiles the God and immediately returns it to the battlefield, its last ability triggers but will have no effect. However, if an effect exiles it and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, the God’s ability may return that card its owner’s library first. If it does, the effect that exiled it won’t return it later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature’s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods leaves the graveyard or exile while its last ability is on the stack, it will remain in its new zone, even if that zone is a graveyard or exile.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods would die and it’s your commander in the Commander variant, you may put it into the command zone instead. If you save your commander this way, it doesn’t die and you won’t put it into your library. The same is true if it would be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the God’s owner has two or fewer cards in their library, the God is put on the bottom of their library as its last ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you control another player’s God when it dies, you decide whether to put that card into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you put another player’s God onto the battlefield under your control, it will be exiled as you leave the game. If you were still the controller of that God, you would control its triggered ability but you have left the game; that ability won’t resolve and the card remains in exile. Similarly, if you lose the game at the same time that another player’s God that you put onto the battlefield is destroyed, it remains in its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Rhonas’s first triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t have their power doubled or gain vigilance.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect exiles the God and immediately returns it to the battlefield, its last ability triggers but will have no effect. However, if an effect exiles it and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, the God’s ability may return that card its owner’s library first. If it does, the effect that exiled it won’t return it later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect puts a card into your hand without using the word “draw,” the card wasn’t drawn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods leaves the graveyard or exile while its last ability is on the stack, it will remain in its new zone, even if that zone is a graveyard or exile.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods would die and it’s your commander in the Commander variant, you may put it into the command zone instead. If you save your commander this way, it doesn’t die and you won’t put it into your library. The same is true if it would be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the God’s owner has two or fewer cards in their library, the God is put on the bottom of their library as its last ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the card leaves your hand before Kefnet’s triggered ability resolves, you’ll copy it using its last known information.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you control another player’s God when it dies, you decide whether to put that card into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you reveal a card this way, it remains revealed until Kefnet’s triggered ability finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you somehow control more than one God-Eternal Kefnet (perhaps because one is a Spark Double), you may reveal a card you draw for any number of their abilities. One at a time, each will copy the card if it’s an instant or sorcery, and you may cast each of them. Each copy resolves before you cast the next, and each copy’s cost is reduced by only {2}.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you put another player’s God onto the battlefield under your control, it will be exiled as you leave the game. If you were still the controller of that God, you would control its triggered ability but you have left the game; that ability won’t resolve and the card remains in exile. Similarly, if you lose the game at the same time that another player’s God that you put onto the battlefield is destroyed, it remains in its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'It’s important to reveal the first card you draw each turn (or choose not to reveal it) before it is mixed with the other cards in your hand. You look at the card as you draw it before choosing whether to reveal it.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Multiple card draws are always treated as a sequence of individual card draws. For example, if you haven’t drawn any cards yet during a turn and cast a spell that instructs you to draw three cards, you’ll draw them one at a time. Only the first card drawn this way may be revealed and copied with Kefnet’s ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The copy is created in and cast from your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Kefnet’s ability). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can cast the copy during the resolution of the triggered ability if it’s a sorcery, no matter whose turn it is or which phase it is.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can cast the copy only as Kefnet’s triggered ability resolves. If you don’t want to cast it at that time (or you can’t cast it, perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the copy ceases to exist. You can’t cast it later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can reveal and copy an instant or sorcery card this way on any turn, not just your own, if it’s the first card you’ve drawn that turn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You don’t have to reveal a drawn card if you don’t wish to copy it at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect exiles the God and immediately returns it to the battlefield, its last ability triggers but will have no effect. However, if an effect exiles it and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, the God’s ability may return that card its owner’s library first. If it does, the effect that exiled it won’t return it later.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods leaves the graveyard or exile while its last ability is on the stack, it will remain in its new zone, even if that zone is a graveyard or exile.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of these Gods would die and it’s your commander in the Commander variant, you may put it into the command zone instead. If you save your commander this way, it doesn’t die and you won’t put it into your library. The same is true if it would be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the God’s owner has two or fewer cards in their library, the God is put on the bottom of their library as its last ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you control another player’s God when it dies, you decide whether to put that card into its owner’s library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you put another player’s God onto the battlefield under your control, it will be exiled as you leave the game. If you were still the controller of that God, you would control its triggered ability but you have left the game; that ability won’t resolve and the card remains in exile. Similarly, if you lose the game at the same time that another player’s God that you put onto the battlefield is destroyed, it remains in its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In the Commander format, a commander’s color identity isn’t affected by color words (such as black) appearing in its text. If God-Eternal Oketra is your commander, your deck can’t contain black mana symbols.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Oketra’s first triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect says to set an opponent’s life total to a number that’s higher than their current life total while Tibalt is on the battlefield, the player’s life total doesn’t change.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that cause opponents to gain life still resolve while Tibalt is on the battlefield. No opponent will gain life, but any other effects of that spell or ability will happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an opponent attacks more than one planeswalker you control, the last ability of Oath of Kaya triggers once for each of those attacked planeswalkers.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target is an illegal target by the time the first ability of Oath of Kaya tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 3 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an opponent has one or fewer cards in hand as Davriel’s first ability triggers but has two or more cards in hand as that ability resolves, Davriel doesn’t deal damage to them.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an opponent has two or more cards in their hand as their upkeep begins, Davriel’s first ability won’t trigger. No player may take any actions during a turn before the turn’s upkeep begins. Because the upkeep step is before the draw step, that player won’t have drawn a card for the turn yet.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Davriel’s first ability triggers for each opponent separately as appropriate during that player’s team’s upkeep.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an opponent hasn’t drawn any cards in a turn and a spell or ability instructs that player to draw multiple cards, that player will just draw one card. However, if the draws are optional, the player can’t choose to draw, even if they could draw one card this way.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Narset will “see” cards drawn by opponents earlier in the turn she entered the battlefield, although Narset can’t affect cards drawn before she entered the battlefield. For example, if an opponent draws two cards, then Narset enters the battlefield, that opponent can’t draw more cards that turn, but the two drawn cards are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Replacement effects (such as that of Underrealm Lich or the first ability of Jace, Wielder of Mysteries) can’t be used to replace draws that Narset disallows. However, if an opponent’s first draw is replaced (by Underrealm Lich’s ability, for example), that draw didn’t happen and Narset won’t stop the next draw (which may also be replaced by Underrealm Lich’s ability).'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Your opponents can each draw a maximum of one card each on each player’s turn. Subsequent card draws during that turn are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If another creature with a +1/+1 counter on it is dealt lethal damage at the same time as Martyr for the Cause, the triggered ability can’t proliferate a +1/+1 counter on the other creature in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If another effect modifies how much damage your red source would deal, including preventing some of it, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses an order in which to apply those effects. If all of the damage is prevented, Jaya’s effect no longer applies.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If damage dealt by a source you control is being divided or assigned among multiple permanents an opponent controls or among an opponent and one or more permanents they control simultaneously, divide the original amount before adding 1. For example, if you attack with a 5/5 red creature with trample and your opponent blocks with a 2/2 creature, you can assign 2 damage to the blocker and 3 damage to the defending player. These amounts are then modified to 3 and 4, respectively.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Jaya’s first ability doesn’t cause Jaya to deal damage; it affects the amount of damage dealt by the original red source.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If either target becomes illegal after Bond of Passion is cast but before it resolves, the other is still affected as appropriate.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In some rare cases, gaining control of the target creature may cause the second target to become illegal. As long as the second target is a legal target as Bond of Passion begins to resolve (before the target creature changes control) it will attempt to deal damage to the second target.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Domri’s Ambush tries to resolve, the creature you control won’t deal damage.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the creature you control is an illegal target as Domri’s Ambush tries to resolve, you won’t put a +1/+1 counter on it. If that creature is a legal target but the other target isn’t, you’ll still put the counter on the creature you control.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t cast Domri’s Ambush unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature or planeswalker you don’t control as targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of the two target creatures you control is an illegal target as Band Together resolves, the other will still deal damage equal to its power.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the last target creature is an illegal target as Band Together resolves, or if both of the first targets are illegal targets, no creature deals or is dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If some of the targets chosen are no longer legal targets as Deliver Unto Evil resolves, an opponent chooses among the targets that remain legal. If no targets remain legal, the spell doesn’t resolve. It’s put into its owner’s graveyard and isn’t exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Whether you control a Bolas planeswalker is checked only as this spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose one opponent to make the final choice of which cards remains in your graveyard, but all players may discuss and advise this choice.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may cast Deliver Unto Evil with fewer than four targets. However, if you don’t control a Bolas planeswalker as Deliver Unto Evil resolves, your opponent will choose two of however many cards you did target (or one or zero, if you chose fewer than two) and the remainder (if any) will be put into your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may cast Deliver Unto Evil with no targets if you wish. It will be exiled, and nothing else happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the entering creature’s power changes to 3 or less after it has entered the battlefield, you’ll still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The entering creature must have power 4 or greater as it enters the battlefield, or Kiora’s first ability won’t trigger. Static abilities that raise or lower a creature’s power are taken into account, as well as any +1/+1 counters the creature enters with. However, you can’t have a creature with power 3 or less enter the battlefield, raise its power with a spell, an activated ability, or a triggered ability, and have Kiora’s ability trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Battlefield Promotion tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Deathsprout tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t search for a land card. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do search.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Jaya’s Greeting tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t scry 1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Samut’s Sprint tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t scry 1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Samut’s loyalty ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t scry 1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Ral’s Outburst tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t look at the top two cards of your library.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you have only one card in your library, you put it into your hand. You won’t lose the game if your library’s empty until you try to draw from the empty library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If you control no creatures, you simply destroy all creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You chose which creature to return to its owner\'s hand while Time Wipe is resolving. No player may take any actions between the time you choose the creature to return and the time other creatures are destroyed."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If you have no cards in hand as Heartwarming Redemption resolves, you discard nothing then draw one card.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is determined after you draw during Heartwarming Redemption’s resolution. No player may take actions between the time cards are drawn and the time you gain life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the last ability of God-Pharaoh’s Statue causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases (such as that of God-Pharaoh’s Statue’s first ability), then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Mizzium Tank’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Mizzium Tank’s triggered ability triggers even if it’s already a creature. In this case, it gets an additional +1/+1 until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause this creature to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or less has blocked this creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause this creature to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once this creature has been blocked, activating its ability won’t change or undo that block.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Other effects may cause you to draw more or fewer cards than the number of cards you discarded. In these cases, the amount of mana you add is equal to the number of cards you discarded, not the number of cards you drew.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Players can respond to Heartfire only after it’s been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the permanent you sacrificed to stop you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature or planeswalker to cast this spell; you can’t cast it without sacrificing one, and you can’t sacrifice additional permanents.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Players can’t normally play a land card from a graveyard. If a player finds a way to do so, Tomik’s last ability takes precedence over that permission.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tomik’s middle ability is similar to hexproof, but effects that interact with hexproof don’t count these lands or land cards as having hexproof.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Players don’t normally have counters, but some cards in other sets say that a player “gets” a counter of a certain kind. Notably, emblems aren’t counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Price of Betrayal has only one target. You may remove different kinds of counters from that one target, and you may also remove multiples of the same kind of counter from that one target.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Rally of Wings affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures that gain flying later in the turn or that you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +2/+2.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Sky Theater Strix’s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spells that target more than one creature and/or planeswalker you control cost only {2} more to cast.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of an opponent’s spell that targets a creature or planeswalker you control, start with the mana cost or alternative cost that player is paying, add any cost increases (such as that of Kasmina’s effect), then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting the card you drew.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Steady Aim can target a creature that’s already untapped. It will still get +1/+4 and gain reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tenth District Legionnaire’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You scry 1 even if you can’t put a +1/+1 counter on Tenth District Legionnaire, most likely because it has left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The ability of Vivien’s Grizzly has you put the card on the bottom of your library if you don’t put it into your hand for any reason, whether it’s not a creature or planeswalker card or whether you choose not to put it into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The effect of Nissa’s first loyalty ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The replacement effect from Ob Nixilis’s Cruelty will exile the target creature if it would die this turn for any reason, not just immediately after Ob Nixilis’s Cruelty resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The target player loses 2 life even if they can discard only one or zero cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Thunder Drake must be on the battlefield in order for the ability to function. Notably, the ability won’t trigger if Thunder Drake is the second spell you cast in a turn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Thunder Drake’s ability can trigger only once each turn. The ability will resolve before the second spell resolves. It doesn’t matter if the first spell you cast that turn has resolved, was countered, or is still on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Thundering Ceratok’s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t gain trample.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can cast Bond of Discipline even if your opponents control no creatures or you control no creatures. The creatures that are on the battlefield will be affected as appropriate.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can cast The Elderspell without controlling any planeswalkers. The target planeswalkers will still be destroyed. You can also cast it without targeting any planeswalkers if you really want to do so.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You choose the target planeswalkers to destroy as you cast The Elderspell, but you don’t choose a planeswalker to receive loyalty counters until The Elderspell is resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting the card you drew.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t pay {2}{B} more than once each time Eternal Taskmaster’s ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t target the same creature twice to have it get +4/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may cast Gideon’s Battle Cry while you control no creatures. You’ll still search for Gideon.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may cast Jace’s Ruse without choosing any target creatures. You’ll just search for Jace, Arcane Strategist. However, if you choose any targets and all of those targets become illegal before Jace’s Ruse resolves, the spell won’t resolve and you won’t search.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'You may choose Merfolk Skydiver as the target of its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may choose Pollenbright Druid as the target of its own ability.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You may choose Teyo’s Lightshield as the target of its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Sorin’s Thirst tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Vampire Opportunist’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life and you gain 2 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Defiant Strike tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control another creature with power 4 or greater immediately after Turret Ogre enters the battlefield, its ability doesn\'t trigger, even if you can raise a creature\'s power right away. If you control no other creature with power 4 or greater as the ability resolves, nothing happens. These don\'t have to be the same creature, though."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Turret Ogre\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Turret Ogre\'s ability doesn\'t deal more than 2 damage to each opponent if you control more than one other creature with power 4 or greater."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If Topple the Statue targets an artifact, that artifact will be tapped if it\'s untapped, and then it\'ll be destroyed. Any abilities that trigger as it becomes tapped do so and will resolve after Topple the Statue has finished resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target when Topple the Statue tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card. If the target is legal but isn\'t tapped, isn\'t destroyed, or is neither tapped nor destroyed, you do draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Topple the Statue can target any permanent, even one that\'s already tapped."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Iron Bully can be the target of its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature or pay an extra {3}{B} to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without paying one of those costs, and you can\'t pay either multiple times. Players can respond to Spark Harvest only after it\'s been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to stop you from casting this spell or to make it cost more mana."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Dovin’s Veto. When that spell or ability resolves, Dovin’s Veto won’t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Ajani’s Pridemate’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Ajani’s Pridemate is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Paradise Plume or 2 life from Mycologist.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Fblthp’s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Fblthp’s last ability triggers only if it’s on the battlefield when it becomes the target of a spell.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an effect exiles Fblthp from your library and then lets you cast that card, it’s cast from exile, not from your library.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the spell that targets Fblthp has no other targets, it won’t resolve (because it no longer has a legal target after Fblthp has gotten totally lost in your library).'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'There’s normally no way to cast Fblthp from your library or to have it enter the battlefield from your library. You’ll have to use other effects to find Fblthp for the bonus card draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Dreadhorde Arcanist leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to check whether the card is still a legal target.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you cast the card, you do so as part of the resolution of Dreadhorde Arcanist’s triggered ability. You can’t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on a card’s type are ignored, and the spell will resolve before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The instant or sorcery card you target must have mana value less than or equal to Dreadhorde Arcanist’s power immediately after Dreadhorde Arcanist has attacked. Any other abilities that trigger when creatures you control attack won’t have resolved yet.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Feather is still on the battlefield as you finish casting an instant or sorcery spell that targets one or more creatures you control, its ability triggers. The replacement effect that exiles that spell and the delayed triggered ability that returns it to your hand both take effect even if Feather leaves the battlefield after this point.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell you cast that targets your creature doesn’t resolve for any reason (either because another spell or ability counters it or because all its targets are illegal as it tries to resolve), it won’t be exiled. You won’t return it to your hand.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an instant or sorcery spell’s own instructions tell you to exile it or put it anywhere else, it won’t try to be put into your graveyard or exiled with Feather’s effect, so you won’t return it to your hand.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If another replacement effect instructs you to exile an instant or sorcery spell, such as that of Dreadhorde Arcanist or the flashback keyword, you may choose to apply Feather’s replacement effect first. If you do, Feather’s delayed triggered ability will return that card to your hand.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery spell that you don’t own, it won’t try to be put into your graveyard, so you won’t exile it with Feather’s effect or return it to your hand.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The spell may have any other targets in addition to a creature you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Bolas\' Augur", \'text\': "Wenn Bolas\' Augur ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt keine Zukunft, außer der, die mein Meister herbeiwünscht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461232&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e9fbc4-4fd9-4fdb-a2d4-2883ef2ea82e\', \'multiverseId\': 461232}, \'multiverseid\': 461232}, {\'name\': \'Presagio de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Presagio de Nicol Bolas entre al campo de batalla, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay otro futuro salvo aquel que mi maestro desee".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f466a618-eb25-433a-b291-ab9ca69c6ab5\', \'multiverseId\': 461496}, \'multiverseid\': 461496}, {\'name\': \'Augure de Bolas\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Augure de Bolas arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a pas d\'autre avenir que celui que désire mon maître. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ec0f71-cf19-4df6-92e6-3616630a59a4\', \'multiverseId\': 461760}, \'multiverseid\': 461760}, {\'name\': \'Augure di Bolas\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Augure di Bolas entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Non esiste futuro salvo quello che desidera il mio signore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'186da5bf-598b-480e-9f30-af8e3f7e56ee\', \'multiverseId\': 462024}, \'multiverseid\': 462024}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの占い師\', \'text\': \'ボーラスの占い師が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。あなたはその中からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我が主が望む他の未来などない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc70bb1b-c1ad-4119-b405-857e6fe2e9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 462288}, \'multiverseid\': 462288}, {\'name\': \'니콜 볼라스의 징조\', \'text\': \'니콜 볼라스의 징조가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"내 주인님이 바라시는 것 이외의 미래는 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13d8ab04-db2d-462d-9619-1223d483807d\', \'multiverseId\': 462552}, \'multiverseid\': 462552}, {\'name\': \'Áugure de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quando Áugure de Nicol Bolas entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há futuro, salvo o dos desígnios de meu mestre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef723def-3b13-4b1a-a722-173e1ffeff2e\', \'multiverseId\': 462816}, \'multiverseid\': 462816}, {\'name\': \'Гадатель Боласа\', \'text\': \'Когда Гадатель Боласа выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Нет будущего, кроме того, что желает мой господин».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'853cb503-3bf3-448a-930e-ec1ab6d018cf\', \'multiverseId\': 463080}, \'multiverseid\': 463080}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯卜算师\', \'text\': \'当波拉斯卜算师进战场时，检视你牌库顶的三张牌。你可以展示其中的一张瞬间或法术牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「世上只有我主人意欲的未来。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6cdb3e-0d81-4707-9112-f8961304d3d7\', \'multiverseId\': 463344}, \'multiverseid\': 463344}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯卜算師\', \'text\': \'當波拉斯卜算師進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。你可以展示其中的一張瞬間或巫術牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「世上只有我主人意欲的未來。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59f8c1a-a902-4fd9-aef8-17f917df031a\', \'multiverseId\': 463608}, \'multiverseid\': 463608}]', '[{\'name\': "Bolas\' Zitadelle", \'text\': \'Du kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek spielen. Falls du auf diese Weise einen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahle Lebenspunkte in Höhe seiner umgewandelten Manakosten, anstatt seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\n{T}, opfere zehn bleibende Nichtland-Karten: Jeder Gegner verliert 10 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be67adf9-8d9d-46f7-9aba-5c4b89a70aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 461270}, \'multiverseid\': 461270}, {\'name\': \'Ciudadela de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Puedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nPuedes jugar la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si lanzas un hechizo de esta manera, paga una cantidad de vidas igual a su coste de maná convertido en vez de pagar su coste de maná.\\n{T}, sacrificar diez permanentes que no sean tierra: Cada oponente pierde 10 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'129ba4e9-8bef-4679-aa94-2a15701b9236\', \'multiverseId\': 461534}, \'multiverseid\': 461534}, {\'name\': \'Citadelle de Bolas\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez jouer la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si vous lancez un sort de cette manière, payez un nombre de points de vie égal à son coût converti de mana à la place de son coût de mana.\\n{T}, sacrifiez dix permanents non-terrain : Chaque adversaire perd 10 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461798&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e86c7b-074e-4b31-8e1b-583083ba9123\', \'multiverseId\': 461798}, \'multiverseid\': 461798}, {\'name\': \'Cittadella di Bolas\', \'text\': \'Puoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nPuoi giocare la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se lanci una magia in questo modo, paga punti vita pari al suo costo di mana convertito invece di pagare il suo costo di mana.\\n{T}, Sacrifica dieci permanenti non terra: Ogni avversario perde 10 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e4cf9c-7908-4179-a990-29a0d328f604\', \'multiverseId\': 462062}, \'multiverseid\': 462062}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの城塞\', \'text\': \'あなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見てもよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードをプレイしてもよい。あなたがこれにより呪文を唱えるなら、それのマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、それの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを支払う。\\n{T}, 土地でないパーマネント10個を生け贄に捧げる：各対戦相手はそれぞれ10点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'684e776d-ba57-48cf-a7c4-8ab92370db1d\', \'multiverseId\': 462326}, \'multiverseid\': 462326}, {\'name\': \'볼라스의 요새\', \'text\': \'당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 언제든지 볼 수 있다.\\n당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 플레이할 수 있다. 당신이 이런 식으로 주문을 발동한다면, 그 주문의 마나 비용을 지불하는 대신 전환마나비용만큼 생명점을 지불한다.\\n{T}, 대지가 아닌 지속물 열 개를 희생한다: 각 상대는 생명 10점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7811d7-105b-4233-a927-2796db0e1a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 462590}, \'multiverseid\': 462590}, {\'name\': \'Cidadela de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Você pode olhar o card do topo de seu grimório a qualquer momento.\\nVocê pode jogar o card do topo de seu grimório. Se você conjurar uma mágica dessa forma, pague uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual a seu custo de mana convertido, em vez de pagar seu custo de mana.\\n{T}, sacrifique dez permanentes que não sejam terrenos: Cada oponente perde 10 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d624da-7e82-4956-b7ec-dac40dfdae5a\', \'multiverseId\': 462854}, \'multiverseid\': 462854}, {\'name\': \'Цитадель Боласа\', \'text\': \'Вы в любой момент можете посмотреть верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки.\\nВы можете разыграть верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если вы разыгрываете таким образом заклинание, то вместо уплаты его мана-стоимости заплатите количество жизней, равное его конвертированной мана-стоимости.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте десять не являющихся землями перманентов: каждый оппонент теряет 10 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b59c61fb-27af-49da-9b5a-5701acb6aa42\', \'multiverseId\': 463118}, \'multiverseid\': 463118}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯尊殿\', \'text\': \'你可以随时检视你的牌库顶牌。\\n你可以使用你的牌库顶牌。如果你以此法施放咒语，则支付等同于其总法术力费用数量的生命，而不支付其法术力费用。\\n{T}，牺牲十个非地永久物：每位对手各失去10点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ff51a4-4383-46c5-ae0e-f5c0df235b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 463382}, \'multiverseid\': 463382}, {\'name\': \'波拉斯尊殿\', \'text\': \'你可以隨時檢視你的牌庫頂牌。\\n你可以使用你的牌庫頂牌。如果你以此法施放咒語，則支付等同於其總魔法力費用數量的生命，而不支付其魔法力費用。\\n{T}，犧牲十個非地永久物：每位對手各失去10點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eec7a533-a048-4f9c-9822-9842ed87b002\', \'multiverseId\': 463646}, \'multiverseid\': 463646}]', '[{\'name\': "Ob Nixilis\' Grausamkeit", \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -5/-5 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls die Kreatur in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ob Nixilis war auf Ravnica gefangen und hasste beide Seiten gleichermaßen. Also begnügte er sich mit wahlloser Folter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e850a932-30dc-4f79-ad55-499cf26f1e59\', \'multiverseId\': 461292}, \'multiverseid\': 461292}, {\'name\': \'Crueldad de Ob Nixilis\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -5/-5 hasta el final del turno. Si esa criatura fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Atrapado en Rávnica y sin afinidad por ningún bando, Ob Nixilis buscó gratificación en el tormento aleatorio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbbdd6aa-a597-48f9-ba1f-4c673133bc5e\', \'multiverseId\': 461556}, \'multiverseid\': 461556}, {\'name\': "Cruauté d\'Ob Nixilis", \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -5/-5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si cette créature devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Coincé sur Ravnica sans préférence pour l\'un des deux camps, Ob Nixilis passa le temps à opérer divers actes de torture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aad8721-7935-43ae-b7ee-a3cd37559128\', \'multiverseId\': 461820}, \'multiverseid\': 461820}, {\'name\': \'Crudeltà di Ob Nixilis\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -5/-5 fino alla fine del turno. Se quella creatura sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Intrappolato su Ravnica senza affinità per alcuna delle due fazioni, Ob Nixilis cercava di compiacersi con atti di tortura casuali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4890022a-d652-4592-927e-45715fe0b0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 462084}, \'multiverseid\': 462084}, {\'name\': \'オブ・ニクシリスの残虐\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－５/－５の修整を受ける。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ラヴニカに捕らわれたままどちらにも関わりのないオブ・ニクシリスは、気晴らしとして気紛れに残虐行為を行っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4bf67f5-e6ad-4bb4-9703-b55c2ab9e703\', \'multiverseId\': 462348}, \'multiverseid\': 462348}, {\'name\': \'오브 닉실리스의 잔혹함\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -5/-5를 받는다. 그 생물이 이 턴에 죽게 된다면, 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'양측에 대해 아무런 감정도 없이 라브니카에 갇힌 오브 닉실리스는 내키는 대로 고통을 입히며 희열을 느꼈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd230ca-555d-4b1c-ba05-f99aac05adeb\', \'multiverseId\': 462612}, \'multiverseid\': 462612}, {\'name\': \'Crueldade de Ob Nixilis\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -5/-5 até o final do turno. Se aquela criatura for morrer neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Preso em Ravnica sem afinidade com nenhuma das facções, Ob Nixilis buscou satisfação em atos aleatórios de tortura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'808e6042-b38b-4545-92f6-d8e90bf09566\', \'multiverseId\': 462876}, \'multiverseid\': 462876}, {\'name\': \'Жестокость Об-Никсилиса\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -5/-5 до конца хода. Если то существо должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Оказавшись в ловушке на Равнике, не питавший симпатий ни к одной из сторон Об-Никсилис находил удовольствие в спонтанных проявлениях насилия.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec060669-bb02-4c7f-99ae-1f7f52998872\', \'multiverseId\': 463140}, \'multiverseid\': 463140}, {\'name\': \'欧尼希兹的酷行\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-5/-5直到回合结束。如果本回合中该生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'受困拉尼卡后，无意加入任一方的欧尼希兹只能从恣意折磨中寻得慰藉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e579aa4-71dc-4423-a91a-723056447330\', \'multiverseId\': 463404}, \'multiverseid\': 463404}, {\'name\': \'歐尼希茲的酷行\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-5/-5直到回合結束。如果本回合中該生物將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'受困拉尼卡後，無意加入任一方的歐尼希茲只能從恣意折磨中尋得慰藉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cec9b42-8776-41ba-930e-32b18ab6e5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 463668}, \'multiverseid\': 463668}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abtrünnige vernichten\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {2}.\\nAufmarsch 2. (Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Falls du keine kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Zombie-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verlange nichts außer absolutem Gehorsam."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461238&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'352ca5b2-0909-41af-a020-c2f94ff0f2f1\', \'multiverseId\': 461238}, \'multiverseid\': 461238}, {\'name\': \'Aplastar la disidencia\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {2}.\\nEnrola 2. (Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. Si no controlas ninguno, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Zombie negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo único que pido es obediencia absoluta".\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7736ab-fac3-4836-b5a2-a6221f68772a\', \'multiverseId\': 461502}, \'multiverseid\': 461502}, {\'name\': \'Écraser la sédition\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {2}.\\nAmassez 2. (Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. Si vous n\'en contrôlez pas, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Zombie et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne demande que l\'obéissance la plus totale. »\\n—Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461766&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b654bec0-05bb-4bfe-aa81-4ddf3b8eb397\', \'multiverseId\': 461766}, \'multiverseid\': 461766}, {\'name\': \'Schiacciare il Dissenso\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {2}.\\nRecluta 2. (Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. Se non ne controlli uno, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Zombie 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non pretendo altro che obbedienza assoluta."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'605db344-ffe3-4cae-9e81-d5efec957c34\', \'multiverseId\': 462030}, \'multiverseid\': 462030}, {\'name\': \'造反者潰し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\n動員２を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のゾンビ・軍団・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「全き服従、我の望むものはそれだけだ。」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e7a973-1cba-4048-80bc-98d89a51ecfd\', \'multiverseId\': 462294}, \'multiverseid\': 462294}, {\'name\': \'반대자 분쇄\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문의 조종자가 {2}를 지불하지 않으면 그 주문을 무효화한다.\\n축적 2를 한다. (당신이 조종하는 군대 한 개에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 군대를 조종하고 있지 않다면, 먼저 0/0 흑색 좀비 군대 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 바라는 것은 끝까지 복종하는 것뿐이지."\\n—니콜 볼라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c803dc41-0a02-43ec-87bc-566a8398eb96\', \'multiverseId\': 462558}, \'multiverseid\': 462558}, {\'name\': \'Reprimir a Dissensão\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2}.\\nArregimente 2. (Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Se você não controlar um, crie antes uma ficha de criatura preta 0/0 do tipo Zumbi Exército.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Tudo que eu peço é obediência total."\\n— Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b37f21-d596-4ac1-867d-69b0f36ac115\', \'multiverseId\': 462822}, \'multiverseid\': 462822}, {\'name\': \'Сокрушить Инакомыслие\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {2}.\\nСкопище 2. (Положите два жетона +1/+1 на Армию под вашим контролем. Если под вашим контролем нет Армии, то сначала создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 черная Армия Зомби.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я прошу всего лишь полного послушания».\\n— Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1ea958-09f2-45b5-87ff-1bc8c900a9d4\', \'multiverseId\': 463086}, \'multiverseid\': 463086}, {\'name\': \'打压异见\', \'text\': \'除非目标咒语的操控者支付{2}，否则反击之。\\n囤兵2。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置两个+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色灵俑／军队衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我要求的是彻底服从。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5c1737-b774-41a0-93b3-bb6cd17ea018\', \'multiverseId\': 463350}, \'multiverseid\': 463350}, {\'name\': \'打壓異見\', \'text\': \'除非目標咒語的操控者支付{2}，否則反擊之。\\n囤兵2。（在一個由你操控的軍隊上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控軍隊，則先派出一個0/0黑色殭屍／軍隊衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我要求的是徹底服從。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9c86022-52dd-4f1b-88e9-e231b69a7db0\', \'multiverseId\': 463614}, \'multiverseid\': 463614}]', "[{'name': 'Ajani der Großherzige', 'text': 'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Wachsamkeit.\\n+1: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n−2: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, und eine Loyalitätsmarke auf jeden anderen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ajani', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461375&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8eefcc48-a1d2-4f8d-aea2-eecde19eeca2', 'multiverseId': 461375}, 'multiverseid': 461375}, {'name': 'Ajani, el de Corazón Grande', 'text': 'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de vigilancia.\\n+1: Ganas 3 vidas.\\n−2: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas y un contador de lealtad sobre cada uno de los otros planeswalkers que controlas.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Ajani', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461639&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff24f063-11b6-4e53-b3cd-8f2b6304b772', 'multiverseId': 461639}, 'multiverseid': 461639}, {'name': 'Ajani au Grandcœur', 'text': 'Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la vigilance.\\n+1 : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\n−2 : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez et un marqueur « loyauté » sur chaque autre planeswalker que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Ajani', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461903&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb961e07-6cd6-48d9-b537-58c411468e5e', 'multiverseId': 461903}, 'multiverseid': 461903}, {'name': 'Ajani dal Cuore Grande', 'text': 'Le creature che controlli hanno cautela.\\n+1: Guadagni 3 punti vita.\\n-2: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli e un segnalino fedeltà su ogni altro planeswalker che controlli.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ajani', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462167&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bb3dc96-2dbf-45f7-9591-8975bfbc48fb', 'multiverseId': 462167}, 'multiverseid': 462167}, {'name': '寛大なる者、アジャニ', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは警戒を持つ。\\n+1：あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\n-2：あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個と、あなたがコントロールしている他の各プレインズウォーカーの上に忠誠カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アジャニ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462431&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e283050-75a7-4f55-9085-e90376564dad', 'multiverseId': 462431}, 'multiverseid': 462431}, {'name': '고결한 자, 아자니', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 생물들은 경계를 가진다.\\n+1: 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\\n-2: 당신이 조종하는 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓고 당신이 조종하는 다른 모든 플레인즈워커에 충성 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '전설적 플레인즈워커 — 아자니', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462695&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a9bb819-fa0a-4139-a3c2-e82f03a72a83', 'multiverseId': 462695}, 'multiverseid': 462695}, {'name': 'Ajani, o Magnânimo', 'text': 'As criaturas que você controla têm vigilância.\\n+1: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\n−2: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla e um marcador de lealdade em cada outro planeswalker que você controla.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Lendário — Ajani', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462959&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd48d8b10-c593-48e0-984e-1465a8584519', 'multiverseId': 462959}, 'multiverseid': 462959}, {'name': 'Аджани, Великосердный', 'text': 'Существа под вашим контролем имеют Бдительность.\\n+1: вы получаете 3 жизни.\\n−2: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем и один жетон верности на каждого другого planeswalker-а под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Легендарный Planeswalker — Аджани', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463223&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48886c85-eab0-450c-bca7-141b4a9b9c7d', 'multiverseId': 463223}, 'multiverseid': 463223}, {'name': '至善阿耶尼', 'text': '由你操控的生物具有警戒异能。\\n+1：你获得3点生命。\\n−2：在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物，并在每个由你操控的其他鹏洛客上各放置一个忠诚指示物。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～阿耶尼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463487&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdaf254c-f408-415b-9a69-0a1c87a304d4', 'multiverseId': 463487}, 'multiverseid': 463487}, {'name': '至善阿耶尼', 'text': '由你操控的生物具有警戒異能。\\n+1：你獲得3點生命。\\n−2：在每個由你操控的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物，並在每個由你操控的其他鵬洛客上各放置一個忠誠指示物。', 'type': '傳奇鵬洛客 ～阿耶尼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463751&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d33acf0-3a28-4b3d-bb47-07f9d4a14395', 'multiverseId': 463751}, 'multiverseid': 463751}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Rudelmitglied\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ajanis Rudelmitglied.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Die Planeswalker beschworen die Ebenbilder alter Verbündeter herauf, deren Heimatwelten ebenfalls fallen würden, sollte Bolas siegreich sein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461195&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505d427d-271d-43e4-856d-9a6abb25284d\', \'multiverseId\': 461195}, \'multiverseid\': 461195}, {\'name\': \'Compañero de manada de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Compañero de manada de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': \'Los planeswalkers invocaron réplicas de antiguos aliados que les recordaban sus mundos natales; mundos que caerían si Nicol Bolas conseguía vencer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'296acbcc-e479-4885-a7da-1628dd0525a0\', \'multiverseId\': 461459}, \'multiverseid\': 461459}, {\'name\': "Frère de bande d\'Ajani", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Frère de bande d\'Ajani.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les Planeswalkers conjurèrent des répliques d\'anciens alliés, rappelant ainsi que d\'autres mondes disparaîtraient si Bolas l\'emportait.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461723&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dfc7be1-bed5-4c64-b67a-376a384a6fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 461723}, \'multiverseid\': 461723}, {\'name\': \'Compagno di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Compagno di Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': \'I Planeswalker evocarono repliche di antichi alleati, ricordi dei mondi che sarebbero caduti se Bolas avesse trionfato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0220c54-6ddf-46c3-a771-51225bea2316\', \'multiverseId\': 461987}, \'multiverseid\': 461987}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの群れ仲間\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、アジャニの群れ仲間の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'プレインズウォーカーたちはかつての仲間の複製を呼び出した。次にボーラスの餌食となるかもしれない故郷のことを肝に銘じるためである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e34ffa6-d2e8-4d2f-8a81-ef92c8a38365\', \'multiverseId\': 462251}, \'multiverseid\': 462251}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 형제\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 아자니의 형제에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 병사\', \'flavor\': \'플레인즈워커들은 볼라스가 승리하는 경우 그 다음으로 함락될 고향을 상기시켜 주는 옛 동료들의 복제품을 불러내었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e678f1c-9051-42cb-8d05-8c90aa824921\', \'multiverseId\': 462515}, \'multiverseid\': 462515}, {\'name\': \'Companheiro de Bando de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganhar pontos de vida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Companheiro de Bando de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os planeswalkers conjuraram réplicas de antigos aliados, lembranças de terras natais que cairiam em seguida se Nicol Bolas vencesse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64eb169b-7b77-46ed-8886-ba31350418de\', \'multiverseId\': 462779}, \'multiverseid\': 462779}, {\'name\': \'Соплеменник Аджани\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), положите один жетон +1/+1 на Соплеменника Аджани.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Planeswalker-ы творили двойников своих старинных союзников, напоминавших им о родных мирах — тех, что падут следующими, если победит Болас.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eff9edc8-3678-47ea-8b03-d0e78b645db6\', \'multiverseId\': 463043}, \'multiverseid\': 463043}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的群伴\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'鹏洛客变幻出旧时战友的模样，提醒自己：倘若这次波拉斯得胜，下一个遭殃的便是自己的家园。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa53a6a-8ff6-4a06-a1a2-48b1dcadf853\', \'multiverseId\': 463307}, \'multiverseid\': 463307}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的群伴\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'鵬洛客變幻出舊時戰友的模樣，提醒自己：倘若這次波拉斯得勝，下一個遭殃的便是自己的家園。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8dd54de-f9e9-42fc-b1c2-1f6f48a903bd\', \'multiverseId\': 463571}, \'multiverseid\': 463571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Almosenextraktor\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Krieg oder nicht, deine Spenden sind wieder fällig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90b38f8b-8d3a-4810-8a22-6cfb62f9b579\', \'multiverseId\': 461272}, \'multiverseid\': 461272}, {\'name\': \'Extractor de caridad\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Con guerra o sin ella, debes hacer tus donaciones como siempre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03f082b-ac8e-44ce-aba9-5354d93a5c93\', \'multiverseId\': 461536}, \'multiverseid\': 461536}, {\'name\': \'Extracteur de charité\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'« Guerre ou pas, vos dons doivent être versés, comme toujours. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42cd2899-abac-4ae5-abf4-d1f59ac09d36\', \'multiverseId\': 461800}, \'multiverseid\': 461800}, {\'name\': \'Estrattore di Carità\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Guerra o no, le donazioni sono obbligatorie, come sempre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2a2d20-8252-4a05-a3fa-baf21059a10c\', \'multiverseId\': 462064}, \'multiverseid\': 462064}, {\'name\': \'募金取り\', \'text\': \'絆魂\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「戦争であろうとなかろうと、支払い期限はいつも通りだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6931a3aa-3402-4338-8b48-1ef536e64f35\', \'multiverseId\': 462328}, \'multiverseid\': 462328}, {\'name\': \'구호금 징수자\', \'text\': \'생명연결\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"전쟁이 있든 없든, 헌금을 낼 때가 됐다. 언제나처럼."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c5caec3-9db0-4d2f-8d53-7f05c1c246bd\', \'multiverseId\': 462592}, \'multiverseid\': 462592}, {\'name\': \'Extrator da Caridade\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Com guerra ou sem guerra, você ainda deve fazer suas doações, como sempre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec53a27-b1f8-49ef-ae4c-7dd960eb7bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 462856}, \'multiverseid\': 462856}, {\'name\': \'Вымогатель Милостыни\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Война, не война, а пожертвования плати, как полагается».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a617e969-85be-4e41-839b-88c8e8c19335\', \'multiverseId\': 463120}, \'multiverseid\': 463120}, {\'name\': \'榨善骑士\', \'text\': \'系命\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「不管打仗还是没打仗，你的捐款期到了，这点雷打不动。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd05522d-43fe-4c6f-a9f5-25c656c315fa\', \'multiverseId\': 463384}, \'multiverseid\': 463384}, {\'name\': \'搾善騎士\', \'text\': \'繫命\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「不管打仗還是沒打仗，你的捐款期到了，這點雷打不動。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb77566-b18b-4d33-ad7d-20e77052bb42\', \'multiverseId\': 463648}, \'multiverseid\': 463648}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angrath, Kapitän der Verdammnis\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\n−2: Aufmarsch 2. (Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Falls du keine kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Zombie-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Angrath\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461418&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e1e9dd4-4ed6-4304-bae5-9bbea6e121da\', \'multiverseId\': 461418}, \'multiverseid\': 461418}, {\'name\': \'Angrath, Capitán del Caos\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\\n−2: Enrola 2. (Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. Si no controlas ninguno, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Zombie negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Angrath\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495c29fb-666c-40d2-b5b6-7f8e935a13a6\', \'multiverseId\': 461682}, \'multiverseid\': 461682}, {\'name\': \'Angrath, capitaine du chaos\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\n-2 : Amassez 2. (Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. Si vous n\'en contrôlez pas, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Zombie et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Angrath\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461946&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21baf723-6dbd-446d-9baf-5edd6e48d7fa\', \'multiverseId\': 461946}, \'multiverseid\': 461946}, {\'name\': \'Angrath, Capitano del Caos\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno minacciare.\\n-2: Recluta 2. (Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. Se non ne controlli uno, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Zombie 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Angrath\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e3c2622-dcdf-40f1-8ef5-cf45f2901cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 462210}, \'multiverseid\': 462210}, {\'name\': \'混沌の船長、アングラス\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは威迫を持つ。\\n-2：動員２を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のゾンビ・軍団・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アングラス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb9cb68b-4dd9-4bcc-9732-b95484353e74\', \'multiverseId\': 462474}, \'multiverseid\': 462474}, {\'name\': \'혼돈의 선장, 앙그라스\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 호전적을 가진다.\\n−2: 축적 2를 한다. (당신이 조종하는 군대 한 개에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 군대를 조종하고 있지 않다면, 먼저 0/0 흑색 좀비 군대 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 앙그라스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb59541-6f49-48f2-86ce-88a7d6452e21\', \'multiverseId\': 462738}, \'multiverseid\': 462738}, {\'name\': \'Angrath, Capitão do Caos\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm ameaçar.\\n−2: Arregimente 2. (Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Se você não controlar um, crie antes uma ficha de criatura preta 0/0 do tipo Zumbi Exército.)\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Angrath\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ffa565-e75e-4be4-ad3f-e3b9079ca303\', \'multiverseId\': 463002}, \'multiverseid\': 463002}, {\'name\': \'Анграт, Капитан Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем имеют Угрозу.\\n—2: Скопище 2. (Положите два жетона +1/+1 на Армию под вашим контролем. Если под вашим контролем нет Армии, то сначала создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 черная Армия Зомби.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Анграт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a066802b-6841-42b7-9c9c-6d99d4207655\', \'multiverseId\': 463266}, \'multiverseid\': 463266}, {\'name\': \'混沌船长安戈斯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有威慑异能。\\n−2：囤兵2。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置两个+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色灵俑／军队衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～安戈斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48fda500-f923-49e9-8d98-eee4fd97e6ed\', \'multiverseId\': 463530}, \'multiverseid\': 463530}, {\'name\': \'混沌船長安戈斯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有威懾異能。\\n−2：囤兵2。（在一個由你操控的軍隊上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控軍隊，則先派出一個0/0黑色殭屍／軍隊衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～安戈斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f12947c-e5bc-4414-9dfb-84add1e9f948\', \'multiverseId\': 463794}, \'multiverseid\': 463794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angraths Raserei\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert ein Artefakt.\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine Kreatur.\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert einen Planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Großartige Stadt? Pah. Das hier ist auch nur ein viel zu enger Käfig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01fd03fa-abb3-4842-b289-a5f7bc97cb2c\', \'multiverseId\': 461376}, \'multiverseid\': 461376}, {\'name\': \'Estragos de Angrath\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El jugador objetivo sacrifica un artefacto.\\n• El jugador objetivo sacrifica una criatura.\\n• El jugador objetivo sacrifica un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Una gran ciudad? No. Esto no es más que otra jaula ridícula".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4365243e-5609-4da5-b1f1-4cfffa82c01b\', \'multiverseId\': 461640}, \'multiverseid\': 461640}, {\'name\': "Sauvagerie d\'Angrath", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le joueur ciblé sacrifie un artefact.\\n• Le joueur ciblé sacrifie une créature.\\n• Le joueur ciblé sacrifie un planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Une grande cité ? Non. Ce n\'est rien de plus qu\'une autre cage sordide. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e79ec9-a5e2-4d9d-8c4d-71718ef14f37\', \'multiverseId\': 461904}, \'multiverseid\': 461904}, {\'name\': \'Frenesia di Angrath\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio sacrifica un artefatto.\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio sacrifica una creatura.\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio sacrifica un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Una città imponente? No. Questa è solo un\\\'altra squallida gabbia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8826be84-56e2-4640-bb05-58503acb25ca\', \'multiverseId\': 462168}, \'multiverseid\': 462168}, {\'name\': \'アングラスの暴力\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはプレインズウォーカー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「大都市だと？違う。ここは不潔な檻に過ぎない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13af3859-2437-48b7-bc5b-31c5ca64cb73\', \'multiverseId\': 462432}, \'multiverseid\': 462432}, {\'name\': \'앙그라스의 광란\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 마법물체 한 개를 희생한다.\\n• 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n• 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 플레인즈워커 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"장엄한 도시라고? 아니. 이곳은 또다른 추잡스런 우리일 뿐이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5156dba9-51ed-46ce-9446-0c9730e55bd2\', \'multiverseId\': 462696}, \'multiverseid\': 462696}, {\'name\': \'Cólera de Angrath\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• O jogador alvo sacrifica um artefato.\\n• O jogador alvo sacrifica uma criatura.\\n• O jogador alvo sacrifica um planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Cidade grandiosa? Não. Isso aqui não passa de outra cela esquálida."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b085cd-9255-4218-80cc-415212dc216c\', \'multiverseId\': 462960}, \'multiverseid\': 462960}, {\'name\': \'Бешенство Анграта\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевой игрок жертвует артефакт.\\n• Целевой игрок жертвует существо.\\n• Целевой игрок жертвует planeswalker-а.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Великий город? Нет. Это просто очередная убогая клетка».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b5ff6f1-70eb-4e8e-a1db-5049c8703e5a\', \'multiverseId\': 463224}, \'multiverseid\': 463224}, {\'name\': \'安戈斯的狂愤\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标牌手牺牲一个神器。\\n•目标牌手牺牲一个生物。\\n•目标牌手牺牲一个鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「宏伟都市？错。这里不过又是一个破败的囚笼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e49d988d-a05e-4ee9-9819-8e5d2699f055\', \'multiverseId\': 463488}, \'multiverseid\': 463488}, {\'name\': \'安戈斯的狂憤\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•目標玩家犧牲一個神器。\\n•目標玩家犧牲一個生物。\\n•目標玩家犧牲一個鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「宏偉都市？錯。這裡不過又是一個破敗的囚籠。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60e74d8-9777-4a3b-8984-796948914a1f\', \'multiverseId\': 463752}, \'multiverseid\': 463752}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anschwellende Volksmenge\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur oder ein Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Anschwellende Volksmenge.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'Trauer ist ein Schmelztiegel, der unsere Entschlossenheit festigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461220&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'240c12ac-17e0-4b93-b98f-58ea0d133da1\', \'multiverseId\': 461220}, \'multiverseid\': 461220}, {\'name\': \'Pueblo indignado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura o planeswalker que controlas muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Pueblo indignado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'El dolor es un crisol donde se templa la resolución.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36cb2d4c-966e-4634-97ef-4c30a36b01d3\', \'multiverseId\': 461484}, \'multiverseid\': 461484}, {\'name\': \'Soulèvement de la population\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature ou qu\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Soulèvement de la population.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain\', \'flavor\': \'Le chagrin est un creuset où se forge la détermination.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37c05b5c-a865-46ed-b4aa-b1adb8acd045\', \'multiverseId\': 461748}, \'multiverseid\': 461748}, {\'name\': \'Popolazione in Rivolta\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura o un altro planeswalker che controlli muoiono, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Popolazione in Rivolta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Il dolore è un crogiolo in cui si tempra la determinazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ed313d-3f2c-4a2c-998e-19fc9dc28648\', \'multiverseId\': 462012}, \'multiverseid\': 462012}, {\'name\': \'立ち上がる民衆\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーが１体死亡するたび、立ち上がる民衆の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': \'悲しみというるつぼが、決意を煮詰めてゆく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3f3319-dc91-498f-8ef8-c0181fcc6f96\', \'multiverseId\': 462276}, \'multiverseid\': 462276}, {\'name\': \'일어나는 대중\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 생물 또는 플레인즈워커가 죽을 때마다, 일어나는 대중에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간\', \'flavor\': \'슬픔은 결의를 담금질하는 도가니이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a72a480b-c51b-496b-9eb0-90b649eafde4\', \'multiverseId\': 462540}, \'multiverseid\': 462540}, {\'name\': \'Levante Popular\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura ou planeswalker que você controla morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Levante Popular.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'O luto é um crisol em que se tempera a determinação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aadc20cf-94e7-4378-b16d-241cd0d5f05d\', \'multiverseId\': 462804}, \'multiverseid\': 462804}, {\'name\': \'Восставшие Горожане\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другое существо или planeswalker под вашим контролем умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Восставших Горожан.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек\', \'flavor\': \'Горе — это горнило, в котором закаляется решимость.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b613370-bc79-4dc8-82b0-e84fef073749\', \'multiverseId\': 463068}, \'multiverseid\': 463068}, {\'name\': \'起义民众\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物或鹏洛客死去时，在起义民众上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类\', \'flavor\': \'悲痛恰是锤炼决心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85394353-982a-4bef-9f5f-46e2c8a2cb8f\', \'multiverseId\': 463332}, \'multiverseid\': 463332}, {\'name\': \'起義民眾\', \'text\': \'每當另一個由你操控的生物或鵬洛客死去時，在起義民眾上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類\', \'flavor\': \'悲痛恰是錘鍊決心。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31c7a34f-650d-47ed-a0e5-fab4edf7038c\', \'multiverseId\': 463596}, \'multiverseid\': 463596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanist der Schreckenshorde\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Arkanist der Schreckenshorde angreift, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl, deren umgewandelte Manakosten kleiner oder gleich der Stärke des Arkanisten der Schreckenshorde sind, aus deinem Friedhof wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls die Karte in diesem Zug auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461316&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fadc2b94-973f-491a-bb58-cc0f6bec590d\', \'multiverseId\': 461316}, \'multiverseid\': 461316}, {\'name\': \'Arcanista de la Horda del Terror\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Arcanista de la Horda del Terror ataque, puedes lanzar la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo con coste de maná convertido menor o igual que la fuerza del Arcanista de la Horda del Terror desde tu cementerio sin pagar su coste de maná. Si esa carta fuera a ir a tu cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a10804d-6b5d-4eb5-9478-05473ae9daaa\', \'multiverseId\': 461580}, \'multiverseid\': 461580}, {\'name\': "Arcaniste de la Horde de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Arcaniste de la Horde de l\'effroi attaque, vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à la force de l\'Arcaniste de la Horde de l\'effroi depuis votre cimetière sans payer son coût de mana. Si cette carte devait être mise dans votre cimetière ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9daef979-dbd4-4a7a-b18c-70d3c752cd93\', \'multiverseId\': 461844}, \'multiverseid\': 461844}, {\'name\': "Arcanista dell\'Orda Atroce", \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Arcanista dell\'Orda Atroce attacca, puoi lanciare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore alla forza dell\'Arcanista dell\'Orda Atroce dal tuo cimitero senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se quella carta sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero in questo turno, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88053c4d-f3b4-438a-af33-270fa7a5863f\', \'multiverseId\': 462108}, \'multiverseid\': 462108}, {\'name\': \'戦慄衆の秘儀術師\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n戦慄衆の秘儀術師が攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地から、点数で見たマナ・コストが戦慄衆の秘儀術師のパワー以下でありインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。このターン、そのカードがあなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9fdfe9-cb7e-4c43-9bb6-a184aa4d6907\', \'multiverseId\': 462372}, \'multiverseid\': 462372}, {\'name\': \'공포군단 비전술사\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n공포군단 비전술사가 공격할 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 공포군단 비전술사의 공격력 이하인 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 카드를 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다. 그 카드가 이 턴에 당신의 무덤에 들어가려고 하면, 대신에 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de9b1c71-9ea3-4f0a-baf6-c7fd58f6a986\', \'multiverseId\': 462636}, \'multiverseid\': 462636}, {\'name\': \'Arcanista da Horda Medonha\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Arcanista da Horda Medonha ataca, você pode conjurar o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior ao poder de Arcanista da Horda Medonha do seu cemitério sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se aquele card seria colocado no seu cemitério neste turno, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a9d41e-6a28-43c5-b523-185f5ecbf342\', \'multiverseId\': 462900}, \'multiverseid\': 462900}, {\'name\': \'Арканист Орды Ужаса\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Арканист Орды Ужаса атакует, вы можете разыграть целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства с конвертированной мана-стоимостью, не превышающей значение силы Арканиста Орды Ужаса, из вашего кладбища без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Если та карта должна быть положена на ваше кладбище в этом ходу, изгоните ее вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fb677a3-1355-411d-84b0-b60c0c0b5146\', \'multiverseId\': 463164}, \'multiverseid\': 463164}, {\'name\': \'震惧军奥术师\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当震惧军奥术师攻击时，选择目标在你坟墓场中且总法术力费用等于或小于震惧军奥术师力量的瞬间或法术牌。你可以从该处施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果该牌于本回合中将置入你的坟墓场，则改为将其放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73dbf42-1198-4b4b-bc56-05ee90e7dfad\', \'multiverseId\': 463428}, \'multiverseid\': 463428}, {\'name\': \'震懼軍奧術師\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n每當震懼軍奧術師攻擊時，選擇目標在你墳墓場中且總魔法力費用等於或小於震懼軍奧術師力量的瞬間或巫術牌。你可以從該處施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。如果該牌於本回合中將置入你的墳墓場，則改為將其放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3f49275-ed3f-40c3-87b8-b97d52c944be\', \'multiverseId\': 463692}, \'multiverseid\': 463692}]', "[{'name': 'Arlinn, Stimme des Rudels', 'text': 'Jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und die ein Wolf oder Werwolf ist, kommt mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\n−2: Erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461341&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9141d0f3-32dd-481f-87fc-a26c05ef5219', 'multiverseId': 461341}, 'multiverseid': 461341}, {'name': 'Arlinn, la Voz de la Manada', 'text': 'Cada criatura que controlas que sea un Lobo o un Licántropo entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.\\n−2: Crea una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461605&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b253bb2c-c567-4698-ade5-9c7f90bff35a', 'multiverseId': 461605}, 'multiverseid': 461605}, {'name': 'Arlinn, voix de la meute', 'text': 'Chaque créature que vous contrôlez qui est un loup ou un loup-garou arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.\\n-2 : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461869&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1ab31eb-3392-4c49-b264-807a7b334bcb', 'multiverseId': 461869}, 'multiverseid': 461869}, {'name': 'Arlinn, Voce del Branco', 'text': 'Ogni creatura che controlli che è un Lupo o un Mannaro entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.\\n-2: Crea una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462133&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '462b6991-ae06-43eb-8b3a-b6910902609c', 'multiverseId': 462133}, 'multiverseid': 462133}, {'name': '群れの声、アーリン', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていて狼か狼男である各クリーチャーは、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n-2：緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アーリン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462397&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4af6b694-a082-4924-8a9a-20470e4292e7', 'multiverseId': 462397}, 'multiverseid': 462397}, {'name': '무리의 목소리, 아를린', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 늑대 또는 늑대인간인 각 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 추가로 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\\n-2: 2/2 녹색 늑대 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.', 'type': '전설적 플레인즈워커 — 아를린', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462661&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc457d41-4258-4dc7-9437-50d048de350e', 'multiverseId': 462661}, 'multiverseid': 462661}, {'name': 'Arlinn, Voz da Alcateia', 'text': 'Cada criatura que você controla que for um Lobo ou um Lobisomem entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional.\\n−2: Crie uma ficha de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Lobo.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Lendário — Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462925&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '727e4d14-e624-452a-95ce-076db579525a', 'multiverseId': 462925}, 'multiverseid': 462925}, {'name': 'Арлинн, Голос Стаи', 'text': 'Каждое существо под вашим контролем, которое является Волком или Вервольфом, выходит на поле битвы с одним дополнительным жетоном +1/+1 на нем.\\n—2: создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 зеленый Волк.', 'type': 'Легендарный Planeswalker — Арлинн', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463189&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81be43fb-fe0c-4c9d-823c-723103f44096', 'multiverseId': 463189}, 'multiverseid': 463189}, {'name': '狼群之声雅琳', 'text': '由你操控且为狼或狼人的生物进战场时上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n−2：派出一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～雅琳', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463453&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fa64d99-828a-4f33-ae4c-828fdcbc85b3', 'multiverseId': 463453}, 'multiverseid': 463453}, {'name': '狼群之聲雅琳', 'text': '由你操控且為狼或狼人的生物進戰場時上面額外有一個+1/+1指示物。\\n−2：派出一個2/2綠色的狼衍生生物。', 'type': '傳奇鵬洛客 ～雅琳', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463717&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f7faad0-0b14-4aaf-97a4-d9389ef87192', 'multiverseId': 463717}, 'multiverseid': 463717}]", '[{\'name\': \'Arlinns Wolf\', \'text\': \'Arlinns Wolf kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich übersetze das Knurren mal für dich: ‚Noch ein Schritt näher, und ich reiße dir die Kehle auf.\\\'"\\n—Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e72f7d-4207-4892-95bd-28249c2ca88a\', \'multiverseId\': 461342}, \'multiverseid\': 461342}, {\'name\': \'Loba de Arlinn\', \'text\': \'La Loba de Arlinn no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si no hablas lupino, permíteme que te lo traduzca: \\\'Un paso más y te desgarraré la garganta\\\'".\\n—Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'342b8255-5a7c-4bee-ad08-db90dcfd4aac\', \'multiverseId\': 461606}, \'multiverseid\': 461606}, {\'name\': "Loup d\'Arlinn", \'text\': "Le Loup d\'Arlinn ne peut pas être bloqué par les créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'« Si vous ne parlez pas loup, je vais vous le traduire : "Encore un pas et je vous arrache la gorge." »\\n—Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b48af76-13ba-4806-b36e-ed32c09ce6a5\', \'multiverseId\': 461870}, \'multiverseid\': 461870}, {\'name\': \'Lupo di Arlinn\', \'text\': \'Il Lupo di Arlinn non può essere bloccato da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non parli lupesco, permettimi di tradurre: \\\'Un altro passo e ti sgozzo.\\\'"\\n—Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e91d94e1-3320-4e5e-9c4e-ad5baace9c41\', \'multiverseId\': 462134}, \'multiverseid\': 462134}, {\'name\': \'アーリンの狼\', \'text\': \'アーリンの狼は、パワーが２以下のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'「狼の言葉が分からないみたいだから通訳してあげるわ。『もう１歩でも近付いたらお前の喉を噛み切る。』だそうよ。」\\n――アーリン・コード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f761bc-f334-4279-9230-74b3698078a8\', \'multiverseId\': 462398}, \'multiverseid\': 462398}, {\'name\': \'아를린의 늑대\', \'text\': \'아를린의 늑대는 공격력이 2 이하인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': \'"늑대 말을 못 하면, 내가 통역해 주지: \\\'한 발자국만 더 다가오면 목줄기를 찢어 놓겠어.\\\'"\\n—아를린 코르드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c144c071-74c3-4f0f-b1ec-018fdb590c99\', \'multiverseId\': 462662}, \'multiverseid\': 462662}, {\'name\': \'Lobo de Arlinn\', \'text\': \'Lobo de Arlinn não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você não fala lupino, deixa que eu traduzo: \\\'Mais um passo e eu rasgo a sua garganta.\\\'"\\n— Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'344cdf16-34bf-42a1-befc-9ac8828bf299\', \'multiverseId\': 462926}, \'multiverseid\': 462926}, {\'name\': \'Волк Арлинн\', \'text\': \'Волк Арлинн не может быть заблокирован существами с силой 2 или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': \'«Если не говоришь по-волчьи, я тебе переведу: "Еще шаг, и я вырву тебе глотку"».\\n— Арлинн Корд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49b51670-4f39-4e35-85f5-57a1803436eb\', \'multiverseId\': 463190}, \'multiverseid\': 463190}, {\'name\': \'雅琳的凶狼\', \'text\': \'雅琳的凶狼不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你听不懂狼语，那就让我来翻译一下：『再敢靠近一步，我就撕开你的喉咙。』」\\n～雅琳珂德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aa6abec-708c-40c1-b517-6e604b611834\', \'multiverseId\': 463454}, \'multiverseid\': 463454}, {\'name\': \'雅琳的凶狼\', \'text\': \'雅琳的凶狼不能被力量等於或小於2的生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你聽不懂狼語，那就讓我來翻譯一下：『再敢靠近一步，我就撕開你的喉嚨。』」\\n～雅琳珂德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f8736ff-ca93-4c63-b299-50760fd2af58\', \'multiverseId\': 463718}, \'multiverseid\': 463718}]', "[{'name': 'Ashiok die Traumverzerrung', 'text': 'Zaubersprüche und Fähigkeiten, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, können nicht bewirken, dass ihre Beherrscher ihre Bibliothek durchsuchen.\\n−1: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl legt die obersten vier Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof. Schicke dann die Friedhöfe aller Gegner ins Exil.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ashiok', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461419&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54a1f3ae-09bc-4ebb-a60c-df1f1cac5acb', 'multiverseId': 461419}, 'multiverseid': 461419}, {'name': 'Ashiok, Fabricasueños', 'text': 'Los hechizos y habilidades que controlan tus oponentes no pueden hacer que su controlador busque en su biblioteca.\\n−1: El jugador objetivo pone las cuatro primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio. Luego, exilia el cementerio de cada oponente.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Ashiok', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461683&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '460485be-ae34-44a7-aa57-cfe9859bdb4c', 'multiverseId': 461683}, 'multiverseid': 461683}, {'name': 'Ashiok, broyeur de rêves', 'text': 'Les sorts et les capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent ne peuvent pas faire chercher leur contrôleur dans sa bibliothèque.\\n-1 : Le joueur ciblé met les quatre cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière. Ensuite, exilez le cimetière de chaque adversaire.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Ashiok', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461947&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a84fb6e5-35b9-4632-82d8-0155236d8348', 'multiverseId': 461947}, 'multiverseid': 461947}, {'name': 'Ashiok, Devastatore di Sogni', 'text': 'Le magie e le abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari non possono far passare in rassegna al loro controllore il suo grimorio.\\n-1: Un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero le prime quattro carte del suo grimorio. Poi esilia il cimitero di ogni avversario.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ashiok', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462211&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79f92963-9eee-4523-a062-bf3e45c7bc67', 'multiverseId': 462211}, 'multiverseid': 462211}, {'name': '夢を引き裂く者、アショク', 'text': '対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力は、それのコントローラーにそのプレイヤーのライブラリーからカードを探させることができない。\\n-1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚自分の墓地に置く。その後、各対戦相手の墓地を追放する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アショク', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462475&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff4099d9-0d40-474a-892e-a9b158514e39', 'multiverseId': 462475}, 'multiverseid': 462475}, {'name': '꿈을 찢는 자, 아시오크', 'text': '상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력은 그 주문이나 능력의 조종자가 자신의 서고를 찾게 할 수 없다.\\n−1: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다. 그 후 각 상대의 무덤을 추방한다.', 'type': '전설적 플레인즈워커 — 아시오크', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462739&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2476239d-b0cb-491e-bb35-2d05144de901', 'multiverseId': 462739}, 'multiverseid': 462739}, {'name': 'Ashiok, Dissolvedor de Sonhos', 'text': 'As mágicas e habilidades que seus oponentes controlam não podem fazer com que seus controladores procurem cards no próprio grimório.\\n−1: O jogador alvo coloca os quatro cards do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério. Em seguida, exile o cemitério de cada oponente.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Lendário — Ashiok', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463003&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '441c07cc-e8af-417e-a0ec-12c683700481', 'multiverseId': 463003}, 'multiverseid': 463003}, {'name': 'Ашиок, Кромсатель Снов', 'text': 'Заклинания и способности под контролем ваших оппонентов не могут заставить контролирующих их игроков искать в своих библиотеках.\\n—1: целевой игрок кладет четыре верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище. Затем изгоните кладбище каждого оппонента.', 'type': 'Легендарный Planeswalker — Ашиок', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463267&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26013055-917b-4732-9aba-a6d31ec18cb4', 'multiverseId': 463267}, 'multiverseid': 463267}, {'name': '裂梦师安梭苛', 'text': '由对手操控的咒语和异能无法让其操控者搜寻其牌库。\\n−1：目标牌手将其牌库顶的四张牌置入其坟墓场。然后放逐所有对手的坟墓场。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～安梭苛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463531&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f68f3cf4-dcb4-4135-bcfc-02764aee102e', 'multiverseId': 463531}, 'multiverseid': 463531}, {'name': '裂夢師安梭苛', 'text': '由對手操控的咒語和異能無法讓其操控者搜尋其牌庫。\\n−1：目標玩家將其牌庫頂的四張牌置入其墳墓場。然後放逐所有對手的墳墓場。', 'type': '傳奇鵬洛客 ～安梭苛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463795&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e92ab6a7-6934-4423-bbb5-8f80a7320d8c', 'multiverseId': 463795}, 'multiverseid': 463795}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ashioks Schleicher\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Ashioks Schleicher kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr\', \'flavor\': \'„Tief in deinem Innersten windet sich die Furcht. Du wusstest schon immer, dass du dich ihr eines Tages stellen müsstest."\\n—Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461231&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bde0d68-befe-4bc1-9470-8807dc9ae482\', \'multiverseId\': 461231}, \'multiverseid\': 461231}, {\'name\': \'Acechador de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: El Acechador de Ashiok no puede ser bloqueado este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadilla\', \'flavor\': \'"El miedo susurra y se retuerce en las sombras de tu mente. Es el enemigo que siempre supiste que llegaría".\\n—Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c5cbc6-5ebe-4f05-9634-44f14df3129e\', \'multiverseId\': 461495}, \'multiverseid\': 461495}, {\'name\': "Indolent d\'Ashiok", \'text\': "{3}{U} : L\'Indolent d\'Ashiok ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : cauchemar\', \'flavor\': "« La peur sinue et murmure dans les ombres de votre esprit. C\'est l\'ennemi dont vous avez toujours redouté l\'arrivée. »\\n—Ashiok", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461759&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'087ce7ab-669c-43a3-83b6-88dbcaaaa31b\', \'multiverseId\': 461759}, \'multiverseid\': 461759}, {\'name\': \'Furtiva di Ashiok\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: La Furtiva di Ashiok non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incubo\', \'flavor\': \'"Temi i fremiti e i sussurri nell\\\'oscurità della tua mente. È il nemico che hai sempre saputo sarebbe giunto."\\n—Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1fad7a1-6560-4026-b08f-33ed43908654\', \'multiverseId\': 462023}, \'multiverseid\': 462023}, {\'name\': \'アショクの潜伏者\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：このターン、アショクの潜伏者はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア\', \'flavor\': \'「心の影の部分で恐怖が身悶え囁く。それはいつか訪れると分かっていた宿敵なのだ。」\\n――アショク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7100da1-5b14-4d67-85aa-a1d411a7a8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 462287}, \'multiverseid\': 462287}, {\'name\': \'아시오크의 잠복꾼\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: 아시오크의 잠복꾼은 이 턴에 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 나이트메어\', \'flavor\': \'"네 정신의 그림자 속에서 공포가 몸부림치며 속삭인다. 너도 찾아오리라는 것을 항상 알고 있었지."\\n—아시오크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd6b4310-4105-4797-86c4-302b28bb0ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 462551}, \'multiverseid\': 462551}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador de Ashiok\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Espreitador de Ashiok não pode ser bloqueado neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadelo\', \'flavor\': \'"O medo habita as profundezas da sua mente, retorcendo-se e sussurrando. Ele é o inimigo que você sempre soube que viria."\\n— Ashiok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26e9495-6304-4211-8702-6eca65958b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 462815}, \'multiverseid\': 462815}, {\'name\': \'Соглядатай Ашиока\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Соглядатай Ашиока не может быть заблокирован в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошмар\', \'flavor\': \'«Страх извивается и шепчет в тенях твоего разума. Он твой враг, но ты всегда знал, что он придет к тебе».\\n— Ашиок\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a22eaab-aa55-44b1-b179-3329cc2c6553\', \'multiverseId\': 463079}, \'multiverseid\': 463079}, {\'name\': \'安梭苛的潜梦魔\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：安梭苛的潜梦魔本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～梦魇\', \'flavor\': \'「在你的心灵阴影处，有种叫恐惧的情绪不断扭曲触动你的情绪，低语瓦解你的心防。它是你早知道会找上门来的敌人。」\\n～安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94363fc-0eef-42f0-9704-fa523293e137\', \'multiverseId\': 463343}, \'multiverseid\': 463343}, {\'name\': \'安梭苛的潛夢魔\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：安梭苛的潛夢魔本回合不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～夢魘\', \'flavor\': \'「在你的心靈陰影處，有種叫恐懼的情緒不斷扭曲觸動你的情緒，低語瓦解你的心防。它是你早知道會找上門來的敵人。」\\n～安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04aec250-e053-41f7-bfb6-2d0ee41d851c\', \'multiverseId\': 463607}, \'multiverseid\': 463607}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehligen der Schreckenshorde\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen- und/oder Planeswalker-Karten deiner Wahl in Friedhöfen. Befehligen der Schreckenshorde fügt dir Schaden in Höhe der Summe der umgewandelten Manakosten jener Karten zu. Bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': "Liliana biss hinter dem Kettenschleier die Zähne zusammen und übernahm die Kontrolle über Bolas\' riesige Armee.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aad9e92-b8b2-4b39-ac63-a686d9c89ad5\', \'multiverseId\': 461273}, \'multiverseid\': 461273}, {\'name\': \'Comandar la Horda del Terror\', \'text\': \'Elige cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura y/o planeswalker objetivo en los cementerios. Comandar la Horda del Terror te hace una cantidad de daño igual al coste de maná convertido total de esas cartas. Ponlas en el campo de batalla bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana tomó las riendas del gigantesco ejército de Nicol Bolas, apretando la mandíbula detrás del Velo de Cadenas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1430c7-6a3c-4edb-9f35-70b3b562765a\', \'multiverseId\': 461537}, \'multiverseid\': 461537}, {\'name\': "Commander la Horde de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature et/ou de planeswalker ciblées dans les cimetières. Commander la Horde de l\'effroi vous inflige un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana total de ces cartes. Mettez-les sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Liliana prit les rênes de l\'immense armée de Bolas, les dents serrées derrière le Voile de Chaîne.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b08b5a00-c4e5-48d4-b888-5611c4491008\', \'multiverseId\': 461801}, \'multiverseid\': 461801}, {\'name\': "Comandare l\'Orda Atroce", \'text\': "Scegli un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura e/o planeswalker bersaglio nei cimiteri. Comandare l\'Orda Atroce ti infligge danno pari al costo di mana convertito totale di quelle carte. Mettile sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana prese le redini del vasto esercito di Bolas, stringendo i denti sotto il Velo di Catena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3590dd1b-7f3b-42b6-8721-a3a2e769b6dc\', \'multiverseId\': 462065}, \'multiverseid\': 462065}, {\'name\': \'戦慄衆の指揮\', \'text\': \'墓地からクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーである望む数のカードを対象とする。戦慄衆の指揮はあなたに、それらのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストの合計に等しい点数のダメージを与える。それらをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'リリアナはボーラスの大軍団を掌握したが、鎖のヴェールの裏側では歯を噛み締めていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f852b6-a89e-413c-95b2-c1105c062543\', \'multiverseId\': 462329}, \'multiverseid\': 462329}, {\'name\': \'공포군단 지휘\', \'text\': \'무덤들에 있는 생물 및/또는 플레인즈워커 카드들을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 공포군단 지휘는 그렇게 선택된 카드들의 전환마나비용의 총합만큼 당신에게 피해를 입힌다. 그 카드들을 당신의 조종하에 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'릴리아나는 사슬 베일 너머에서 이를 악물며 볼라스의 광대한 군대의 고삐를 움켜쥐었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'274d5fc7-235e-458a-bbcf-f6d666a55d55\', \'multiverseId\': 462593}, \'multiverseid\': 462593}, {\'name\': \'Comandar a Horda Medonha\', \'text\': \'Escolha qualquer número de cards de criatura e/ou planeswalker alvo nos cemitérios. Comandar a Horda Medonha causa a você uma quantidade de dano igual ao custo de mana convertido total daqueles cards. Coloque-os no campo de batalha sob o seu controle.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana tomou as rédeas do vasto exército de Nicol Bolas, rangendo os dentes por trás do Véu Metálico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e296d01-c9ba-4b4a-b94c-0c332b2769fe\', \'multiverseId\': 462857}, \'multiverseid\': 462857}, {\'name\': \'Повелевание Ордой Ужаса\', \'text\': \'Выберите любое количество целевых карт существ и (или) planeswalker-ов на кладбищах. Повелевание Ордой Ужаса наносит вам повреждения, равные суммарной конвертированной мана-стоимости тех карт. Положите их на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Стиснув зубы за Кольчужной Завесой, Лилиана взялась за удила неисчислимой армии Боласа.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'452a3d97-dfb8-4069-bf20-bc89c9924dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 463121}, \'multiverseid\': 463121}, {\'name\': \'统领震惧军\', \'text\': \'选择任意数量目标在坟墓场中的生物和／或鹏洛客牌。统领震惧军对你造成伤害，其数量等同于这些牌总法术力费用的总和。将它们在你的操控下放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'虽然莉莲娜坐拥号令波拉斯大军的兵权，但在锁链面纱之下，却是一副咬牙切齿的表情。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be7b001f-fcd6-4017-9454-e23e06ea188e\', \'multiverseId\': 463385}, \'multiverseid\': 463385}, {\'name\': \'統領震懼軍\', \'text\': \'選擇任意數量目標在墳墓場中的生物和／或鵬洛客牌。統領震懼軍對你造成傷害，其數量等同於這些牌總魔法力費用的總和。將它們在你的操控下放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'雖然莉蓮娜坐擁號令波拉斯大軍的兵權，但在鎖鏈面紗之下，卻是一副咬牙切齒的表情。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5015f74-3d41-4a62-a7db-5d86c2e7bdb1\', \'multiverseId\': 463649}, \'multiverseid\': 463649}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beflügeltes Aufgebot\', \'text\': \'Enttappe alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. Kreaturen mit Flugfähigkeit, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst die Wolken wurden zum Schlachtfeld. Hoch in den Lüften rangen die Verewigten mit Engelsgeschwadern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461218&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46569f61-5e11-4522-a1b4-168e679c9115\', \'multiverseId\': 461218}, \'multiverseid\': 461218}, {\'name\': \'Ataque alado\', \'text\': \'Endereza todas las criaturas que controlas. Las criaturas que controlas con la habilidad de volar obtienen +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso las nubes se convirtieron en un escenario de combate conocido como el "cielo de batalla". En él, los eternos se enfrentaron a escuadrones de ángeles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e6a19b-aafa-458f-a78f-2b246192c7a7\', \'multiverseId\': 461482}, \'multiverseid\': 461482}, {\'name\': "Ralliement d\'ailes", \'text\': "Dégagez toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez. Les créatures avec le vol que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Même les nuages devinrent un champ de bataille. Dans ce Front céleste, les Éternels affrontaient des escadrons d\'anges.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec46ff21-ff94-4d2d-bf64-8809f69b2437\', \'multiverseId\': 461746}, \'multiverseid\': 461746}, {\'name\': "Adunata d\'Ali", \'text\': \'STAPpa tutte le creature che controlli. Le creature con volare che controlli prendono +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Perfino le nuvole divennero un campo di battaglia: il cosiddetto Teatro Aereo vide gli Eterni scontrarsi con squadroni di angeli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e8cc59f-a405-4f35-8852-5462465e81d1\', \'multiverseId\': 462010}, \'multiverseid\': 462010}, {\'name\': \'翼の結集\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーをすべてアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていて飛行を持つクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'雲もまた戦場と化していた。空戦域と呼ばれるその場所では、永遠衆と天使の激突が繰り広げられていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90eba3ab-09a3-4e7e-87e7-8f41f80d21e8\', \'multiverseId\': 462274}, \'multiverseid\': 462274}, {\'name\': \'날개의 결집\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 모든 생물을 언탭한다. 당신이 조종하는 비행을 가진 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'구름들마저도 전장이 되었다. 창공활극이라고 알려진 그 구름은 영생자들과 천사 부대가 격돌하는 것을 목격했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a874d71-22de-49a0-abcc-840d9dfb3f90\', \'multiverseId\': 462538}, \'multiverseid\': 462538}, {\'name\': \'Reunião de Asas\', \'text\': \'Desvire todas as criaturas que você controla. As criaturas que você controla com voar recebem +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Até as nuvens transformaram-se num campo de batalha. A área ficou conhecida como o Palco Celeste, e testemunhou os embates dos Eternos contra os esquadrões de anjos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd6f3ddd-a67d-45c5-ba9f-552bd7cc0d35\', \'multiverseId\': 462802}, \'multiverseid\': 462802}, {\'name\': \'Созыв Крылатых\', \'text\': \'Разверните все существа под вашим контролем. Существа с Полетом под вашим контролем получают +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Даже облака превратились в поле битвы. Здесь, на Небесном фронте, вековечные сражались с эскадрильями ангелов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afe7beea-73cd-4863-8b30-40a41bc2cd99\', \'multiverseId\': 463066}, \'multiverseid\': 463066}, {\'name\': \'飞翼集结\', \'text\': \'重置所有由你操控的生物。由你操控且具飞行异能的生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'就连云端也成了杀戮战场。永生者与天使军团在这片人称空舞战阵的修罗炼狱之处殊死作战。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a68a41-2bad-4ffc-8e68-8b830a2614fc\', \'multiverseId\': 463330}, \'multiverseid\': 463330}, {\'name\': \'飛翼集結\', \'text\': \'重置所有由你操控的生物。由你操控且具飛行異能的生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'就連雲端也成了殺戮戰場。永生者與天使軍團在這片人稱空舞戰陣的修羅煉獄之處殊死作戰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'676dd1d9-dc0b-4aa6-b60c-d12949f58d35\', \'multiverseId\': 463594}, \'multiverseid\': 463594}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beförderung im Kampf\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Die Kreatur erhält Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Willkommen in der Legion. Du hast einen Distrikt gerettet — jetzt lass uns die Welt retten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461196&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd45c9e5-3ed2-487b-9370-ea52959454bb\', \'multiverseId\': 461196}, \'multiverseid\': 461196}, {\'name\': \'Ascenso en batalla\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno. Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Bienvenida a la Legión. Ya salvaste un distrito; ahora, salvemos el mundo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acc77eee-d982-4f09-805a-d6ed5f9ae1f5\', \'multiverseId\': 461460}, \'multiverseid\': 461460}, {\'name\': \'Promotion de campagne\', \'text\': "Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée. Cette créature acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Bienvenue dans la Légion ! Vous avez sauvé une circonscription... Maintenant, allez sauver le monde. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461724&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf20ecf0-f10b-41d1-8907-85b942fcbb4c\', \'multiverseId\': 461724}, \'multiverseid\': 461724}, {\'name\': \'Promozione sul Campo\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Benvenuta nella Legione. Hai salvato un distretto... ora andiamo a salvare il mondo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f985d4c-d761-4f4a-9285-20f0c92e1e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 461988}, \'multiverseid\': 461988}, {\'name\': \'戦地昇進\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは先制攻撃を得る。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ボロス軍へようこそ。君はこの管区を救った。次は世界を救ってくれ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d55473-c87d-49b8-a414-d935a63f1835\', \'multiverseId\': 462252}, \'multiverseid\': 462252}, {\'name\': \'전쟁터 속 승격\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 선제공격을 얻는다. 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"군단에 온 것을 환영하네. 자네는 거리를 구했네—이제는 세계를 구하러 가세."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac1da003-d45a-43be-b3b3-b0ee6d5a8960\', \'multiverseId\': 462516}, \'multiverseid\': 462516}, {\'name\': \'Promoção em Campo\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Aquela criatura ganha iniciativa até o final do turno. Você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Bem-vinda à Legião. Você salvou um distrito, agora é hora de salvar o mundo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c239c1b-d35e-4130-a664-2244f57cf955\', \'multiverseId\': 462780}, \'multiverseid\': 462780}, {\'name\': \'Боевое Повышение\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо. То существо получает Первый удар до конца хода. Вы получаете 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Добро пожаловать в Легион. Ты спасла округ — теперь давай спасать мир».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69dc24e9-bb3a-4ca8-91f2-460b65819685\', \'multiverseId\': 463044}, \'multiverseid\': 463044}, {\'name\': \'战场晋升\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。该生物获得先攻异能直到回合结束。你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「欢迎加入教团。你拯救了这片城区～现在让我们一同拯救世界。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27f98889-f23f-404c-9a4f-b697ca618f07\', \'multiverseId\': 463308}, \'multiverseid\': 463308}, {\'name\': \'戰場晉陞\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。該生物獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。你獲得2點生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「歡迎加入教團。你拯救了這片城區～現在讓我們一同拯救世界。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c624cbd1-759c-45c0-9cfc-cb9b4e967f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 463572}, \'multiverseid\': 463572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bioessenz-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDie Bioessenz-Hydra kommt für jede Loyalitätsmarke auf Planeswalkern, die du kontrollierst, mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Loyalitätsmarken auf Planeswalker gelegt werden, die du kontrollierst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Bioessenz-Hydra.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra, Mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8948b571-274c-45fe-8c2e-236ee6400bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 461377}, \'multiverseid\': 461377}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de bioesencia\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nLa Hidra de bioesencia entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella por cada contador de lealtad sobre los planeswalkers que controlas.\\nSiempre que uno o más contadores de lealtad se pongan sobre los planeswalkers que controlas, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Hidra de bioesencia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2db074ba-ebfe-4b28-ba09-2694219c04a7\', \'multiverseId\': 461641}, \'multiverseid\': 461641}, {\'name\': \'Hydre à bioessence\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nL\'Hydre à bioessence arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, un marqueur +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « loyauté » sur les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un marqueur « loyauté » est mis sur les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre à bioessence.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre et mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc191392-ba37-4e16-bb6c-018497077549\', \'multiverseId\': 461905}, \'multiverseid\': 461905}, {\'name\': \'Idra della Bioessenza\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nL\'Idra della Bioessenza entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 per ogni segnalino fedeltà sui planeswalker che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta vengono messi uno o più segnalini fedeltà sui planeswalker che controlli, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Idra della Bioessenza.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b25ea90-1c37-4469-867b-a5c5bffed9cb\', \'multiverseId\': 462169}, \'multiverseid\': 462169}, {\'name\': \'生命素ハイドラ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n生命素ハイドラは、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの上に置かれている忠誠カウンター１個につき、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの上に忠誠カウンターが１個以上置かれるたび、その個数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを生命素ハイドラの上に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ・ミュータント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1868417-9d1c-4547-bae2-421709f72fab\', \'multiverseId\': 462433}, \'multiverseid\': 462433}, {\'name\': \'생명정수 히드라\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n생명정수 히드라는 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커들에 놓여 있는 충성 카운터 한 개당 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\\n당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커에 충성 카운터가 한 개 이상 놓일 때마다, 생명정수 히드라에 그만큼 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 히드라 돌연변이\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d8a1ca-1edc-489d-8ae1-48879ecadb72\', \'multiverseId\': 462697}, \'multiverseid\': 462697}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de Bioessência\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nHidra de Bioessência entra no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 para cada marcador de lealdade em planeswalkers que você controla.\\nToda vez que um ou mais marcadores de lealdade forem colocados em planeswalkers que você controla, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 em Hidra de Bioessência.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra Mutante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67981cb5-2ab8-46dc-b2e9-a3a9e6bc053f\', \'multiverseId\': 462961}, \'multiverseid\': 462961}, {\'name\': \'Гидра Биоэссенции\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nГидра Биоэссенции выходит на поле битвы с одним жетоном +1/+1 на ней за каждый жетон верности на planeswalker-ах под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда на planeswalker-ов под вашим контролем кладется один или несколько жетонов верности, положите такое же количество жетонов +1/+1 на Гидру Биоэссенции.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра Мутант\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29b0ba01-89a3-43e2-94e7-50b2a2a26db7\', \'multiverseId\': 463225}, \'multiverseid\': 463225}, {\'name\': \'菁粹多头龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n菁粹多头龙进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为由你操控的鹏洛客上之忠诚指示物总数量。\\n每当在由你操控的鹏洛客上放置一个或数个忠诚指示物时，在菁粹多头龙上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙／突变体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed05bb6-9fab-4414-aadc-caab29644c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 463489}, \'multiverseid\': 463489}, {\'name\': \'菁粹多頭龍\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n菁粹多頭龍進戰場時上面有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量為由你操控的鵬洛客上之忠誠指示物總數量。\\n每當在由你操控的鵬洛客上放置一個或數個忠誠指示物時，在菁粹多頭龍上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多頭龍／突變體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3249e865-5313-43d1-b3a4-04010143a464\', \'multiverseId\': 463753}, \'multiverseid\': 463753}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blendstrahl\', \'text\': \'Der Blendstrahl fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Die Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gefahr liegt im Auge des Betrachters. Jedenfalls wenn man gut zielt."\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461305&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0893fb-07b7-4c1e-ae88-1be8373caff7\', \'multiverseId\': 461305}, \'multiverseid\': 461305}, {\'name\': \'Estallido cegador\', \'text\': \'El Estallido cegador hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura no puede bloquear este turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El peligro está en el ojo del que mira. Si tu puntería es buena, claro".\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e500ed-7f14-40c9-a641-587f319db48b\', \'multiverseId\': 461569}, \'multiverseid\': 461569}, {\'name\': \'Salve aveuglante\', \'text\': \'La Salve aveuglante inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée. Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Le danger est dans l\'œil de l\'admirateur. Du moins si vous visez bien. »\\n—Jaya Ballard", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461833&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f0cfaa-8225-4307-af29-155c2c124c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 461833}, \'multiverseid\': 461833}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione Accecante\', \'text\': "L\'Esplosione Accecante infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura non può bloccare in questo turno.\\nPesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il pericolo è nell\\\'occhio di chi guarda. Beh, se hai una buona mira."\\n—Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e249718b-074c-46e9-96a5-747a069abaf6\', \'multiverseId\': 462097}, \'multiverseid\': 462097}, {\'name\': \'眩光破\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。眩光破はそれに１点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーではブロックできない。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「危険は見る者の目の中にある。少なくとも、狙いが確実なら。」\\n――ヤヤ・バラード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaf38662-ef7a-4ab6-9713-b7b75dc811d0\', \'multiverseId\': 462361}, \'multiverseid\': 462361}, {\'name\': \'실명폭발\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 실명폭발은 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"위험하다는 건 보는 사람 나름이지. 최소한, 조준만 잘 한다면 말이야."\\n—자야 발라드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb928b72-4e3e-4b78-b463-9275c43907af\', \'multiverseId\': 462625}, \'multiverseid\': 462625}, {\'name\': \'Explosão Cegante\', \'text\': \'Explosão Cegante causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo. Aquela criatura não pode bloquear neste turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O perigo está nos olhos de quem vê. Isto é, se a sua mira for boa."\\n— Jaya Ballard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32bcc4fb-99bc-4617-9ef4-640a0f222d6c\', \'multiverseId\': 462889}, \'multiverseid\': 462889}, {\'name\': \'Слепящий Взрыв\', \'text\': \'Слепящий Взрыв наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу. То существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Все опасности — в глазах смотрящего. Конечно, если умеешь как следует целиться».\\n— Джайя Баллард\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2272884-4a46-4293-abaf-86a2061e8a10\', \'multiverseId\': 463153}, \'multiverseid\': 463153}, {\'name\': \'眩目冲击\', \'text\': \'眩目冲击对目标生物造成1点伤害。该生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「各人看到的危险各不相同。至少，你得先看得准。」\\n～雅亚巴拉德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc18379e-b3f0-499a-a894-e64ac0ee59ce\', \'multiverseId\': 463417}, \'multiverseid\': 463417}, {\'name\': \'眩目衝擊\', \'text\': \'眩目衝擊對目標生物造成1點傷害。該生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「各人看到的危險各不相同。至少，你得先看得準。」\\n～雅亞巴拉德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bcdc260-2c7c-4601-8dd7-2af92f447abb\', \'multiverseId\': 463681}, \'multiverseid\': 463681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzableitung\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {3} weniger, falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst.\\nÄndere das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, der bzw. die nur ein einzelnes Ziel hat.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Gebt alles, was ihr habt … und dann noch ein bisschen mehr."\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57d5f641-1104-4a11-b54a-d3ffdfacd280\', \'multiverseId\': 461306}, \'multiverseid\': 461306}, {\'name\': \'Doblegar el rayo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {3} menos lanzar este hechizo si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\\nCambia el objetivo del hechizo o la habilidad objetivo que tenga un solo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dales con todo lo que tienes... y con algunas cosas que no tienes".\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e94d7d-b83a-41e0-a1ae-ccfba970f80f\', \'multiverseId\': 461570}, \'multiverseid\': 461570}, {\'name\': "Ploiement d\'éclair", \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {3} de moins à lancer si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\\nRemplacez la cible du sort ou de la capacité avec une cible unique ciblés.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Donnez-leur tout ce que vous avez... et aussi ce que vous n\'avez pas. »\\n—Ral Zarek", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6db518a-4a44-4eed-9718-9d587b7fa03a\', \'multiverseId\': 461834}, \'multiverseid\': 461834}, {\'name\': \'Piegare le Saette\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {3} in meno per essere lanciata se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4.\\nCambia il bersaglio di una magia o abilità bersaglio che ha un singolo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mettetecela tutta... e anche un po\\\' di più."\\n—Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40158532-0fcd-4297-9f48-1ce40334792b\', \'multiverseId\': 462098}, \'multiverseid\': 462098}, {\'name\': \'稲妻曲げ\', \'text\': \'あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\\n単一の対象を持つ、呪文１つか能力１つを対象とし、それの対象を変更する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつらに持てるものすべてをくれてやれ。あと、持ってないものも少し。」\\n――ラル・ザレック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'766c39be-e7d6-4aeb-a5d0-54dfb571821f\', \'multiverseId\': 462362}, \'multiverseid\': 462362}, {\'name\': \'벼락 구부리기\', \'text\': \'당신이 공격력이 4 이상인 생물을 조종한다면 이 주문은 발동하는 데 {3}이 덜 든다.\\n목표가 한 개인 주문 또는 능력을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표의 목표를 바꾼다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그들에게 네가 가진 걸 전부 쏟아내 봐. . . 가지고 있지 않은 것도 좀 더하고."\\n—랄 자렉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e643ef4-e235-4cd7-92dc-3b4e20237a2d\', \'multiverseId\': 462626}, \'multiverseid\': 462626}, {\'name\': \'Envergamento de Raio\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {3} a menos para ser conjurada se você controla uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4.\\nAltere o alvo da mágica ou habilidade alvo com um único alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vá com tudo que você tem... e também com o que você não tem."\\n— Ral Zarek\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fec6d3da-ea4f-4d43-99d6-5a987ec33bff\', \'multiverseId\': 462890}, \'multiverseid\': 462890}, {\'name\': \'Сгибание Разряда\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {3} меньше, если вы контролируете существо с силой 4 или больше.\\nИзмените цель целевого заклинания или способности с единственной целью.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Выдайте им все, что у вас есть... и немного из того, чего нет».\\n— Рал Зарек\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205dadbc-d37b-410c-80d1-f51a9351f553\', \'multiverseId\': 463154}, \'multiverseid\': 463154}, {\'name\': \'咒击偏折\', \'text\': \'如果你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则此咒语减少{3}来施放。\\n为仅指定单一目标的目标咒语或异能更改目标。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「向他们倾尽你所能. . .以及你所不能。」\\n～拉尔查雷克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12278a19-42d3-41fa-bcce-f4cf64132c24\', \'multiverseId\': 463418}, \'multiverseid\': 463418}, {\'name\': \'咒擊偏折\', \'text\': \'如果你操控力量等於或大於4的生物，則此咒語減少{3}來施放。\\n為僅指定單一目標的目標咒語或異能更改目標。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「向他們傾盡你所能. . .以及你所不能。」\\n～拉爾查雷克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee20ab19-9443-4cca-a588-bbe63911e9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 463682}, \'multiverseid\': 463682}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutiger Schnitt\', \'text\': \'Bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aufmarsch 2. (Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Falls du keine kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Zombie-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461269&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1211e077-3e63-4fbf-8e5b-4fe632aee2bd\', \'multiverseId\': 461269}, \'multiverseid\': 461269}, {\'name\': \'Filo sangriento\', \'text\': \'Hasta una criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno. Enrola 2. (Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. Si no controlas ninguno, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Zombie negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d41b304f-0d56-424c-b7a0-ae9ab96ef9fd\', \'multiverseId\': 461533}, \'multiverseid\': 461533}, {\'name\': \'Tranchant sanguinolent\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à une créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Amassez 2. (Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. Si vous n\'en contrôlez pas, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Zombie et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e54c4dd-4744-4ffb-817c-18086841b88c\', \'multiverseId\': 461797}, \'multiverseid\': 461797}, {\'name\': \'Lama Sanguinante\', \'text\': \'Fino a una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno. Recluta 2. (Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. Se non ne controlli uno, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Zombie 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d9e48c3-59dd-4e98-be79-9fb68589a1a3\', \'multiverseId\': 462061}, \'multiverseid\': 462061}, {\'name\': \'鮮血の刃先\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。動員２を行う。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のゾンビ・軍団・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4127b9bb-5f51-40bc-b155-a86b7df23971\', \'multiverseId\': 462325}, \'multiverseid\': 462325}, {\'name\': \'피 묻은 칼날\', \'text\': \'생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다. 축적 2를 한다. (당신이 조종하는 군대 한 개에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 군대를 조종하고 있지 않다면, 먼저 0/0 흑색 좀비 군대 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b64397c6-8329-4558-a12e-0ee2940e454c\', \'multiverseId\': 462589}, \'multiverseid\': 462589}, {\'name\': \'Fio Sangrento\', \'text\': \'Até uma criatura alvo recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno. Arregimente 2. (Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Se você não controlar um, crie antes uma ficha de criatura preta 0/0 do tipo Zumbi Exército.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f95202c-560b-434a-831c-8d436ff3e9a3\', \'multiverseId\': 462853}, \'multiverseid\': 462853}, {\'name\': \'Кровавое Лезвие\', \'text\': \'Не более одного целевого существа получает -2/-2 до конца хода. Скопище 2. (Положите два жетона +1/+1 на Армию под вашим контролем. Если под вашим контролем нет Армии, то сначала создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 черная Армия Зомби.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e365fdeb-1d6f-41d8-a333-40b81ff3166b\', \'multiverseId\': 463117}, \'multiverseid\': 463117}, {\'name\': \'刀刃喋血\', \'text\': \'至多一个目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。囤兵2。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置两个+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色灵俑／军队衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bde4cc7-0839-4dd9-b926-3d288ace3f16\', \'multiverseId\': 463381}, \'multiverseid\': 463381}, {\'name\': \'刀刃喋血\', \'text\': \'至多一個目標生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。囤兵2。（在一個由你操控的軍隊上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控軍隊，則先派出一個0/0黑色殭屍／軍隊衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adea2e8b-e266-486f-8c72-45943cac739a\', \'multiverseId\': 463645}, \'multiverseid\': 463645}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterfresser\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn der Blätterfresser ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir kämpfen, um einen Tyrannen zu stoppen, und auch für die sanften Kreaturen, die keine Ahnung haben, was über ihre Welt hereingebrochen ist."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461340&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'791357b9-181e-4760-8ab0-6dcf51528bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 461340}, \'multiverseid\': 461340}, {\'name\': \'Herbívoro arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando el Herbívoro arbóreo entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Luchamos para detener a un tirano, pero también por las criaturas inocentes que desconocen lo que amenaza su mundo".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f653d1be-0e75-4e77-910e-123dd604cc0a\', \'multiverseId\': 461604}, \'multiverseid\': 461604}, {\'name\': \'Paisseur arboricole\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nQuand le Paisseur arboricole arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain engagée depuis votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous combattons pour stopper un tyran, mais aussi pour sauver les créatures paisibles qui ne comprennent pas ce qui arrive à leur monde. »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4edf1707-7a8e-41ae-9852-4757220c26a1\', \'multiverseId\': 461868}, \'multiverseid\': 461868}, {\'name\': \'Brucante Arboreo\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nQuando il Brucante Arboreo entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano una carta terra TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Combattiamo per fermare un tiranno, ma lo facciamo anche per le creature indifese che non comprendono cosa stia accadendo al loro mondo."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906d2495-ca5b-4ccf-8c5f-e7311030b6a0\', \'multiverseId\': 462132}, \'multiverseid\': 462132}, {\'name\': \'樹上の草食獣\', \'text\': \'到達\\n樹上の草食獣が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたの手札から土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「暴君を止めるための戦いは、自分の世界に何が起きているか知りもしないおとなしい生き物のためでもあるわ。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d70a0e0-eb19-4527-adef-81a0a4c6b820\', \'multiverseId\': 462396}, \'multiverseid\': 462396}, {\'name\': \'방목 중인 긴꼬리쥐\', \'text\': \'대공\\n방목 중인 긴꼬리쥐가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 손에서 대지 카드 한 장을 탭된 채로 전장에 놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 폭정을 저지하기 위해 싸우지만, 그와 더불어 자신들의 세계에 어떤 일이 닥칠 지 모르는 온순한 생물들을 위해서도 싸운다."\\n—비비안 레이드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e942fcf3-c1ef-4ee1-8b55-bff5a4346c94\', \'multiverseId\': 462660}, \'multiverseid\': 462660}, {\'name\': \'Herbívoro Arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nQuando Herbívoro Arbóreo entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"Lutamos para deter um tirano, mas também lutamos pelas amáveis criaturas que não fazem ideia do que está acontecendo com seu mundo."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d6d6cfc-1256-45ee-a33c-a5a9fc42789f\', \'multiverseId\': 462924}, \'multiverseid\': 462924}, {\'name\': \'Древесный Листоед\', \'text\': \'Захват\\nКогда Древесный Листоед выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы повернутой.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Да, мы сражаемся, чтобы остановить тирана. Но еще мы сражаемся за тех хрупких созданий, кто не понимает, что за участь постигла их мир».\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfe21551-c78b-47b1-adc4-3e5f908fe3e2\', \'multiverseId\': 463188}, \'multiverseid\': 463188}, {\'name\': \'树栖食草兽\', \'text\': \'延势\\n当树栖食草兽进战场时，你可以将一张地牌从你手上横置放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「我们为击倒暴君而战斗，同时也为了那些温顺的生物而战斗；它们无法理解是何等灾难降临自己世界。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983156cb-321b-49a6-be8c-166c50d822a9\', \'multiverseId\': 463452}, \'multiverseid\': 463452}, {\'name\': \'樹棲食草獸\', \'text\': \'延勢\\n當樹棲食草獸進戰場時，你可以將一張地牌從你手上橫置放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'「我們為擊倒暴君而戰鬥，同時也為了那些溫順的生物而戰鬥；牠們無法理解是何等災難降臨自己世界。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00f75e0d-f5bc-478a-884a-8cda62fc989a\', \'multiverseId\': 463716}, \'multiverseid\': 463716}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenhüne\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Blütenhüne ins Spiel kommt, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Du trampelst auf eigene Gefahr auf diesen Blumen herum."\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461345&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2caac2e-3943-4af2-a046-4ffa8f87efa4\', \'multiverseId\': 461345}, \'multiverseid\': 461345}, {\'name\': \'Titán floreciente\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Titán floreciente entre al campo de batalla, prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental planta\', \'flavor\': \'"Si quieres pisar estos parterres, hazlo por tu cuenta y riesgo".\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c56a775-985f-4c43-a5f1-ebc9e5ea2b75\', \'multiverseId\': 461609}, \'multiverseid\': 461609}, {\'name\': \'Carcasse de floraison\', \'text\': "Quand la Carcasse de floraison arrive sur le champ de bataille, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : plante et élémental\', \'flavor\': \'« Marchez sur ces plates-bandes à vos risques et périls. »\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bcfbbcd-f194-48c8-8007-89d2fc9fe639\', \'multiverseId\': 461873}, \'multiverseid\': 461873}, {\'name\': \'Mole Germogliante\', \'text\': \'Quando la Mole Germogliante entra nel campo di battaglia, prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale Pianta\', \'flavor\': \'"Calpestate questi fiori a vostro rischio e pericolo."\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2700f86d-b7b3-4a32-bfa1-d8a7e07d0586\', \'multiverseId\': 462137}, \'multiverseid\': 462137}, {\'name\': \'開花の巨体\', \'text\': \'開花の巨体が戦場に出たとき、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「その花壇を踏み付けるなら危険を覚悟することです。」\\n――イマーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff4f322b-507c-44c6-9df3-1cad4fb809df\', \'multiverseId\': 462401}, \'multiverseid\': 462401}, {\'name\': \'꽃피우는 거대괴물\', \'text\': \'꽃피우는 거대괴물이 전장에 들어올 때, 증식한다. (지속물 및/또는 플레이어를 원하는 수만큼 선택한 후, 그 대상들이 이미 가지고 있는 카운터들과 같은 종류의 카운터를 한 개씩 추가한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 식물 정령\', \'flavor\': \'"위험은 스스로 감수하고 이 꽃밭을 밟고 지나가라."\\n—에마라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92ba16f4-e199-4d83-bf6e-d7f0324da2e4\', \'multiverseId\': 462665}, \'multiverseid\': 462665}, {\'name\': \'Brutamontes Florescente\', \'text\': \'Quando Brutamontes Florescente entrar no campo de batalha, prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Pise nas flores por sua própria conta e risco."\\n— Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69fd75b3-4489-4fc7-963b-8a404593df38\', \'multiverseId\': 462929}, \'multiverseid\': 462929}, {\'name\': \'Цветущая Громадина\', \'text\': \'Когда Цветущая Громадина выходит на поле битвы, используйте Распространение. (Выберите любое количество перманентов и (или) игроков, затем дайте каждому из них еще по одному жетону тех типов, которые у него уже имеются.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Растение Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'«По этим газонам лучше и правда не ходить».\\n— Эммара\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b48e6d4f-701d-42d3-af7f-521bd2d4b941\', \'multiverseId\': 463193}, \'multiverseid\': 463193}, {\'name\': \'绽花巨体\', \'text\': \'当绽花巨体进战场时，增殖。（选择任意数量的永久物和／或牌手，然后为其已有之每种指示物各多放置一个同类的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～植物／元素\', \'flavor\': \'「踩到这些花床后果自负。」\\n～艾玛拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f4b618-8d68-462b-8617-d1cc692f1fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 463457}, \'multiverseid\': 463457}, {\'name\': \'綻花巨體\', \'text\': \'當綻花巨體進戰場時，增殖。（選擇任意數量的永久物和／或玩家，然後為其已有之每種指示物各多放置一個同類的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～植物／元素\', \'flavor\': \'「踩到這些花床後果自負。」\\n～艾瑪拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a271b134-3fac-4cb7-9edf-b8c091d90b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 463721}, \'multiverseid\': 463721}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bollwerk-Riesin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bollwerk-Riesin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wo ist denn *die* hergekommen? Und vor allem: Gibt es noch mehr davon?"\\n—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461198&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c315ec18-1d39-4571-9976-182dddf9e050\', \'multiverseId\': 461198}, \'multiverseid\': 461198}, {\'name\': \'Giganta baluarte\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Giganta baluarte entre al campo de batalla, ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Pero de *dónde* salió? Y aún más importante: ¿hay otros como ella?".\\n—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b223e05e-0014-48ec-87bf-4c84d0278035\', \'multiverseId\': 461462}, \'multiverseid\': 461462}, {\'name\': \'Géante des remparts\', \'text\': \'Quand la Géante des remparts arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 5 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« D\'où est-ce qu\'*elle* sort ? Et surtout, est-ce qu\'il y en a d\'autres comme elle ? »\\n—Gideon Jura", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b702b3-3892-4600-b2ed-1231f6fe9597\', \'multiverseId\': 461726}, \'multiverseid\': 461726}, {\'name\': \'Gigante del Baluardo\', \'text\': \'Quando la Gigante del Baluardo entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'"E *lei* da dov\\\'è sbucata? Ma soprattutto, ce ne sono altre in giro?"\\n—Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d67f6bf-d8ac-4ac6-87db-8221be484d26\', \'multiverseId\': 461990}, \'multiverseid\': 461990}, {\'name\': \'防壁の巨人\', \'text\': \'防壁の巨人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「*あれ*はいったいどこから来たんだ？いや、それよりも、あれは他にもいるのか？」\\n――ギデオン・ジュラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f600de5-ec45-4e88-84c8-9a4feecfbd16\', \'multiverseId\': 462254}, \'multiverseid\': 462254}, {\'name\': \'방벽 거인\', \'text\': \'방벽 거인이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"*저 여자*는 어디서 나타난 거지? 더 중요한 건, 그녀 같은 사람이 더 있나?"\\n—기디온 주라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be500c9f-bb7e-422f-9852-2c1aebb2b6fa\', \'multiverseId\': 462518}, \'multiverseid\': 462518}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Baluarte\', \'text\': \'Quando Gigante Baluarte entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Mas de onde foi que *ela* saiu? E mais importante, há outros como ela?"\\n— Gideon Jura\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b8b7b08-5442-4bee-88b7-bc414348e16c\', \'multiverseId\': 462782}, \'multiverseid\': 462782}, {\'name\': \'Бастионный Гигант\', \'text\': \'Когда Бастионный Гигант выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Откуда *она* взялась? А самое главное, там еще такие есть?»\\n— Гидеон Джура\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36eec261-4de9-4cad-a0af-644ee34b0a18\', \'multiverseId\': 463046}, \'multiverseid\': 463046}, {\'name\': \'援护巨人\', \'text\': \'当援护巨人进战场时，你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「她从哪来的？**更重要的是，还有更多她这样的人吗？」\\n～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771bde99-df82-4ac3-b51d-2aae12d7e2eb\', \'multiverseId\': 463310}, \'multiverseid\': 463310}, {\'name\': \'援護巨人\', \'text\': \'當援護巨人進戰場時，你獲得5點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「她從哪來的？* *更重要的是，還有更多她這樣的人嗎？」\\n～基定尤拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f754ae43-17ab-4043-90c6-f94a846f607b\', \'multiverseId\': 463574}, \'multiverseid\': 463574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund der Disziplin\', \'text\': \'Tappe alle Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren. Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind uns einig, dass Ordnung gut für alle ist, aber dafür muss sie erst einmal durchgesetzt werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461197&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6719bd25-1d9f-45f7-9647-0b905b8beb66\', \'multiverseId\': 461197}, \'multiverseid\': 461197}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo de disciplina\', \'text\': \'Gira todas las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes. Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos de acuerdo en que el orden beneficia a todos, pero primero hay que imponerlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1805e5ca-807a-4a65-8d21-b93614d4aa13\', \'multiverseId\': 461461}, \'multiverseid\': 461461}, {\'name\': \'Lien de discipline\', \'text\': "Engagez toutes les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent. Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Certes, l\'ordre profite à tous, mais pas avant que vous ne le fassiez respecter. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461725&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'213988d6-ad23-43bc-8295-22e29bbdc39a\', \'multiverseId\': 461725}, \'multiverseid\': 461725}, {\'name\': \'Vincolo di Disciplina\', \'text\': \'TAPpa tutte le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari. Le creature che controlli hanno legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Riconosciamo che l\\\'ordine è un bene per tutti, ma solo se viene fatto rispettare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16702792-00ed-4a97-8cb8-89f3e485e2c4\', \'multiverseId\': 461989}, \'multiverseid\': 461989}, {\'name\': \'規律の絆\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーをすべてタップする。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「秩序が人々に有益だという点では意見が一致した。では、それを施行しよう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ba2ca28-d491-485f-97fc-4739b1662bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 462253}, \'multiverseid\': 462253}, {\'name\': \'규율의 유대\', \'text\': \'당신의 상대들이 조종하는 모든 생물을 탭한다. 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 생명연결을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 질서가 모두에게 이득이 된다는 것에 동의하지만, 그러려면 먼저 질서를 집행해야 한다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6d6331-f358-4640-b838-b653d43de912\', \'multiverseId\': 462517}, \'multiverseid\': 462517}, {\'name\': \'Elo de Disciplina\', \'text\': \'Vire todas as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam. As criaturas que você controla ganham vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Concordamos que a ordem beneficia a todos, mas ela precisa ser imposta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b88b93-7130-4fb4-9428-139348199627\', \'multiverseId\': 462781}, \'multiverseid\': 462781}, {\'name\': \'Узы Дисциплины\', \'text\': \'Поверните все существа под контролем ваших оппонентов. Существа под вашим контролем получают Цепь жизни до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы согласны, что порядок всем идет на пользу — но лишь когда заставляешь соблюдать его».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'992c553a-a32b-48e5-b562-85a33f6a925c\', \'multiverseId\': 463045}, \'multiverseid\': 463045}, {\'name\': \'守律璧合\', \'text\': \'横置所有由对手操控的生物。由你操控的生物获得系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们均同意，制订法条虽能维护秩序，但需切实执行才能惠泽万民。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5572c45-dcde-4ccf-87dd-3de2d4c2848f\', \'multiverseId\': 463309}, \'multiverseid\': 463309}, {\'name\': \'守律璧合\', \'text\': \'橫置所有由對手操控的生物。由你操控的生物獲得繫命異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們均同意，制訂法條雖能維護秩序，但需切實執行才能惠澤萬民。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13c6cb91-05b8-4307-abf4-3cc658c8b24d\', \'multiverseId\': 463573}, \'multiverseid\': 463573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund der Einsicht\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler legt die obersten vier Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof. Bringe bis zu zwei Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Schicke den Bund der Einsicht ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Gemeinsam können wir ungeahnte Geheimnisse entschlüsseln. Vielleich erlaube ich dir sogar, dich an einige zu erinnern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f16a8379-5d63-47b7-9f1d-e8aa67770f16\', \'multiverseId\': 461234}, \'multiverseid\': 461234}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo de perspicacia\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador pone las cuatro primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio. Regresa hasta dos cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro de tu cementerio a tu mano. Exilia el Vínculo de perspicacia.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Juntos podemos desentrañar secretos que nadie ha soñado jamás. A lo mejor, hasta te dejo recordar algunos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96559aea-8a9e-49fc-bc32-e5305d1c1d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 461498}, \'multiverseid\': 461498}, {\'name\': \'Lien de perspicacité\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur met les quatre cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière. Renvoyez jusqu\'à deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Exilez le Lien de perspicacité.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ensemble, nous percerons des secrets dont personne n\'a jamais rêvé. Je vous permettrai peut-être de vous en rappeler quelques-uns. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'531109f3-8731-4bf8-8405-f632012fe99c\', \'multiverseId\': 461762}, \'multiverseid\': 461762}, {\'name\': \'Vincolo di Conoscenza\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore mette nel proprio cimitero le prime quattro carte del proprio grimorio. Riprendi in mano fino a due carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero. Esilia il Vincolo di Conoscenza.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Insieme possiamo svelare segreti che nessuno ha mai sognato. Potrei addirittura lasciartene ricordare qualcuno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bba41a4-5ee1-49bd-9bd2-ede858ce35fd\', \'multiverseId\': 462026}, \'multiverseid\': 462026}, {\'name\': \'洞察の絆\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚自分の墓地に置く。あなたの墓地からインスタントやソーサリーであるカード最大２枚をあなたの手札に戻す。洞察の絆を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我々が協力すれば、誰も予想だにしなかった秘密を解き明かせるだろう。その記憶を少しは残しておいてやってもいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ff3ad4-b089-4e68-8837-934486426b10\', \'multiverseId\': 462290}, \'multiverseid\': 462290}, {\'name\': \'통찰력의 유대\', \'text\': \'각 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다. 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 및/또는 집중마법 카드를 최대 두 장까지 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 통찰력의 유대를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"함께라면 우리는 아무도 꿈꿔보지 못한 비밀들을 풀어헤칠 수 있다. 그중에 몇 가지는 기억하게 해 줄 수도 있고."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0338bf2a-8c36-4037-b589-f988d174430e\', \'multiverseId\': 462554}, \'multiverseid\': 462554}, {\'name\': \'Elo da Visão\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador coloca os quatro cards do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério. Devolva até dois cards de mágica instantânea e/ou feitiço de seu cemitério para sua mão. Exile Elo da Visão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Juntos podemos desvendar segredos que ninguém jamais sonhou. Posso até deixar que você se lembre de alguns deles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bd67824-a8c6-4b87-a45b-20ff992f200f\', \'multiverseId\': 462818}, \'multiverseid\': 462818}, {\'name\': \'Узы Проницательности\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок кладет четыре верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище. Верните не более двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и (или) волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Изгоните Узы Проницательности.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Вместе мы сможем раскрыть такие тайны, о которых никто не мог и мечтать. Быть может, я даже позволю тебе запомнить какие-то из них».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa4f8fbf-2f37-4f8d-a9b4-b99a9bf605fb\', \'multiverseId\': 463082}, \'multiverseid\': 463082}, {\'name\': \'洞察璧合\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各将其牌库顶的四张牌置入其坟墓场。将至多两张瞬间和／或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。放逐洞察璧合。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们携手，定能超脱常人所想，破解众多秘密。我甚至可能准你把一些留在脑海。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34892534-2030-4422-abbc-4648a18ec325\', \'multiverseId\': 463346}, \'multiverseid\': 463346}, {\'name\': \'洞察璧合\', \'text\': \'每位玩家各將其牌庫頂的四張牌置入其墳墓場。將至多兩張瞬間和／或巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。放逐洞察璧合。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們攜手，定能超脫常人所想，破解眾多秘密。我甚至可能准你把一些留在腦海。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09c9824-ee67-4737-876a-d6ebe7de9e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 463610}, \'multiverseid\': 463610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund der Leidenschaft\', \'text\': \'Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Enttappe die Kreatur. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Der Bund der Leidenschaft fügt einem anderen Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Lasst uns kämpfen für das, was richtig ist, und lassen wir die Amtsschimmel die Details aushandeln."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461307&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ec32c6b-3c8b-4b0c-a0ed-6a7fed61ef78\', \'multiverseId\': 461307}, \'multiverseid\': 461307}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo de pasión\', \'text\': \'Gana el control de la criatura objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. El Vínculo de pasión hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier otro objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué no luchamos por lo que es justo y dejamos que los burócratas discutan los detalles?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af359425-0199-4d27-bc68-fb0eb09831c8\', \'multiverseId\': 461571}, \'multiverseid\': 461571}, {\'name\': \'Lien de passion\', \'text\': "Acquérez le contrôle de la créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Le Lien de passion inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle autre cible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Pourquoi ne pas se battre pour ce qui est juste et laisser les bureaucrates argumenter sur les détails ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19f47686-d278-4aa2-9602-8381aa6d978c\', \'multiverseId\': 461835}, \'multiverseid\': 461835}, {\'name\': \'Vincolo di Passione\', \'text\': \'Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Il Vincolo di Passione infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi altro bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché non combattiamo per ciò che è giusto e lasciamo che siano i burocrati a discutere dei dettagli?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'656f8b52-5717-40f2-9752-aa103e9adba8\', \'multiverseId\': 462099}, \'multiverseid\': 462099}, {\'name\': \'激情の絆\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体と、他の、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者のコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。激情の絆はその後者に２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「何が正しいのか戦ってはっきりさせようじゃないか。細かいことは役人どもに任せてさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1f0268-f59e-45fd-bc33-975b97cc74aa\', \'multiverseId\': 462363}, \'multiverseid\': 462363}, {\'name\': \'열정의 유대\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지 그 생물의 조종권을 얻는다. 그 생물은 언탭되고 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다. 다른 원하는 목표를 정한다. 열정의 유대는 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자세한 건 나중에 관료들이 왈가왈부하라고 하고, 우선은 옳은 일을 위해서 싸우는 게 어때?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0ae8ac7-0ed4-44b6-896e-2ca9a1d8025a\', \'multiverseId\': 462627}, \'multiverseid\': 462627}, {\'name\': \'Elo da Paixão\', \'text\': \'Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno. Elo da Paixão causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer outro alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que a gente não luta pelo que é certo e deixa os burocratas discutirem os detalhes?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cbd032f-668d-49a0-9cd4-17c2e8395a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 462891}, \'multiverseid\': 462891}, {\'name\': \'Узы Страсти\', \'text\': \'Получите контроль над целевым существом до конца хода. Разверните то существо. Оно получает Ускорение до конца хода. Узы Страсти наносят 2 повреждения любой другой цели.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Почему бы нам просто не сражаться за правое дело, а споры о деталях не оставить бюрократам?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e93f4b0-65a8-4cfc-af44-13cf939e4d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 463155}, \'multiverseid\': 463155}, {\'name\': \'热情璧合\', \'text\': \'获得目标生物的操控权直到回合结束。重置该生物。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。热情璧合对任意另一个目标造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们为何不联合为正确的事情而战，把繁文缛节留给官僚去考虑？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae28aab-f4aa-4191-b765-8a1401c93717\', \'multiverseId\': 463419}, \'multiverseid\': 463419}, {\'name\': \'熱情璧合\', \'text\': \'獲得目標生物的操控權直到回合結束。重置該生物。它獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。熱情璧合對任意另一個目標造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們為何不聯合為正確的事情而戰，把繁文縟節留給官僚去考慮？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a93fe9-2b30-409b-a8b9-7d3214ee72e0\', \'multiverseId\': 463683}, \'multiverseid\': 463683}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund der Wiederbelebung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile bis zu deinem nächsten Zug.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Heute werfen wir das Joch des Todes ab. Je nachdem, wen du fragst, ist es entweder ein Beweis des ewigen Kreislaufs des Lebens oder einfach nur wahnsinnig komisch."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461271&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d835690-3448-4bfc-bc75-f1525730f311\', \'multiverseId\': 461271}, \'multiverseid\': 461271}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo de reanimación\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta tu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoy nos liberamos del yugo de la muerte. Esto es la afirmación de la naturaleza eterna y cíclica de la vida... o una fuente de risas: depende de a quién de nosotras le preguntes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3bb1d65-a581-4a10-9cee-d2e3b1e54a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 461535}, \'multiverseid\': 461535}, {\'name\': \'Lien de réanimation\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à votre prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Aujourd\'hui nous nous libérons du joug de la mort. Soit c\'est une affirmation du cycle éternel de la vie et de la mort, soit c\'est une blague... Tout dépend à qui vous posez la question. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a7c8704-4945-4efc-bcc5-35ef62667233\', \'multiverseId\': 461799}, \'multiverseid\': 461799}, {\'name\': \'Vincolo di Rinascita\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità fino al tuo prossimo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Oggi ci liberiamo dal giogo della morte. Può essere una conferma dell\\\'eterna natura ciclica della vita o semplicemente esilarante: dipende a chi di noi lo chiedi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6954c73-5168-4055-9861-76cad5a548d7\', \'multiverseId\': 462063}, \'multiverseid\': 462063}, {\'name\': \'蘇生の絆\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。あなたの次のターンまで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちは今日、死のくびきを投げ捨てた。これが意味するのは永遠に循環する生命の本質か、それとも単なるお祭り騒ぎか、それはどちらに尋ねるかによる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1fac497-80a7-472b-a675-beced9023db3\', \'multiverseId\': 462327}, \'multiverseid\': 462327}, {\'name\': \'부활의 유대\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다. 그 생물은 당신의 다음 턴까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"오늘 우리는 죽음의 굴레를 벗어던진다. 우리들 중 누구에게 물어보느냐에 따라 이 일이 영원히 순환하는 삶의 본질에 대한 확증이던가, 아니면 아주 유쾌한 일이라는 대답을 듣겠지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26939727-056d-4865-9c59-8f92b37075c0\', \'multiverseId\': 462591}, \'multiverseid\': 462591}, {\'name\': \'Elo do Reviver\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto até seu próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoje nos livramos do jugo da morte. Isso ou é uma confirmação da eterna natureza cíclica da vida, ou é simplesmente hilário. Depende de a qual de nós você perguntar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca381c09-43f1-40dc-92f0-e0f0153403c2\', \'multiverseId\': 462855}, \'multiverseid\': 462855}, {\'name\': \'Узы Оживления\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. Она получает Ускорение до вашего следующего хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Сегодня мы сбросим ярмо смерти. Это либо подтверждение вечной циклической природы жизни, либо просто уморительно смешно, — смотря кого спрашивать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e56ffbd5-720b-4898-b885-9b1e227c67f0\', \'multiverseId\': 463119}, \'multiverseid\': 463119}, {\'name\': \'复生璧合\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能直到你的下一个回合。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「今天我们共同抛开死亡的束缚。这既是对生命永恒轮回本质的肯定，也是对此的不屑～端看你问的是哪一方。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a902b7-b6f5-4d37-9b88-88c0cc5cf519\', \'multiverseId\': 463383}, \'multiverseid\': 463383}, {\'name\': \'復生璧合\', \'text\': \'將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。它獲得敏捷異能直到你的下一個回合。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「今天我們共同拋開死亡的束縛。這既是對生命永恆輪迴本質的肯定，也是對此的不屑～端看你問的是哪一方。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d67775e-2d84-40ae-9f50-e480d8773e2a\', \'multiverseId\': 463647}, \'multiverseid\': 463647}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund des Gedeihens\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine bleibende Karte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind uns einig, dass das Leben gedeihen sollte. Nur bei der optimalen Anzahl an Extremitäten gibt es Meinungsverschiedenheiten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461346&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c60b298-08b9-4471-9b36-5c4467fcb8b9\', \'multiverseId\': 461346}, \'multiverseid\': 461346}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo de florecimiento\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de permanente que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden. Ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos de acuerdo en que la vida debería florecer, pero aún no hemos resuelto la cantidad óptima de extremidades".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3923d581-ae63-45ed-a11e-65e97c6c9ae5\', \'multiverseId\': 461610}, \'multiverseid\': 461610}, {\'name\': "Lien d\'abondance", \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de permanent parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous sommes d\'accord pour dire que la vie doit s\'épanouir. Nous ne sommes pas d\'accord sur le nombre optimal de branches. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3984134d-bf1c-42a5-b9ad-2c4b48424d33\', \'multiverseId\': 461874}, \'multiverseid\': 461874}, {\'name\': \'Vincolo di Prosperità\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta permanente scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine. Guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Concordiamo sul fatto che la vita debba prosperare. Discordiamo sul numero ottimale di arti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20863d18-8f0d-4365-9c8b-31864fcb4a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 462138}, \'multiverseid\': 462138}, {\'name\': \'繁茂の絆\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。あなたはその中からパーマネント・カード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「生命が繁茂すべきという点は意見が一致している。手足は何本が最適かという点では見解が違うけれど。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e15888d-5cea-4022-919d-e1e45b71a35e\', \'multiverseId\': 462402}, \'multiverseid\': 462402}, {\'name\': \'융성의 유대\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 지속물 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다. 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리는 생명이 융성해야 한다는 것에 동의한다. 사지가 몇 개 있어야 적절한지에는 동의하지 않는다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171690e0-05d9-4dd4-9476-42a43db5f09d\', \'multiverseId\': 462666}, \'multiverseid\': 462666}, {\'name\': \'Elo do Florescimento\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de permanente dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem. Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Concordamos que a vida deve florescer. Discordamos quanto ao número ideal de membros."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66b707a0-e93b-4734-92b6-301876cd19e5\', \'multiverseId\': 462930}, \'multiverseid\': 462930}, {\'name\': \'Узы Расцвета\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту перманента и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке. Вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы согласны с тем, что жизнь должна процветать. У нас разногласия по оптимальному числу конечностей».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa53ee31-fbd2-450c-9a9b-da7acd5ed466\', \'multiverseId\': 463194}, \'multiverseid\': 463194}, {\'name\': \'茁壮璧合\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。你可以展示其中的一张永久物牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们都同意生命应得滋养绽放，但对手脚的最优数量有所分歧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f293e3f2-e1c0-4626-b5a2-5a08b18acc23\', \'multiverseId\': 463458}, \'multiverseid\': 463458}, {\'name\': \'茁壯璧合\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。你可以展示其中的一張永久物牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。你獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們都同意生命應得滋養綻放，但對手腳的最優數量有所分歧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a63dab-8fac-47fa-b5d0-e549a7ad1073\', \'multiverseId\': 463722}, \'multiverseid\': 463722}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Feuerformerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Loyalitätsmarken von Chandra, Feuerformerin, entfernt werden, fügt sie einem Gegner oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\n+1: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\\n−7: Schicke die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5fc11c-2614-4ff2-aef2-737fcf536805\', \'multiverseId\': 461310}, \'multiverseid\': 461310}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, artesana del fuego\', \'text\': \'Siempre que uno o más contadores de lealtad se remuevan de Chandra, artesana del fuego, hace esa misma cantidad de daño al oponente o planeswalker objetivo.\\n+1: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\\n−7: Exilia las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugarlas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86359b5-a49f-4763-8208-91dea22c6b66\', \'multiverseId\': 461574}, \'multiverseid\': 461574}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, artisane de feu\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins un marqueur « loyauté » est retiré de Chandra, artisane de feu, elle inflige autant de blessures à une cible, adversaire ou planeswalker.\\n+1 : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la jouer ce tour-ci.\\n-7 : Exilez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez les jouer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8178c655-f800-4fe6-80b5-780f1d9ce4e5\', \'multiverseId\': 461838}, \'multiverseid\': 461838}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Artigiana del Fuoco\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta uno o più segnalini fedeltà vengono rimossi da Chandra, Artigiana del Fuoco, Chandra infligge altrettanti danni a un avversario o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\n+1: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarla in questo turno.\\n-7: Esilia le prime sette carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarle in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01ddb722-2b78-40b7-bc10-9dd2a84bfaa4\', \'multiverseId\': 462102}, \'multiverseid\': 462102}, {\'name\': \'炎の職工、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'炎の職工、チャンドラの上から忠誠カウンターが１個以上取り除かれるたび、対戦相手１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。これはそれにその個数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n+1：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。このターン、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよい。\\n-7：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを７枚追放する。このターン、あなたはそれらをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35d25676-8378-4d77-9dd6-b976aabf5ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 462366}, \'multiverseid\': 462366}, {\'name\': \'화염의 장인, 찬드라\', \'text\': \'화염의 장인, 찬드라에서 충성 카운터가 한 개 이상 제거될 때마다, 상대 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라는 그 목표에게 제거된 카운터 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\\n+1: 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\\n-7: 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 일곱 장을 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 찬드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e8b3ec-1334-4f4b-925f-ae83bef1e0b5\', \'multiverseId\': 462630}, \'multiverseid\': 462630}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Artesã do Fogo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um ou mais marcadores de lealdade são removidos de Chandra, Artesã do Fogo, ela causa aquela quantidade de dano ao oponente ou planeswalker alvo.\\n+1: Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-lo neste turno.\\n−7: Exile os sete cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-los neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba86314-9e3b-4334-8b3f-47f2a8f1deb8\', \'multiverseId\': 462894}, \'multiverseid\': 462894}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Мастерица Пламени\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда с Чандры, Мастерицы Пламени удаляется один или несколько жетонов верности, она наносит столько же повреждений целевому оппоненту или planeswalker-у.\\n+1: изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту в этом ходу.\\n—7: изгоните семь верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть их в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de227885-4aeb-41b1-a006-2ad4b0031627\', \'multiverseId\': 463158}, \'multiverseid\': 463158}, {\'name\': \'炎技茜卓\', \'text\': \'每当从炎技茜卓上移去一个或数个忠诚指示物时，她向目标对手或鹏洛客造成等量的伤害。\\n+1：放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\\n-7：放逐你牌库顶的七张牌。本回合中，你可以使用这些牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31975f8c-e0db-45e7-a135-cc615ee88108\', \'multiverseId\': 463422}, \'multiverseid\': 463422}, {\'name\': \'炎技茜卓\', \'text\': \'每當從炎技茜卓上移去一個或數個忠誠指示物時，她向目標對手或鵬洛客造成等量的傷害。\\n+1：放逐你的牌庫頂牌。本回合中，你可以使用該牌。\\n-7：放逐你牌庫頂的七張牌。本回合中，你可以使用這些牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a502b59-6be7-40cb-8c87-f3183501121c\', \'multiverseId\': 463686}, \'multiverseid\': 463686}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Pyrohelix\', \'text\': \'Chandras Pyrohelix fügt 2 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein oder zwei Ziele deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine lausigen Lakaien habe ich erledigt. Jetzt kann ich mich ums eigentliche Problem kümmern: dich."\\n—Chandra Nalaar zu Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461311&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fd22213-5319-4d31-a76c-ca1ad6d9ea0b\', \'multiverseId\': 461311}, \'multiverseid\': 461311}, {\'name\': \'Pirohélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Pirohélice de Chandra hace 2 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre uno o dos objetivos.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora que me he ocupado de tus juguetes, puedo centrarme en el verdadero problema, que eres tú".\\n—Chandra Nalaar, a Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9fab4ab-00f3-4fec-a78e-8f11cab8d31f\', \'multiverseId\': 461575}, \'multiverseid\': 461575}, {\'name\': \'Pyrohélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Pyrohélice de Chandra inflige 2 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre une ou deux cibles.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Maintenant que je me suis débarrassée de tes petits joujoux, je vais pouvoir m\'attaquer au vrai problème : toi. »\\n—Chandra Nalaàr, à Dovin Baàn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a49841af-2e94-48a4-a609-ee832f0c04ab\', \'multiverseId\': 461839}, \'multiverseid\': 461839}, {\'name\': \'Piroelica di Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Piroelica di Chandra infligge 2 danni divisi a tua scelta tra uno o due bersagli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ora che ho sistemato i tuoi giocattolini, posso concentrarmi sul vero problema: tu."\\n—Chandra Nalaar a Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcc7a300-782b-4d8c-ab01-85a21e4f7996\', \'multiverseId\': 462103}, \'multiverseid\': 462103}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの螺旋炎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤー、１つか２つを対象とする。チャンドラの螺旋炎はそれらに２点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「これであんたのおもちゃは片付いたわね。やっと本当の問題に取り組めるわ。つまり、あんたよ。」\\n――チャンドラ・ナラーからドビン・バーンへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7538be33-d2e1-46e9-a610-485725656fd3\', \'multiverseId\': 462367}, \'multiverseid\': 462367}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 불꽃소용돌이\', \'text\': \'원하는 목표 한 개나 두 개를 정한다. 찬드라의 불꽃 소용돌이는 그 목표들에게 피해 2점을 당신이 나눈 대로 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이제 네 귀여운 장난감들은 다 처리했으니, 진짜 문제에 집중할 수 있겠군. 바로 너 말이야."\\n—찬드라 날라르가, 도빈 반에게\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bddcd7f9-de1b-43a5-8833-6de0c8bc3b61\', \'multiverseId\': 462631}, \'multiverseid\': 462631}, {\'name\': \'Piro-hélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Piro-hélice de Chandra causa 2 pontos de dano distribuídos a sua escolha entre um ou dois alvos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Agora que eu cuidei dos seus brinquedinhos, posso me concentrar no verdadeiro problema: você."\\n— Chandra Nalaar, a Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65dbad45-49be-4ba3-be70-af290f453753\', \'multiverseId\': 462895}, \'multiverseid\': 462895}, {\'name\': \'Пироспираль Чандры\', \'text\': \'Пироспираль Чандры наносит 2 повреждения, разделенные по вашему выбору между одной или двумя целями.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«С твоими игрушками я покончила, и теперь можно заняться настоящей проблемой: тобой».\\n— Чандра Налаар, обращаясь к Довину Баану\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f9d2ee-289f-4e8b-984a-f0339ce0c697\', \'multiverseId\': 463159}, \'multiverseid\': 463159}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒\', \'text\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒对任意一个或两个目标造成共2点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你的小玩具已经全部处理干净，现在能够专心来对付真正的问题了：你。」\\n～茜卓纳拉怒喝多温班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27b3313d-c484-4763-900b-cbebe6c0b8a1\', \'multiverseId\': 463423}, \'multiverseid\': 463423}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒\', \'text\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒對任意一個或兩個目標造成共2點傷害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「你的小玩具已經全部處理乾淨，現在能夠專心來對付真正的問題了：你。」\\n～茜卓納拉怒喝多溫班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb410bd0-8643-4bcf-bbb0-c9b3c6bf7c06\', \'multiverseId\': 463687}, \'multiverseid\': 463687}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Triumph\', \'text\': \'Chandras Triumph fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert, 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls du einen Chandra-Planeswalker kontrollierst, fügt Chandras Triumph jener bleibenden Karte stattdessen 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Triumph bestand nicht darin, selbst Perfektion zu erreichen, sondern darin, den Glauben an Perfektion abzulegen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461312&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bf3920d-430f-4e5a-abba-02836f7d8649\', \'multiverseId\': 461312}, \'multiverseid\': 461312}, {\'name\': \'Triunfo de Chandra\', \'text\': \'El Triunfo de Chandra hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla un oponente. Si controlas un planeswalker Chandra, en vez de eso, el Triunfo de Chandra hace 5 puntos de daño a ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Su triunfo no consistió en convertirse en un ideal de sí misma, sino en rechazar la idea de la perfección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f801a8-eef6-49ff-9574-603880357727\', \'multiverseId\': 461576}, \'multiverseid\': 461576}, {\'name\': \'Triomphe de Chandra\', \'text\': "Le Triomphe de Chandra inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée ou un planeswalker ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Le Triomphe de Chandra inflige 5 blessures à ce permanent à la place si vous contrôlez un planeswalker Chandra.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Son triomphe ne fut pas d\'atteindre son moi idéal, mais de rejeter l\'idée de perfection.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cb32904-a2ed-49c9-b5f0-aa9c1a87ceb0\', \'multiverseId\': 461840}, \'multiverseid\': 461840}, {\'name\': \'Trionfo di Chandra\', \'text\': \'Il Trionfo di Chandra infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da un avversario. Il Trionfo di Chandra infligge invece 5 danni a quel permanente se controlli un planeswalker Chandra.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il suo trionfo non fu realizzare il suo ideale, ma rifiutare l\'idea di perfezione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1025b4c-6c87-4a2f-9c59-5e9601398116\', \'multiverseId\': 462104}, \'multiverseid\': 462104}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの勝利\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしている、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。チャンドラの勝利はそれに３点のダメージを与える。あなたがチャンドラ・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているなら、代わりに、チャンドラの勝利はそのパーマネントに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の勝利は理想の自分の実現ではなく、完璧という考えの否定から得られた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a392946e-fbc2-4e97-bf33-e0ab4b0f489f\', \'multiverseId\': 462368}, \'multiverseid\': 462368}, {\'name\': \'찬드라의 승리\', \'text\': \'상대가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 찬드라의 승리는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 당신이 찬드라 플레인즈워커를 조종한다면 찬드라의 승리는 대신 그 목표에게 피해 5점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'그녀는 이상적인 자신에 도달하는 것이 아니라, 완벽해져야 한다는 생각을 거부하는 것으로 승리했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5da948-6f2c-4010-95ae-51d93c222ab8\', \'multiverseId\': 462632}, \'multiverseid\': 462632}, {\'name\': \'Triunfo de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Triunfo de Chandra causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que um oponente controla. Se você controla uma planeswalker Chandra, em vez disso, Triunfo de Chandra causa 5 pontos de dano àquela permanente.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Seu triunfo não foi alcançar seu eu ideal, mas rejeitar a ideia de perfeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c1a6821-199d-434a-829d-7bac2e251460\', \'multiverseId\': 462896}, \'multiverseid\': 462896}, {\'name\': \'Триумф Чандры\', \'text\': \'Триумф Чандры наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или planeswalker-у под контролем оппонента. Триумф Чандры вместо этого наносит тому перманенту 5 повреждений, если под вашим контролем есть planeswalker Чандра.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Ее триумф — не в достижении своего идеала, но в том, что она отринула идею совершенства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401177fd-bca0-4d61-9da5-b0f9048cbee7\', \'multiverseId\': 463160}, \'multiverseid\': 463160}, {\'name\': \'茜卓得胜\', \'text\': \'茜卓得胜向目标由对手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。如果你操控茜卓鹏洛客，则改为茜卓得胜对该永久物造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'她的胜利并非源自实现理念中的自我，而是源自抛弃追求完美的念头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca4f996-86e1-4d43-b4b8-f67643269fe8\', \'multiverseId\': 463424}, \'multiverseid\': 463424}, {\'name\': \'茜卓得勝\', \'text\': \'茜卓得勝向目標由對手操控的生物或鵬洛客造成3點傷害。如果你操控茜卓鵬洛客，則改為茜卓得勝對該永久物造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'她的勝利並非源自實現理念中的自我，而是源自拋棄追求完美的念頭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ff8d60-c9ec-40dc-89d5-fe40fe5d5144\', \'multiverseId\': 463688}, \'multiverseid\': 463688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosteufel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler eine bleibende Karte opfert, fügt der Chaosteufel einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': \'Die Rakdos-Kultisten können einfach keine Gelegenheit ungenutzt lassen, Chaos zu stiften — auch nicht, wenn es um das Überleben der Stadt geht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc1cd7a6-d0dd-4fce-9bc1-72bac3a1cc00\', \'multiverseId\': 461395}, \'multiverseid\': 461395}, {\'name\': \'Diablo del caos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador sacrifique un permanente, el Diablo del caos hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar de que la supervivencia de la ciudad estaba en juego, los cultistas de Rakdos son reacios a dejar pasar cualquier oportunidad de sembrar el caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535b386e-c86a-4eee-b809-883131f3212d\', \'multiverseId\': 461659}, \'multiverseid\': 461659}, {\'name\': \'Diable du carnage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur sacrifie un permanent, le Diable du carnage inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : diable\', \'flavor\': "Bien qu\'ayant tout intérêt à ce que la cité survive, les cultistes de Rakdos répugnent à gâcher une occasion de semer le chaos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'445721a1-ee9f-4f3c-91c0-d7aa0be241bd\', \'multiverseId\': 461923}, \'multiverseid\': 461923}, {\'name\': \'Diavolo del Pandemonio\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore sacrifica un permanente, il Diavolo del Pandemonio infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': \'Nonostante il loro interesse per la sopravvivenza della città, i cultisti Rakdos sono riluttanti a lasciarsi sfuggire qualsiasi occasione per seminare il caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92a5bac-5946-4396-b45c-7edddfb67fc7\', \'multiverseId\': 462187}, \'multiverseid\': 462187}, {\'name\': \'波乱の悪魔\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがパーマネントを１つ生け贄に捧げるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。波乱の悪魔はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': \'街の存続に利害があるにも関わらず、ラクドスの信者は混沌を巻き起こす機会を見逃さずにはいられなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1966894a-51c5-4c22-9f1c-24b760850f24\', \'multiverseId\': 462451}, \'multiverseid\': 462451}, {\'name\': \'아수라장 마귀\', \'text\': \'플레이어가 지속물을 희생할 때마다, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 아수라장 마귀는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악령\', \'flavor\': \'도시의 생존이 경각에 달려 있는 순간에도, 락도스 광신단원들은 혼란을 일으킬 수 있는 기회를 그냥 넘겨버리는 일을 꺼렸다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94480e4-e343-4679-8cd6-5ec14fd8e07c\', \'multiverseId\': 462715}, \'multiverseid\': 462715}, {\'name\': \'Diabo do Pandemônio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador sacrifica uma permanente, Diabo do Pandemônio causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo\', \'flavor\': \'A despeito do próprio interesse na sobrevivência da cidade, os cultistas de Rakdos odeiam deixar passar uma oportunidade de semear o caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'657a85e8-70b8-4171-9d93-e15deb8c5789\', \'multiverseId\': 462979}, \'multiverseid\': 462979}, {\'name\': \'Дьявол Безумия\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок жертвует перманент, Дьявол Безумия наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дьявол\', \'flavor\': \'Даже рискуя выживанием города, Ракдосы не могли отказаться от возможности посеять хаос.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abc57ad1-ccb9-404f-bc6f-b1fabcfcdec6\', \'multiverseId\': 463243}, \'multiverseid\': 463243}, {\'name\': \'破坏魔鬼\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手牺牲一个永久物时，破坏魔鬼对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'虽然城市存亡攸关拉铎司教众生死，但他们绝不愿放过任何制造混乱的机会。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14445e09-2101-4bf9-b599-b6f979667299\', \'multiverseId\': 463507}, \'multiverseid\': 463507}, {\'name\': \'破壞魔鬼\', \'text\': \'每當任一玩家犧牲一個永久物時，破壞魔鬼對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'雖然城市存亡攸關拉鐸司教眾生死，但他們絕不願放過任何製造混亂的機會。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9770301f-1e6c-484b-a258-ee4d18ba725b\', \'multiverseId\': 463771}, \'multiverseid\': 463771}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dankbare Erscheinung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Dankbare Erscheinung einem Spieler oder Planeswalker Kampfschaden zufügt, führe Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461208&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'216842d7-4819-4104-86a7-762e6ee52ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 461208}, \'multiverseid\': 461208}, {\'name\': \'Aparición agradecida\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Aparición agradecida haga daño de combate a un jugador o planeswalker, prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f6a508c-1e7e-4cb1-9af1-c6cb802c2615\', \'multiverseId\': 461472}, \'multiverseid\': 461472}, {\'name\': \'Apparition reconnaissante\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Apparition reconnaissante inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur ou à un planeswalker, proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6db75f65-d131-42d4-9841-c85a78913af7\', \'multiverseId\': 461736}, \'multiverseid\': 461736}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione Riconoscente\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Apparizione Riconoscente infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore o a un planeswalker, prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a0614e-c312-46d8-8ce8-9884d40fae50\', \'multiverseId\': 462000}, \'multiverseid\': 462000}, {\'name\': \'奉謝の亡霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n奉謝の亡霊がプレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46887d8d-7cc0-4c62-8113-a29937336353\', \'multiverseId\': 462264}, \'multiverseid\': 462264}, {\'name\': \'고마워하는 유령\', \'text\': \'비행\\n고마워하는 유령이 플레이어나 플레인즈워커에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 증식한다. (지속물 및/또는 플레이어를 원하는 수만큼 선택한 후, 그 대상들이 이미 가지고 있는 카운터들과 같은 종류의 카운터를 한 개씩 추가한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236a7f8d-9a61-4463-811a-02dec89d18fb\', \'multiverseId\': 462528}, \'multiverseid\': 462528}, {\'name\': \'Aparição Grata\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Aparição Grata causar dano de combate a um jogador ou planeswalker, prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d432a94b-7e94-44e0-8836-4052b6cf440b\', \'multiverseId\': 462792}, \'multiverseid\': 462792}, {\'name\': \'Благодарный Призрак\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Благодарный Призрак наносит боевые повреждения игроку или planeswalker-у, используйте Распространение. (Выберите любое количество перманентов и (или) игроков, затем дайте каждому из них еще по одному жетону тех типов, которые у него уже имеются.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea8ba6b-9e7d-405b-b60e-c443af82413a\', \'multiverseId\': 463056}, \'multiverseid\': 463056}, {\'name\': \'感德亡灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当感德亡灵对任一牌手或鹏洛客造成战斗伤害时，增殖。（选择任意数量的永久物和／或牌手，然后为其已有之每种指示物各多放置一个同类的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6c18d9f-cdd8-4ee0-a115-2e8172f7406b\', \'multiverseId\': 463320}, \'multiverseid\': 463320}, {\'name\': \'感德亡靈\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當感德亡靈對任一玩家或鵬洛客造成戰鬥傷害時，增殖。（選擇任意數量的永久物和／或玩家，然後為其已有之每種指示物各多放置一個同類的指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cebe670-4e1e-414c-a8a2-13fd35d54e56\', \'multiverseId\': 463584}, \'multiverseid\': 463584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Ende einläuten\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nZiehe zwei Karten und wende dann Aufmarsch X an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist. (Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Armee, die du kontrollierst. Falls du keine kontrollierst, erzeuge zuerst einen 0/0 schwarzen Zombie-Armee-Kreaturenspielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst die Götter werden sich vor mir verneigen."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461236&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'713cbd97-0476-48a0-b61a-8f46b6099612\', \'multiverseId\': 461236}, \'multiverseid\': 461236}, {\'name\': \'Inicio del plan maestro\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nRoba dos cartas, luego enrola X, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en tu mano. (Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre un Ejército que controlas. Si no controlas ninguno, crea primero una ficha de criatura Ejército Zombie negra 0/0.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Incluso los dioses se arrodillarán".\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9fe8eeb-15c4-4534-a687-7d5a5a6c8dd3\', \'multiverseId\': 461500}, \'multiverseid\': 461500}, {\'name\': \'Début du dénouement\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nPiochez deux cartes, puis amassez X, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main. (Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une armée que vous contrôlez. Si vous n\'en contrôlez pas, créez d\'abord un jeton de créature 0/0 noire Zombie et Armée.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Même les dieux se prosterneront. »\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461764&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d842fd31-1bc8-4d2a-b359-816a75f28ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 461764}, \'multiverseid\': 461764}, {\'name\': \'Avviare il Piano Finale\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nPesca due carte, poi recluta X, dove X è il numero di carte nella tua mano. (Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su un Esercito che controlli. Se non ne controlli uno, crea prima una pedina creatura Esercito Zombie 0/0 nera.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Persino gli dei si inginocchieranno."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5af8df95-348a-4a8c-863d-021398859fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 462028}, \'multiverseid\': 462028}, {\'name\': \'終局の始まり\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nカードを２枚引き、その後動員Ｘを行う。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。（あなたがコントロールしている軍団１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。あなたが軍団をコントロールしていないなら、その前に、黒の０/０のゾンビ・軍団・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「神々までもひざまずくのだ。」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51c56539-4b0c-4bd7-998a-8e6483d6a32a\', \'multiverseId\': 462292}, \'multiverseid\': 462292}, {\'name\': \'종반전 개시\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 무효화될 수 없다.\\n카드 두 장을 뽑은 후, 축적 X를 한다. X는 당신의 손에 있는 카드 수이다. (당신이 조종하는 군대 한 개에 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 군대를 조종하고 있지 않다면, 먼저 0/0 흑색 좀비 군대 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"신들마저도 무릎을 꿇어야 되리라."\\n—니콜 볼라스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568ee275-a620-4953-a02d-048264844569\', \'multiverseId\': 462556}, \'multiverseid\': 462556}, {\'name\': \'Iniciar Plano Final\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nCompre dois cards e depois arregimente X, sendo X o número de cards em sua mão. (Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em um Exército que você controla. Se você não controlar um, crie antes uma ficha de criatura preta 0/0 do tipo Zumbi Exército.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Até os deuses deverão se ajoelhar."\\n— Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'937685cc-5810-490d-adb2-882f874c83bc\', \'multiverseId\': 462820}, \'multiverseid\': 462820}, {\'name\': \'Исполнение Замысла\', \'text\': \'Это заклинание не может быть отменено.\\nВозьмите две карты, затем используйте Скопище X, где X — количество карт в вашей руке. (Положите X жетонов +1/+1 на Армию под вашим контролем. Если под вашим контролем нет Армии, то сначала создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 черная Армия Зомби.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Даже боги преклонят колени».\\n— Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51964254-0126-4bba-a570-f72c54b016e3\', \'multiverseId\': 463084}, \'multiverseid\': 463084}, {\'name\': \'终谋始动\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n抓两张牌，然后囤兵X，X为你的手牌数量。（在一个由你操控的军队上放置X个+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控军队，则先派出一个0/0黑色灵俑／军队衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「就连神明也得屈膝听令。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe7099d-0110-4e4b-b148-95174c330431\', \'multiverseId\': 463348}, \'multiverseid\': 463348}, {\'name\': \'終謀始動\', \'text\': \'此咒語不能被反擊。\\n抽兩張牌，然後囤兵X，X為你的手牌數量。（在一個由你操控的軍隊上放置X個+1/+1指示物。如果你未操控軍隊，則先派出一個0/0黑色殭屍／軍隊衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「就連神明也得屈膝聽令。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6580f2bb-c8a4-4b10-ae22-19834418960f\', \'multiverseId\': 463612}, \'multiverseid\': 463612}]', '[{\'name\': \'Davriel, raubender Schattenmagier\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Gegners und falls jener Spieler eine oder weniger Karten auf der Hand hat, fügt ihm Davriel, raubender Schattenmagier, 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−1: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Davriel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aced6b1b-4788-4efa-b0a4-398fdb13ca4c\', \'multiverseId\': 461274}, \'multiverseid\': 461274}, {\'name\': \'Davriel, magosombra renegado\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada oponente, si ese jugador tiene una o menos cartas en la mano, Davriel, magosombra renegado le hace 2 puntos de daño.\\n−1: El jugador objetivo descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Davriel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6afcbb2d-7ece-43ae-84d4-b9c31c30460a\', \'multiverseId\': 461538}, \'multiverseid\': 461538}, {\'name\': \'Davriel, ombremage rebelle\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque adversaire, si ce joueur a une carte ou moins dans sa main, Davriel, ombremage rebelle lui inflige 2 blessures.\\n-1 : Le joueur ciblé se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Davriel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a623c1d1-3e01-4bf1-b5ff-ec5b58371fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 461802}, \'multiverseid\': 461802}, {\'name\': "Davriel, Mago d\'Ombra Rinnegato", \'text\': "All\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni avversario, se quel giocatore ha una o meno carte in mano, Davriel, Mago d\'Ombra Rinnegato gli infligge 2 danni.\\n-1: Un giocatore bersaglio scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Davriel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb1a11f-0a39-43a2-8909-53fa4ddc9048\', \'multiverseId\': 462066}, \'multiverseid\': 462066}, {\'name\': \'はぐれ影魔道士、ダブリエル\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手のアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーの手札のカードが１枚以下である場合、はぐれ影魔道士、ダブリエルはそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\\n-1：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ダブリエル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5871a56-505e-4f44-a9ef-53144d771c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 462330}, \'multiverseid\': 462330}, {\'name\': \'무법적인 그림자마도사, 다브리엘\', \'text\': \'각 상대의 유지단 시작에, 그 플레이어의 손에 카드가 한 장 이하라면, 무법적인 그림자마도사, 다브리엘은 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n-1: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 다브리엘\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5206caf-dda4-4868-ab9a-79188b92ddc1\', \'multiverseId\': 462594}, \'multiverseid\': 462594}, {\'name\': \'Davriel, Mago das Sombras Ladino\', \'text\': \'No início da manutenção de cada oponente, se aquele jogador tiver um card ou menos na mão, Davriel, Mago das Sombras Ladino, causará 2 pontos de dano a ele.\\n−1: O jogador alvo descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Davriel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e1fcbe7-497f-400b-a477-72d17d113761\', \'multiverseId\': 462858}, \'multiverseid\': 462858}, {\'name\': \'Давриэль, Мятежный Маг Тени\', \'text\': \'В начале шага поддержки каждого оппонента, если у того игрока в руке не более одной карты, то Давриэль, Мятежный Маг Тени наносит ему 2 повреждения.\\n—1: целевой игрок сбрасывает карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Давриэль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45b500b-f203-4f77-8d99-476246f120b4\', \'multiverseId\': 463122}, \'multiverseid\': 463122}, {\'name\': \'离群影法师达夫黎\', \'text\': \'在每位对手的维持开始时，若该牌手的手牌为一张或更少，则离群影法师达夫黎对其造成2点伤害。\\n−1：目标牌手弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～达夫黎\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee72171-40fe-4bf3-9bad-f4f8dd79f0f0\', \'multiverseId\': 463386}, \'multiverseid\': 463386}, {\'name\': \'離群影法師達夫黎\', \'text\': \'在每位對手的維持開始時，若該玩家的手牌為一張或更少，則離群影法師達夫黎對其造成2點傷害。\\n−1：目標玩家棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～達夫黎\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28f4474e-32ee-4758-afda-5c31dcda32fe\', \'multiverseId\': 463650}, \'multiverseid\': 463650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Davriels Schattenwahn\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten ab und verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Schatten umhüllten den Verstand des Zeugen. Dann blieb nur noch der Schmerz, ihn verloren zu haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461275&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ae6c0e0-86a7-4b1e-9acd-8fabae424821\', \'multiverseId\': 461275}, \'multiverseid\': 461275}, {\'name\': \'Amnesia sombría de Davriel\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo descarta dos cartas y pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las sombras se enroscaron en la mente del testigo. Luego, el momento se desvaneció; solo quedó atrás el aguijoneo de la pérdida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c754c4ef-5171-4da5-a46f-b149f04d971c\', \'multiverseId\': 461539}, \'multiverseid\': 461539}, {\'name\': "Fugue d\'ombre de Davriel", \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé se défausse de deux cartes et perd 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les ombres s\'enroulèrent autour de l\'esprit du témoin. Puis l\'instant s\'évapora, ne laissant derrière lui que la douleur de sa perte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461803&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05e25390-0a46-4b38-9ce0-b926d3dffbb2\', \'multiverseId\': 461803}, \'multiverseid\': 461803}, {\'name\': \'Sinfonia Oscura di Davriel\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio scarta due carte e perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le ombre avvolsero la mente del testimone. Poi il momento svanì, lasciando solo il dolore della sua perdita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae7e650c-aebb-400d-8993-7595e42798db\', \'multiverseId\': 462067}, \'multiverseid\': 462067}, {\'name\': \'ダブリエルの影忘\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を捨て、２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'影が目撃者の精神を取り巻くと、その一瞬は消え去り、後には喪失の痛みのみが残った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e68e9e00-3341-4ebe-8dfa-2b0f8d27c8f1\', \'multiverseId\': 462331}, \'multiverseid\': 462331}, {\'name\': \'다브리엘의 그림자푸가\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 두 장을 버리고 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'목격자의 정신을 둘러싸고 그림자가 휘감겨 들었다. 이내 그림자는 사라졌고, 오직 쓰라린 상실만이 남아 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62678b65-ba0d-4a6f-b64c-18787b3517be\', \'multiverseId\': 462595}, \'multiverseid\': 462595}, {\'name\': \'Fuga Sombria de Davriel\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo descarta dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As sombras envolveram a mente da testemunha. Então o momento desapareceu, deixando apenas a dor da perda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1344ba86-38a4-4bc2-a718-cddcf8a10074\', \'multiverseId\': 462859}, \'multiverseid\': 462859}, {\'name\': \'Фуга Теней Давриэля\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок сбрасывает две карты и теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Темные тени окутали разум свидетеля. Оставив едва ощутимую боль от потери, нужное воспоминание навсегда исчезло из памяти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12528b4-736e-43b0-b964-f27231693db7\', \'multiverseId\': 463123}, \'multiverseid\': 463123}, {\'name\': \'达夫黎的昏乱攫\', \'text\': \'目标牌手弃两张牌且失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'阴影在目击者的思绪当中聚集。然后脑海中的那一瞬间突然消失，只剩下失忆带来的隐隐刺痛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'810c9ffb-d2c7-4a6b-995a-95f8c65a2ade\', \'multiverseId\': 463387}, \'multiverseid\': 463387}, {\'name\': \'達夫黎的昏亂攫\', \'text\': \'目標玩家棄兩張牌且失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'陰影在目擊者的思緒當中聚集。然後腦海中的那一瞬間突然消失，只剩下失憶帶來的隱隱刺痛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'115e1f7e-c1ba-4c36-9a4e-e58db7cb2357\', \'multiverseId\': 463651}, \'multiverseid\': 463651}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dem Bösen ausliefern\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu vier Karten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Falls du einen Bolas-Planeswalker kontrollierst, nimm die Karten zurück auf deine Hand. Andernfalls bestimmt ein Gegner zwei davon. Lass die bestimmten Karten in deinem Friedhof und nimm den Rest auf deine Hand.\\nSchicke Dem Bösen ausliefern ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461276&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb6e9dc0-58fc-4e3c-bd94-262eccba3e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 461276}, \'multiverseid\': 461276}, {\'name\': \'Consagrar al mal\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta cuatro cartas objetivo en tu cementerio. Si controlas un planeswalker Bolas, regresa esas cartas a tu mano. De lo contrario, un oponente elige dos de ellas. Deja las cartas elegidas en tu cementerio y pon el resto en tu mano.\\nExilia Consagrar al mal.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca82856-e01e-4aa7-9b57-60adef1d0560\', \'multiverseId\': 461540}, \'multiverseid\': 461540}, {\'name\': \'Livrer au mal\', \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à quatre cartes ciblées dans votre cimetière. Si vous contrôlez un planeswalker Bolas, renvoyez ces cartes dans votre main. Sinon, un adversaire en choisit deux. Laissez les cartes choisies dans votre cimetière et mettez le reste dans votre main.\\nExilez Livrer au mal.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9678b47a-4c50-45aa-9ee8-33bb5c74fa67\', \'multiverseId\': 461804}, \'multiverseid\': 461804}, {\'name\': \'Consegnare al Male\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a quattro carte bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Se controlli un planeswalker Bolas, riprendi in mano quelle carte. Altrimenti, un avversario ne sceglie due. Lascia le carte scelte nel tuo cimitero e aggiungi le altre alla tua mano.\\nEsilia Consegnare al Male.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f720a665-7b25-4f8e-925c-01c2ae206f03\', \'multiverseId\': 462068}, \'multiverseid\': 462068}, {\'name\': \'悪への引き渡し\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるカード最大４枚を対象とする。あなたがボーラス・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているなら、それらのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。そうでないなら、対戦相手はそのうち２枚を選ぶ。その選ばれたカードをあなたの墓地にとどめ、残りをあなたの手札に加える。\\n悪への引き渡しを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4097dc9-1da1-4357-8ebe-1a0ab714f3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 462332}, \'multiverseid\': 462332}, {\'name\': \'악한 자에게 인계\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 최대 네 장까지 목표로 정한다. 당신이 볼라스 플레인즈워커를 조종한다면, 그 카드들을 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 그렇지 않으면, 상대 한 명이 그중 두 장을 선택한다. 선택된 카드들은 당신의 무덤에 남기고 나머지 카드들을 당신의 손으로 가져간다.\\n악한 자에게 인계를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ffc6f3e-76b5-4401-8123-a028278b6d93\', \'multiverseId\': 462596}, \'multiverseid\': 462596}, {\'name\': \'Entregar ao Mal\', \'text\': \'Escolha até quatro cards alvo em seu cemitério. Se você controlar um planeswalker Nicol Bolas, devolva aqueles cards para sua mão. Caso contrário, um oponente escolhe dois deles. Deixe os cards escolhidos em seu cemitério e coloque o restante em sua mão.\\nExile Entregar ao Mal.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1136438d-d958-4cfa-ab1e-7f5394f17b29\', \'multiverseId\': 462860}, \'multiverseid\': 462860}, {\'name\': \'Низвергнуть во Зло\', \'text\': \'Выберите не более четырех целевых карт на вашем кладбище. Если под вашим контролем есть planeswalker Болас, верните те карты в вашу руку. В противном случае оппонент выбирает две из них. Оставьте выбранные карты на вашем кладбище, а остальные положите в вашу руку.\\nИзгоните Низвергнуть во Зло.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d401be-ecdf-472d-bd71-c92f52c01e39\', \'multiverseId\': 463124}, \'multiverseid\': 463124}, {\'name\': \'屈从邪恶\', \'text\': \'选择至多四张目标在你坟墓场中的牌。如果你操控波拉斯鹏洛客，则将这些牌移回你手上。若否，则任一对手从中选择两张。将所选的牌留在你的坟墓场，其余的牌则置于你的手上。\\n放逐屈从邪恶。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2969a567-24c7-4ca1-87b8-9537991b4af0\', \'multiverseId\': 463388}, \'multiverseid\': 463388}, {\'name\': \'屈從邪惡\', \'text\': \'選擇至多四張目標在你墳墓場中的牌。如果你操控波拉斯鵬洛客，則將這些牌移回你手上。若否，則任一對手從中選擇兩張。將所選的牌留在你的墳墓場，其餘的牌則置於你的手上。\\n放逐屈從邪惡。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f4e1874-1694-4b76-bea9-3e9556f3a00f\', \'multiverseId\': 463652}, \'multiverseid\': 463652}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Jedes Stück Land, das sie uns nehmen, holen wir uns entweder zurück, oder wir verwüsten es. Sie sollen nichts haben."\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461314&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b271d2ea-6930-4038-a046-6c43856ad1cb\', \'multiverseId\': 461314}, \'multiverseid\': 461314}, {\'name\': \'Demoler\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Por cada centímetro de tierra que nos quiten, lo recuperaremos o lo quemaremos. No se quedarán con nada".\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea2c578-9a74-49f2-9ee0-05434433b181\', \'multiverseId\': 461578}, \'multiverseid\': 461578}, {\'name\': \'Démolition\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Chaque centimètre de terrain qu\'ils nous prennent, nous le reprenons ou nous le brûlons. Ne leur laissons rien. »\\n—Aurélia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c99daf2-fe15-4fc1-9725-ca27a941aa98\', \'multiverseId\': 461842}, \'multiverseid\': 461842}, {\'name\': \'Frantumare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Riconquistate ogni centimetro di terra che ci sottraggono, oppure datelo alle fiamme. Non lasciate loro niente."\\n—Aurelia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132d8e00-4de1-405a-9e2e-14e5f4e713d1\', \'multiverseId\': 462106}, \'multiverseid\': 462106}, {\'name\': \'破砕\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「奪われた土地は必ず取り戻す。そうでなければ焼き尽くす。あいつらには何も渡してはならない。」\\n――オレリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01cbde9-37da-406f-8f80-3d1e095769fe\', \'multiverseId\': 462370}, \'multiverseid\': 462370}, {\'name\': \'철거\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그들이 우리의 땅을 빼앗아 가면, 되찾든지 불태워라. 아무 것도 넘겨주지 마라."\\n—아우렐리아\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a67251e9-52ea-4ea3-be5e-040bb242ac50\', \'multiverseId\': 462634}, \'multiverseid\': 462634}, {\'name\': \'Demolir\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Reconquistem cada centímetro de terra que nos tomaram ou queimem tudo. Não deixem nada para eles."\\n— Aurélia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76593116-0448-46a4-9103-05bbd0b51866\', \'multiverseId\': 462898}, \'multiverseid\': 462898}, {\'name\': \'Разрушение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждую пядь земли, которую они отняли у нас, мы заберем назад — или спалим дотла. Им не достанется ничего».\\n— Аурелия\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb074a2a-1d38-4ca9-85fb-0c910376f93b\', \'multiverseId\': 463162}, \'multiverseid\': 463162}, {\'name\': \'毁坏\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「他们从我们手中夺走的每一寸土地，抢不回来的就给我烧干净。什么都不给他们留下。」\\n～欧瑞梨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f1b1383-0d34-4581-8e11-0ad9f977f592\', \'multiverseId\': 463426}, \'multiverseid\': 463426}, {\'name\': \'毀壞\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「他們從我們手中奪走的每一寸土地，搶不回來的就給我燒乾淨。什麼都不給他們留下。」\\n～歐瑞梨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b78895a-67f3-4cd2-b3df-593f0762de08\', \'multiverseId\': 463690}, \'multiverseid\': 463690}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Signalturm entzünden\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Planeswalker-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du dich selbst nicht mehr retten kannst, kämpfst du, um anderen eine Chance zu geben."\\n—Ajani Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461209&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aae4923-b2e5-4442-b774-684f2e6998a0\', \'multiverseId\': 461209}, \'multiverseid\': 461209}, {\'name\': \'Encender la almenara\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de planeswalker, muéstralas, ponlas en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si no puedes salvarte tú, lucha para que otros tengan una oportunidad".\\n—Ajani Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edbcbc4f-7136-4380-a1d5-2ff3c2753fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 461473}, \'multiverseid\': 461473}, {\'name\': \'Allumer le flambeau\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de planeswalker, révélez-les, mettez-les dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Si on ne peut pas se sauver soi-même, on se bat pour donner une chance à quelqu\'un d\'autre. »\\n—Ajani Crinièredor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b82eeb2-ac70-41ee-8ed1-093dea844e49\', \'multiverseId\': 461737}, \'multiverseid\': 461737}, {\'name\': \'Accendere il Faro\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte planeswalker, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non puoi salvare te stesso, combatti per dare un\\\'opportunità a qualcun altro."\\n—Ajani Criniera D\\\'Oro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476fec94-385b-48c3-ac44-41451294d2c2\', \'multiverseId\': 462001}, \'multiverseid\': 462001}, {\'name\': \'狼煙上げ\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからプレインズウォーカー・カード最大２枚を探し、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「自分のことを救えないとしても、誰かにチャンスを与えるために戦うのだ。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e5e92c-d8d2-47a7-b5bb-118e4eba8655\', \'multiverseId\': 462265}, \'multiverseid\': 462265}, {\'name\': \'봉화 밝히기\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 플레인즈워커 카드를 최대 두 장까지 찾아, 그 카드들을 공개하고, 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"살아남을 수 없다면, 다른 이들에게 기회를 주기 위해 싸워라."\\n—아자니 골드메인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65413bbc-0e40-48a3-9567-1a1d6ff66603\', \'multiverseId\': 462529}, \'multiverseid\': 462529}, {\'name\': \'Inflamar o Farol\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de planeswalker em seu grimório, revele-os, coloque-os em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se não pode salvar a si mesmo, você luta para dar uma chance a outra pessoa."\\n— Ajani Juba D\\\'ouro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e9c3dc-0a37-475d-afe7-95e8dcd787fd\', \'multiverseId\': 462793}, \'multiverseid\': 462793}, {\'name\': \'Зажечь Маяк\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт planeswalker-ов, покажите их, положите их в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Если не можешь спастись сам, ты сражаешься, чтобы дать шанс на спасение другому».\\n— Златогривый Аджани\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab905059-b442-45a5-9b2e-b97b24306efb\', \'multiverseId\': 463057}, \'multiverseid\': 463057}, {\'name\': \'燃亮信标\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张鹏洛客牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你自己劫数难逃，那就为让他人能够逃出生天而努力奋战。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28b349aa-abac-43d0-bd6d-1b0907a23bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 463321}, \'multiverseid\': 463321}, {\'name\': \'燃亮信標\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張鵬洛客牌，展示這些牌，將它們置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你自己劫數難逃，那就為讓他人能夠逃出生天而努力奮戰。」\\n～金鬃阿耶尼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4415562-cef4-42e7-83f0-25ced08dd166\', \'multiverseId\': 463585}, \'multiverseid\': 463585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Zauber des Ältesten\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine beliebige Anzahl an Planeswalkern deiner Wahl. Bestimme einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst. Lege für jeden Planeswalker, der auf diese Weise zerstört wurde, zwei Loyalitätsmarken auf den bestimmten Planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der Weg zur Macht ist gepflastert mit Gräueltaten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461280&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495be437-fcd8-4500-9f35-409b3f65ca29\', \'multiverseId\': 461280}, \'multiverseid\': 461280}, {\'name\': \'El Hechizo del Anciano\', \'text\': \'Destruye cualquier cantidad de planeswalkers objetivo. Elige un planeswalker que controlas. Pon dos contadores de lealtad sobre él por cada planeswalker destruido de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El ascenso al poder suele estar sembrado de atrocidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5fe0ab2-c44e-44b0-acf3-c160deb1d98c\', \'multiverseId\': 461544}, \'multiverseid\': 461544}, {\'name\': \'Le Sort ancestral\', \'text\': "Détruisez n\'importe quel nombre de planeswalkers ciblés. Choisissez un planeswalker que vous contrôlez. Mettez deux marqueurs « loyauté » sur lui pour chaque planeswalker détruit de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La route du pouvoir est souvent pavée d\'atrocités.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a67a10-8b68-4842-9142-81776687b51d\', \'multiverseId\': 461808}, \'multiverseid\': 461808}, {\'name\': "L\'Incantesimo dell\'Antico", \'text\': \'Distruggi un qualsiasi numero di planeswalker bersaglio. Scegli un planeswalker che controlli. Metti due segnalini fedeltà su di esso per ogni planeswalker distrutto in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Spesso il cammino verso il potere è costellato di atrocità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e02d2c2-2c51-4f6a-9c9e-729c82530cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 462072}, \'multiverseid\': 462072}, {\'name\': \'古呪\', \'text\': \'望む数のプレインズウォーカーを対象とし、それらを破壊する。あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体を選ぶ。それの上に、これにより破壊されたプレインズウォーカー１体につき２個の忠誠カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'権力へ至る道には残虐行為が敷き詰められている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4e0fe87-31ad-405f-81fc-f84f49f5e113\', \'multiverseId\': 462336}, \'multiverseid\': 462336}, {\'name\': \'고대주문\', \'text\': \'플레인즈워커를 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 플레인즈워커들을 파괴한다. 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커 한 개를 선택한다. 이렇게 파괴된 플레인즈워커 한 개마다 그 플레인즈워커에 충성 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'힘으로 향하는 길은 종종 참혹한 만행으로 점철되어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f79d64-6f66-4049-8b76-4dd42d10e371\', \'multiverseId\': 462600}, \'multiverseid\': 462600}, {\'name\': \'A Ancianomancia\', \'text\': \'Destrua qualquer número de planeswalkers alvo. Escolha um planeswalker que você controla. Coloque dois marcadores de lealdade nele para cada planeswalker destruído desta forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O caminho para o poder muitas vezes passa por atrocidades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'305b6a30-92b2-47cd-a3f1-647eef178ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 462864}, \'multiverseid\': 462864}, {\'name\': \'Заклинание Старейшин\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте любое количество целевых planeswalker-ов. Выберите planeswalker-а под вашим контролем. Положите на него по два жетона верности за каждого planeswalker-а, уничтоженного таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Дорога к могуществу зачастую вымощена чудовищными зверствами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17d6154e-f581-4701-9dd2-55687376c3e4\', \'multiverseId\': 463128}, \'multiverseid\': 463128}, {\'name\': \'至尊咒\', \'text\': \'消灭任意数量的目标鹏洛客。选择一个由你操控的鹏洛客。在它上面放置若干忠诚指示物，其数量等同于以此法消灭之鹏洛客数量的两倍。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'权力之道往往以暴行铺就。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa29542b-04d9-4c32-a883-675c4c1fba4e\', \'multiverseId\': 463392}, \'multiverseid\': 463392}, {\'name\': \'至尊咒\', \'text\': \'消滅任意數量的目標鵬洛客。選擇一個由你操控的鵬洛客。在它上面放置若干忠誠指示物，其數量等同於以此法消滅之鵬洛客數量的兩倍。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'權力之道往往以暴行鋪就。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284705f3-3696-4987-9390-402e77bea183\', \'multiverseId\': 463656}, \'multiverseid\': 463656}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Statue stürzen\', \'text\': \'Tappe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Falls sie ein Artefakt ist, zerstöre sie.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bolas machte sich nichts daraus, als seine Statue fiel. Er hielt es für eine willkommene Ablenkung und unterschätzte, wie viel Mut seine Gegner bei dem Anblick schöpfen würden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461226&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d3e388-3763-41a8-ada9-d5af6b89a84c\', \'multiverseId\': 461226}, \'multiverseid\': 461226}, {\'name\': \'Derribar la estatua\', \'text\': \'Gira el permanente objetivo. Si es un artefacto, destrúyelo.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'A Nicol Bolas poco le importó que su estatua cayera; pensó que era una distracción útil. Sin embargo, subestimó la resolución que este hecho otorgó a sus adversarios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cf4d4c9-2a05-4e72-8524-84a8b001e50f\', \'multiverseId\': 461490}, \'multiverseid\': 461490}, {\'name\': \'Renverser la statue\', \'text\': "Engagez le permanent ciblé. Si c\'est un artefact, détruisez-le.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La destruction de sa statue laissa Bolas de marbre, jugeant que c\'était une distraction utile, sous-estimant le regain de volonté que cela conféra à ses opposants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461754&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8530cc3f-92a5-49ff-b68e-b0ce0f530ede\', \'multiverseId\': 461754}, \'multiverseid\': 461754}, {\'name\': \'Abbattere la Statua\', \'text\': \'TAPpa un permanente bersaglio. Se è un artefatto, distruggilo.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Bolas non si preoccupò quando la sua statua cadde, ritenendolo un diversivo utile e sottovalutando l\'impeto di determinazione che diede ai suoi avversari.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8681ca0-1966-4462-8e33-a8f760bd6896\', \'multiverseId\': 462018}, \'multiverseid\': 462018}, {\'name\': \'立像崩し\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをタップする。それがアーティファクトであるなら、それを破壊する。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ボーラスは自分の立像が倒されても気にしなかった。有効な気分転換と考え、その結果自分の敵の間に決意の奔流が巻き起こるとは思っていなかったのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b32d154-b9c3-48f8-8ce2-71d5f2c96e0f\', \'multiverseId\': 462282}, \'multiverseid\': 462282}, {\'name\': \'석상 넘어뜨리기\', \'text\': \'지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 탭한다. 그 지속물이 마법물체라면, 그 지속물을 파괴한다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'볼라스는 자신의 석상이 쓰러짐으로써 자신의 적들이 다진 결의를 효과적인 시선 돌리기라고 생각하며 그다지 신경쓰지 않았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb67253-aa2c-47cf-ac86-9f79c44617d1\', \'multiverseId\': 462546}, \'multiverseid\': 462546}, {\'name\': \'Derrubar a Estátua\', \'text\': \'Vire a permanente alvo. Se ela for um artefato, destrua-a.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nicol Bolas não se preocupou muito quando a própria estátua caiu. Considerou uma distração útil, subestimando a determinação que a queda instigou em seus oponentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'614f158b-4069-4197-92b0-28fa177eecb9\', \'multiverseId\': 462810}, \'multiverseid\': 462810}, {\'name\': \'Свалить Статую\', \'text\': \'Поверните целевой перманент. Если это артефакт, уничтожьте его.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Болас не придал значения падению своей статуи, подумав, что это только отвлечет врагов. Он недооценил тот прилив воодушевления, что они испытали.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11c9c8f1-2dc9-46a2-867f-7f61221b2845\', \'multiverseId\': 463074}, \'multiverseid\': 463074}, {\'name\': \'推倒塑像\', \'text\': \'横置目标永久物。如果它是神器，则消灭之。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'波拉斯眼见大军推翻自己塑像，只当它成功拖住敌军脚步而不以为意，却忽略了对方由此涌升的必胜信念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e90dd2-a588-40c5-bebb-70e3797b5ab5\', \'multiverseId\': 463338}, \'multiverseid\': 463338}, {\'name\': \'推倒塑像\', \'text\': \'橫置目標永久物。如果它是神器，則消滅之。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'波拉斯眼見大軍推翻自己塑像，只當它成功拖住敵軍腳步而不以為意，卻忽略了對方由此湧升的必勝信念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5de1f2b0-d87d-4aa4-86cd-78585a1ad723\', \'multiverseId\': 463602}, \'multiverseid\': 463602}]', "[{'name': 'Die Wanderin', 'text': 'Verhindere allen Nicht-Kampfschaden, der dir und anderen bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\\n−2: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder mehr ins Exil.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461228&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b51838d-6afc-4976-8d2e-99425530c1cd', 'multiverseId': 461228}, 'multiverseid': 461228}, {'name': 'La Errante', 'text': 'Prevén todo el daño que no sea de combate que se te fuera a hacer a ti y a otros permanentes que controlas.\\n−2: Exilia la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o más.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461492&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fe4ff5d-943e-44e7-944b-5f3c2ab00688', 'multiverseId': 461492}, 'multiverseid': 461492}, {'name': 'La Vagabonde', 'text': 'Prévenez toutes les blessures non-combat qui devraient être infligées à vous et aux autres permanents que vous contrôlez.\\n-2 : Exilez une créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461756&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0ddc4f8-a242-410c-b88a-e1fee0b08388', 'multiverseId': 461756}, 'multiverseid': 461756}, {'name': 'La Viandante', 'text': 'Previeni tutto il danno non da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto a te e agli altri permanenti che controlli.\\n-2: Esilia una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462020&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '554ee189-7387-42ff-92d5-99adfdc4727f', 'multiverseId': 462020}, 'multiverseid': 462020}, {'name': '放浪者', 'text': 'あなたや、あなたがコントロールしている他のパーマネントに与えられる、戦闘ダメージでないダメージをすべて軽減する。\\n-2：パワーが４以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462284&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ffc2d5c-feb3-47c1-bd4b-0f26b00bd527', 'multiverseId': 462284}, 'multiverseid': 462284}, {'name': '방랑자', 'text': '당신과 당신이 조종하는 다른 지속물들에 입혀지려 하는 모든 비전투피해를 방지한다.\\n−2: 공격력이 4 이상인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.', 'type': '전설적 플레인즈워커', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462548&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd777a419-d14e-405f-9563-c146de1ce6ff', 'multiverseId': 462548}, 'multiverseid': 462548}, {'name': 'A Errante', 'text': 'Previna todo dano que não seja de combate que seria causado a você e a outras permanentes que você controla.\\n−2: Exile a criatura alvo com poder igual ou superior a 4.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Lendário', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462812&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dea7f54-c137-46e1-b7b7-464c5cb887ee', 'multiverseId': 462812}, 'multiverseid': 462812}, {'name': 'Странница', 'text': 'Предотвратите все небоевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены вам и другим перманентам под вашим контролем.\\n—2: изгоните целевое существо с силой 4 или больше.', 'type': 'Легендарный Planeswalker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463076&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '323d07d1-e6b1-4439-895b-cd7ed86d48b4', 'multiverseId': 463076}, 'multiverseid': 463076}, {'name': '飘萍', 'text': '防止将对你和由你操控之其他永久物造成的所有非战斗伤害。\\n−2：放逐目标力量等于或大于4的生物。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463340&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '835bef02-02ed-4f8f-99ed-f09eb972d26a', 'multiverseId': 463340}, 'multiverseid': 463340}, {'name': '飄萍', 'text': '防止將對你和由你操控之其他永久物造成的所有非戰鬥傷害。\\n−2：放逐目標力量等於或大於4的生物。', 'type': '傳奇鵬洛客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463604&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0a9a638-7e46-4e3c-818b-d920a6336d07', 'multiverseId': 463604}, 'multiverseid': 463604}]", "[{'name': 'Domri, Anarchist des Bolas', 'text': 'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\\n+1: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}. Kreaturenzauber, die du in diesem Zug wirkst, können nicht neutralisiert werden.\\n−2: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Domri', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461382&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8bdd711-784b-447a-a6d2-6ac36841ffdc', 'multiverseId': 461382}, 'multiverseid': 461382}, {'name': 'Domri, anarquista de Nicol Bolas', 'text': 'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0.\\n+1: Agrega {R} o {G}. Los hechizos de criatura que lances este turno no pueden ser contrarrestados.\\n−2: La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Domri', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461646&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab245362-c686-4ee7-9ea4-d692c9677422', 'multiverseId': 461646}, 'multiverseid': 461646}, {'name': 'Domri, anarchiste de Bolas', 'text': 'Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0.\\n+1 : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}. Les sorts de créature que vous lancez ce tour-ci ne peuvent pas être contrecarrés.\\n-2 : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Domri', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461910&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9aa7c5b2-12dc-4031-a28a-f0a0ba1916c8', 'multiverseId': 461910}, 'multiverseid': 461910}, {'name': 'Domri, Anarchico di Bolas', 'text': 'Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+0.\\n+1: Aggiungi {R} o {G}. Le magie creatura che lanci in questo turno non possono essere neutralizzate.\\n-2: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Domri', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462174&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd75e7245-2172-4d5f-a847-aa58bbb03ceb', 'multiverseId': 462174}, 'multiverseid': 462174}, {'name': 'ボーラスの壊乱者、ドムリ', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n+1：{R}か{G}を加える。このターン、あなたが唱えるクリーチャー・呪文は打ち消されない。\\n-2：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ドムリ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462438&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b0258ee-e314-4eb9-9bd5-ce609eb813f3', 'multiverseId': 462438}, 'multiverseid': 462438}, {'name': '볼라스의 반란 주모자, 돔리', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 생물들은 +1/+0을 받는다.\\n+1: {R} 또는 {G}를 추가한다. 이번 턴에 당신이 발동하는 생물 주문들은 무효화될 수 없다.\\n−2: 당신이 조종하는 생물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다.', 'type': '전설적 플레인즈워커 — 돔리', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462702&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ef7efd9-1e56-4fed-a5c3-85a3259b2835', 'multiverseId': 462702}, 'multiverseid': 462702}, {'name': 'Domri, Anarquista de Nicol Bolas', 'text': 'As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+0.\\n+1: Adicione {R} ou {G}. As mágicas de criatura que você conjura neste turno não podem ser anuladas.\\n−2: A criatura alvo que você controla luta contra a criatura alvo que você não controla.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Lendário — Domri', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462966&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d36994d-1a24-4362-bc2b-9463c95bbd8c', 'multiverseId': 462966}, 'multiverseid': 462966}, {'name': 'Домри, Анарх Боласа', 'text': 'Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+0.\\n+1: добавьте {R} или {G}. Заклинания существ, которые вы разыгрываете в этом ходу, не могут быть отменены.\\n—2: целевое существо под вашим контролем дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Легендарный Planeswalker — Домри', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463230&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9b0360d-7e42-4f67-b270-298a0d62dab3', 'multiverseId': 463230}, 'multiverseid': 463230}, {'name': '波拉斯逆竖多密', 'text': '由你操控的生物得+1/+0。\\n+1：加{R}或{G}。本回合中，你施放的生物咒语不能被反击。\\n−2：目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～多密', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463494&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '129448ee-f3df-4416-891f-f9cbaf82e0bd', 'multiverseId': 463494}, 'multiverseid': 463494}, {'name': '波拉斯逆豎多密', 'text': '由你操控的生物得+1/+0。\\n+1：加{R}或{G}。本回合中，你施放的生物咒語不能被反擊。\\n−2：目標由你操控的生物與目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。', 'type': '傳奇鵬洛客 ～多密', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463758&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '702e9bac-8148-45a7-86a1-6b8705d75dda', 'multiverseId': 463758}, 'multiverseid': 463758}]", '[{\'name\': \'Domris Hinterhalt\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Dann fügt sie einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Zivilisation am Abgrund steht, werde ich ihr zum nächsten Schritt verhelfen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461383&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e58df104-2087-4633-b2af-be15a6e22d48\', \'multiverseId\': 461383}, \'multiverseid\': 461383}, {\'name\': \'Emboscada de Domri\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas. Luego, esa criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando la civilización esté al borde del abismo, yo estaré ahí para darle una patada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc346a1-6e40-41aa-a1b9-56e81d6059db\', \'multiverseId\': 461647}, \'multiverseid\': 461647}, {\'name\': \'Embuscade de Domri\', \'text\': \'Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Ensuite, cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée ou à un planeswalker ciblé que vous ne contrôlez pas.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Quand la civilisation sera sur le point de s\'effondrer, je serai là pour lui asséner le coup de grâce. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55c637b8-d798-4c2b-982d-be86da3de691\', \'multiverseId\': 461911}, \'multiverseid\': 461911}, {\'name\': \'Imboscata di Domri\', \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Poi quella creatura infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando la civiltà sarà sull\\\'orlo del baratro, sarò lì per darle la spinta finale."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a28d9ce-3f1f-4721-9c68-062c60461dce\', \'multiverseId\': 462175}, \'multiverseid\': 462175}, {\'name\': \'ドムリの待ち伏せ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャーかプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。その前者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その後、その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「文明が崩壊の瀬戸際にあるのなら、俺が蹴飛ばしてけりを付けてやるさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b3a5af-56fc-4651-98af-ab9da0ddbbf3\', \'multiverseId\': 462439}, \'multiverseid\': 462439}, {\'name\': \'돔리의 매복\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 그 후 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표는 두 번째 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"문명이 벼랑 끝에 선 위태로운 상태가 되면, 내가 걷어차서 마무리를 해 주겠어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f950b788-8ca8-48f5-b3e4-e68ae3b6ccc1\', \'multiverseId\': 462703}, \'multiverseid\': 462703}, {\'name\': \'Emboscada de Domri\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla. Em seguida, aquela criatura causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao próprio poder à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando a civilização estiver à beira do abismo, eu vou estar lá para dar o chute final."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7425dc30-1f74-44cd-beb3-8c52aaaa8009\', \'multiverseId\': 462967}, \'multiverseid\': 462967}, {\'name\': \'Засада Домри\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо под вашим контролем. Затем то существо наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, целевому существу или planeswalker-у не под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда цивилизация окажется на краю пропасти, я буду рядом, чтобы дать ей хорошего пинка».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ccd81d-bffa-4fcf-900b-1c3667d38d92\', \'multiverseId\': 463231}, \'multiverseid\': 463231}, {\'name\': \'多密的伏击\', \'text\': \'在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后该生物对目标不由你操控的生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「文明在崩溃边缘时，我就会去把它踢下深渊。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6f88f63-22dd-47ef-a6b7-555fd3cc9d75\', \'multiverseId\': 463495}, \'multiverseid\': 463495}, {\'name\': \'多密的伏擊\', \'text\': \'在目標由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。然後該生物對目標不由你操控的生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「文明在崩潰邊緣時，我就會去把它踢下深淵。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e0fae6-c614-4e34-9d6f-de2f07e76164\', \'multiverseId\': 463759}, \'multiverseid\': 463759}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernder Ceratops\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Donnernde Ceratops ins Spiel kommt, verursachen andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nashorn\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich dachte, dies wäre eine zivilisierte Welt. Warum gibt es dann so viele wilde Bestien hier?"\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f937a9e-4d0d-4902-a2e4-ead8caff5560\', \'multiverseId\': 461370}, \'multiverseid\': 461370}, {\'name\': \'Ceratok retumbante\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Ceratok retumbante entre al campo de batalla, las otras criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'"Pensaba que este era un plano civilizado. ¿Cómo es que hay tantas bestias salvajes?".\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b387cabd-cf4d-49a8-a56d-57219f37141f\', \'multiverseId\': 461634}, \'multiverseid\': 461634}, {\'name\': \'Cératok fulminant\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand le Cératok fulminant arrive sur le champ de bataille, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : rhinocéros\', \'flavor\': \'« Je croyais me trouver sur un plan civilisé. Pourquoi y a-t-il autant de bêtes sauvages ? »\\n—Dovin Baàn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461898&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'917172b9-5e26-4da9-8c46-849d2bb1cd4b\', \'multiverseId\': 461898}, \'multiverseid\': 461898}, {\'name\': \'Ceratok Roboante\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Ceratok Roboante entra nel campo di battaglia, le altre creature che controlli hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'"Pensavo che questo fosse un piano civilizzato. Come mai ci sono così tante bestie feroci?"\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5046cfa6-35fd-4594-95e6-5f9c1bc42f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 462162}, \'multiverseid\': 462162}, {\'name\': \'轟く角獣\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n轟く角獣が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイ\', \'flavor\': \'「ここは文明の進んだ次元と聞いていたが。なぜあれほどたくさんの野獣が存在するのだ？」\\n――ドビン・バーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2edc84f-216e-4097-aab2-ac33c3226173\', \'multiverseId\': 462426}, \'multiverseid\': 462426}, {\'name\': \'지축을 울리는 케라톡\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n지축을 울리는 케라톡이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코뿔소\', \'flavor\': \'"이곳은 문명화된 차원이라고 생각했는데. 어떻게 흉포한 야수들이 이리 많은 것이지?"\\n—도빈 반\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'163b7b31-73fc-4b6f-8ea4-68a2ea0406f5\', \'multiverseId\': 462690}, \'multiverseid\': 462690}, {\'name\': \'Ceratok Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Ceratok Trovejante entra no campo de batalha, as outras criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'"Achei que este fosse um plano civilizado. Como é possível haver tantos animais selvagens?"\\n— Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b40c3a-103c-40e7-888e-0d4c47e71231\', \'multiverseId\': 462954}, \'multiverseid\': 462954}, {\'name\': \'Громыхающий Цераток\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Громыхающий Цераток выходит на поле битвы, другие существа под вашим контролем получают Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Носорог\', \'flavor\': \'«Я думал, это цивилизованный мир. Откуда тут столько диких зверей?»\\n— Довин Баан\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebfd2658-2348-4a10-bfd6-97d11f43027b\', \'multiverseId\': 463218}, \'multiverseid\': 463218}, {\'name\': \'雷动冠角牛\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当雷动冠角牛进战场时，由你操控的其他生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～犀牛\', \'flavor\': \'「我原以为这是个文明时空。但为何会有如此多的狂暴野兽？」\\n～多温班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a5e75a3-ccac-44cd-aed0-486d5fa42a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 463482}, \'multiverseid\': 463482}, {\'name\': \'雷動冠角牛\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當雷動冠角牛進戰場時，由你操控的其他生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～犀牛\', \'flavor\': \'「我原以為這是個文明時空。但為何會有如此多的狂暴野獸？」\\n～多溫班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a918fc-4939-4531-bd38-1748332cd18b\', \'multiverseId\': 463746}, \'multiverseid\': 463746}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dovin, Hand der Kontrolle\', \'text\': \'Artefaktzauber, Spontanzauber und Hexereien, die deine Gegner wirken, kosten beim Wirken {1} mehr.\\n−1: Verhindere bis zu deinem nächsten Zug allen Schaden, der einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, zugefügt und von ihr zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af040283-f7a1-4854-87c5-80ee870f3a52\', \'multiverseId\': 461420}, \'multiverseid\': 461420}, {\'name\': \'Dovin, Mano del Control\', \'text\': \'A tus oponentes les cuesta {1} más lanzar hechizos de artefacto, de instantáneo y de conjuro.\\n−1: Hasta tu próximo turno, prevén todo el daño que fuera a hacer y que se le fuera a hacer al permanente objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6d37b6-4ff7-43da-9aa3-ce6e50515769\', \'multiverseId\': 461684}, \'multiverseid\': 461684}, {\'name\': \'Dovin, autorité du contrôle\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'artefact, d\'éphémère et de rituel que vos adversaires lancent coûtent {1} de plus à lancer.\\n-1 : Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à et par un permanent ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461948&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c88e282b-2a63-462a-a1a3-148abc13b202\', \'multiverseId\': 461948}, \'multiverseid\': 461948}, {\'name\': \'Dovin, Strumento di Controllo\', \'text\': \'Le magie artefatto, istantaneo e stregoneria che lanciano i tuoi avversari costano {1} in più per essere lanciate.\\n-1: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto a e da un permanente bersaglio controllato da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca445384-7a38-4294-bf6e-63e2a20169da\', \'multiverseId\': 462212}, \'multiverseid\': 462212}, {\'name\': \'支配の片腕、ドビン\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がアーティファクトやインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}多くなる。\\n-1：対戦相手がコントロールしているパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたの次のターンまで、それに与えられるダメージとそれが与えるダメージをすべて軽減する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ドビン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5cf78c1-3cd2-4b34-9fee-08cc528a7ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 462476}, \'multiverseid\': 462476}, {\'name\': \'조종하는 손, 도빈\', \'text\': \'상대가 발동하는 마법물체, 순간마법 및 집중마법 주문은 발동하는 데 {1}이 더 든다.\\n-1: 상대가 조종하는 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 당신의 다음 턴까지, 그 지속물이 입거나 입히려고 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 도빈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e0f1cb-18a8-488c-910f-25d1dddc49dd\', \'multiverseId\': 462740}, \'multiverseid\': 462740}, {\'name\': \'Dovin, Mão do Controle\', \'text\': \'Os artefatos, as mágicas instantâneas e os feitiços que seus oponentes conjuram custam {1} a mais para serem conjurados.\\n−1: Até o seu próximo turno, previna todo o dano que seria causado e sofrido pela permanente alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Dovin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979978e2-1f70-45e6-a464-f218b222c6e8\', \'multiverseId\': 463004}, \'multiverseid\': 463004}, {\'name\': \'Довин, Рука Власти\', \'text\': \'Заклинания артефактов, волшебства и мгновенные заклинания, разыгрываемые вашими оппонентами, стоят на {1} больше.\\n—1: до вашего следующего хода предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть получены и нанесены целевым перманентом под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Довин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12ed2b5-5b81-46ae-b1c7-2c495889a7d0\', \'multiverseId\': 463268}, \'multiverseid\': 463268}, {\'name\': \'操控之手多温\', \'text\': \'对手施放的神器、瞬间和法术咒语增加{1}来施放。\\n-1：直到你的下一个回合，防止目标由对手操控的永久物将受到或造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～多温\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'823f0423-4f3f-4fb0-b006-8b8dc95df456\', \'multiverseId\': 463532}, \'multiverseid\': 463532}, {\'name\': \'操控之手多溫\', \'text\': \'對手施放的神器、瞬間和巫術咒語增加{1}來施放。\\n-1：直到你的下一個回合，防止目標由對手操控的永久物將受到或造成的所有傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～多溫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'514b7fba-e1c4-4335-8525-804b84b828b4\', \'multiverseId\': 463796}, \'multiverseid\': 463796}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dovins Veto\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nNeutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie ich sehe, hast du nichts gelernt, Chandra. Immer noch zündest du lieber alles an, als es zu verstehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461384&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b445a9-04b4-4973-b061-018d3d332e63\', \'multiverseId\': 461384}, \'multiverseid\': 461384}, {\'name\': \'Veto de Dovin\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Veo que no aprendiste nada, Chandra. Aún prefieres prender fuego las cosas antes que entenderlas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee8d75c-c430-40cd-81c3-569a592a1075\', \'multiverseId\': 461648}, \'multiverseid\': 461648}, {\'name\': \'Véto de Dovin\', \'text\': \'Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nContrecarrez le sort non-créature ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je vois que tu n\'as rien appris, Chandra. Tu préfères mettre le feu à une situation plutôt que de la comprendre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3afbcf03-6e10-4bf9-9942-fcb6ea2a9728\', \'multiverseId\': 461912}, \'multiverseid\': 461912}, {\'name\': \'Veto di Dovin\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nNeutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vedo che non hai imparato niente, Chandra. Preferisci ancora dare alle fiamme le cose anziché capirle."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e402f7-8af7-4362-bec5-903e4031f76d\', \'multiverseId\': 462176}, \'multiverseid\': 462176}, {\'name\': \'ドビンの拒否権\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「君は何も学ばないな、チャンドラ。今でも君は理解しようとせずに、ただ何かを燃やしているだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'958b3d0d-cce8-4362-b942-cc58a2a274b1\', \'multiverseId\': 462440}, \'multiverseid\': 462440}, {\'name\': \'도빈의 거부\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 무효화될 수 없다.\\n생물 주문이 아닌 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"찬드라, 넌 배운 게 아무 것도 없군. 아직도 뭔가를 이해하지는 않고 거기에 불을 붙이기만 할 뿐이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a730ae5a-9d65-451e-a33a-a531053efbe9\', \'multiverseId\': 462704}, \'multiverseid\': 462704}, {\'name\': \'Veto de Dovin\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nAnule a mágica alvo que não seja de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vejo que você não aprendeu nada, Chandra. Você ainda prefere atear fogo a alguma coisa em vez de entendê-la."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046ec26b-6866-40c6-811e-f4172eac6e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 462968}, \'multiverseid\': 462968}, {\'name\': \'Вето Довина\', \'text\': \'Это заклинание не может быть отменено.\\nОтмените целевое не являющееся существом заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я вижу, что ты так ничему и не научилась, Чандра. Ты до сих пор предпочитаешь поджигать то, что встречаешь на пути, а не пытаешься понять его».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19dda233-5e5f-4633-aa05-70aa08da8186\', \'multiverseId\': 463232}, \'multiverseid\': 463232}, {\'name\': \'多温的否决\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n反击目标非生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你好像没有吸取教训，茜卓。你还是想把问题一烧了事，而从没尝试着去了解它。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9b82213-6870-472e-8f79-796bc9093f37\', \'multiverseId\': 463496}, \'multiverseid\': 463496}, {\'name\': \'多溫的否決\', \'text\': \'此咒語不能被反擊。\\n反擊目標非生物咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「你好像沒有吸取教訓，茜卓。你還是想把問題一燒了事，而從沒嘗試著去瞭解它。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be1d3a08-772c-4cfa-822d-e3342b0cd29d\', \'multiverseId\': 463760}, \'multiverseid\': 463760}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerhüllenagentin\', \'text\': \'Die Dämmerhüllenagentin kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 4 oder mehr nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Gideon sah den Dimir-Gesandten argwöhnisch an. „Können eure Agenten in Bolas\\\' Zitadelle gelangen?"\\nDie Gestalt hielt seinem Blick eisig stand. „Wir sind längst drin."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461279&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce59bb97-6f60-427f-8e78-89bc89fea638\', \'multiverseId\': 461279}, \'multiverseid\': 461279}, {\'name\': \'Agente de Mantoscuro\', \'text\': \'La Agente de Mantoscuro no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'Gideon observó con desconfianza a la emisaria dimir.\\n—¿Tus agentes podrían colarse en la ciudadela de Nicol Bolas?\\nLa figura le devolvió la mirada con gélida resolución.\\n—Ya lo hemos hecho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b257fc2-e27d-44ba-90fc-191a23a99e68\', \'multiverseId\': 461543}, \'multiverseid\': 461543}, {\'name\': \'Agente de Manteaubrune\', \'text\': "L\'Agente de Manteaubrune ne peut pas être bloquée par des créatures de force supérieure ou égale à 4.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Gideon lança un regard circonspect à l\'émissaire de Dimir. « Vos agents pourraient s\'introduire dans la citadelle de Bolas ? »\\nLa silhouette soutint son regard avec une volonté de fer. « C\'est déjà fait. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26f28122-e90d-4e09-b8cf-3a824e8ec6f5\', \'multiverseId\': 461807}, \'multiverseid\': 461807}, {\'name\': \'Agente di Mantoscuro\', \'text\': "L\'Agente di Mantoscuro non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o superiore a 4.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gideon rivolse un\\\'occhiata diffidente all\\\'emissaria Dimir. "I vostri agenti potrebbero infiltrarsi nella cittadella di Bolas?"\\nLa figura rispose al suo guardo con determinazione glaciale. "L\\\'abbiamo già fatto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddf91e9-52ab-4b69-99ec-97d139350c32\', \'multiverseId\': 462071}, \'multiverseid\': 462071}, {\'name\': \'ダスクマントルの調査員\', \'text\': \'ダスクマントルの調査員は、パワーが４以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'ギデオンはディミーアの使者を疑わしげに見た。「あなたがたの工作員がボーラスの城塞に入り込めるとでも言うのですか？」\\nその人物は冷たい確固たる態度でその視線を受け止めた。「もう入り込んでいますよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c82ef3c7-7353-4182-90ad-7693b1d5250b\', \'multiverseId\': 462335}, \'multiverseid\': 462335}, {\'name\': \'더스크맨틀 첩보원\', \'text\': \'더스크맨틀 첩보원은 공격력이 4 이상인 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': \'기디온은 걱정스럽게 디미르 사절을 쳐다보았다. "자네의 요원들이 볼라스의 요새 안에 들어갈 수 있나?"\\n그 형체는 얼음장같은 결의와 함께 그의 시선을 마주했다. "이미 들어가 있지요."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a84c984c-8e6e-4575-aad7-6c84afb73e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 462599}, \'multiverseid\': 462599}, {\'name\': \'Agente do Manto do Crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Agente do Manto do Crepúsculo não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com poder igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Gideon olhou com desconfiança para a emissária Dimir. "Seus agentes conseguiriam entrar na cidadela de Nicol Bolas!?"\\nEla o encarou com gélida determinação. "Já entramos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=462863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f072a989-9951-44b7-aeac-e0bbd2858579\', \'multiverseId\': 462863}, \'multiverseid\': 462863}, {\'name\': \'Агент Мантии Сумрака\', \'text\': \'Агент Мантии Сумрака не может быть заблокирован существами с силой 4 или больше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Смогут ли ваши агенты проникнуть в цитадель Боласа?» — пристально взглянул на посланницу Димиров Гидеон.\\nТа встретила его взгляд с ледяной решимостью: «Мы уже это сделали».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bdf7015-1624-4bbc-9d6a-e3fe91965042\', \'multiverseId\': 463127}, \'multiverseid\': 463127}, {\'name\': \'暮篷特务\', \'text\': \'暮篷特务不能被力量等于或大于4的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'基定怀疑地看着底密尔密使：「你们的密探能不能进到波拉斯尊殿中一探究竟？」\\n对方直视基定目光，冷冰冰地回道：「我们已经去过了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bdb63c7-18f6-4fc6-8901-b5f7561df057\', \'multiverseId\': 463391}, \'multiverseid\': 463391}, {\'name\': \'暮篷特務\', \'text\': \'暮篷特務不能被力量等於或大於4的生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'基定懷疑地看著底密爾密使：「你們的密探能不能進到波拉斯尊殿中一探究竟？」\\n對方直視基定目光，冷冰冰地回道：「我們已經去過了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=463655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0920107-b990-4340-b003-0023b42e1600\', \'multiverseId\': 463655}, \'multiverseid\': 463655}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461441&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd11d19e2-def3-4953-89c0-57e5ae7987b7', 'multiverseId': 461441}, 'multiverseid': 461441}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461705&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47139254-5254-44d8-a1c3-0b47c1a031f9', 'multiverseId': 461705}, 'multiverseid': 461705}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=461969&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abae91fa-3732-4d5c-9e9e-9e97a